cw_city_places	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.200\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.100\nWelcome to our Dutch lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.960\nWelkom bij de les!\n\n4\n00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.560\nToday we learn city places.\n\n5\n00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.640\nWe leren over de stad.\n\n6\n00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.320\nAre you ready?\n\n7\n00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.440\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n8\n00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.921\nFirst, we have the supermarket.\n\n9\n00:00:22.961 --> 00:00:26.221\nIk ga naar de supermarkt.\n\n10\n00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:29.121\nI go to the supermarket.\n\n11\n00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:32.741\nIk koop brood in de supermarkt.\n\n12\n00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:36.261\nI buy bread in the supermarket.\n\n13\n00:00:36.301 --> 00:00:39.041\nNext is the library.\n\n14\n00:00:39.101 --> 00:00:42.301\nIk ben in de bibliotheek.\n\n15\n00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:45.541\nI am in the library.\n\n16\n00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:49.381\nIk lees een boek in de bibliotheek.\n\n17\n00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:52.841\nI read a book in the library.\n\n18\n00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:55.741\nNow we have the hospital.\n\n19\n00:00:55.781 --> 00:01:00.621\nHet ziekenhuis is erg groot.\n\n20\n00:01:00.641 --> 00:01:03.861\nThe hospital is very big.\n\n21\n00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:08.202\nDe dokter werkt in het ziekenhuis.\n\n22\n00:01:08.222 --> 00:01:11.662\nThe doctor works in the hospital.\n\n23\n00:01:11.742 --> 00:01:15.682\nOur next word is the post office.\n\n24\n00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.962\nWaar is het postkantoor?\n\n25\n00:01:19.002 --> 00:01:21.782\nWhere is the post office?\n\n26\n00:01:21.842 --> 00:01:26.042\nIk stuur een brief op het postkantoor.\n\n27\n00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:29.822\nI send a letter at the post office.\n\n28\n00:01:29.862 --> 00:01:33.542\nNext, let us learn the station.\n\n29\n00:01:33.562 --> 00:01:37.482\nDe trein staat op het station.\n\n30\n00:01:37.502 --> 00:01:40.522\nThe train is at the station.\n\n31\n00:01:40.582 --> 00:01:43.342\nIk wacht op het station.\n\n32\n00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.982\nI wait at the station.\n\n33\n00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:49.103\nNow, we visit the park.\n\n34\n00:01:49.163 --> 00:01:54.163\nWij wandelen in het park.\n\n35\n00:01:54.203 --> 00:01:56.663\nWe walk in the park.\n\n36\n00:01:56.723 --> 00:02:01.003\nHet park is erg mooi.\n\n37\n00:02:01.043 --> 00:02:03.783\nThe park is very beautiful.\n\n38\n00:02:03.803 --> 00:02:06.223\nNext is the pharmacy.\n\n39\n00:02:06.283 --> 00:02:12.143\nIk koop medicijnen bij de apotheek.\n\n40\n00:02:12.323 --> 00:02:15.443\nI buy medicines at the pharmacy.\n\n41\n00:02:15.483 --> 00:02:19.423\nDe apotheek is open.\n\n42\n00:02:19.443 --> 00:02:21.583\nThe pharmacy is open.\n\n43\n00:02:21.623 --> 00:02:24.143\nLet us learn about the school.\n\n44\n00:02:24.163 --> 00:02:28.623\nDe kinderen zijn op school.\n\n45\n00:02:28.643 --> 00:02:31.043\nThe children are at school.\n\n46\n00:02:31.103 --> 00:02:34.764\nIk leer op school.\n\n47\n00:02:34.924 --> 00:02:37.084\nI learn at school.\n\n48\n00:02:37.144 --> 00:02:41.104\nNext place is the bank.\n\n49\n00:02:41.164 --> 00:02:45.564\nHet geld is bij de bank.\n\n50\n00:02:45.584 --> 00:02:49.424\nThe money is at the bank.\n\n51\n00:02:49.464 --> 00:02:53.504\nHij werkt bij een bank.\n\n52\n00:02:53.564 --> 00:02:57.304\nHe works at a bank.\n\n53\n00:02:57.324 --> 00:03:01.124\nNow we have the restaurant.\n\n54\n00:03:01.144 --> 00:03:05.684\nWij eten in het restaurant.\n\n55\n00:03:05.704 --> 00:03:09.424\nWe eat in the restaurant.\n\n56\n00:03:09.484 --> 00:03:14.044\nHet restaurant is gezellig.\n\n57\n00:03:14.064 --> 00:03:17.845\nThe restaurant is cozy.\n\n58\n00:03:17.925 --> 00:03:21.505\nLet us look at the museum.\n\n59\n00:03:21.565 --> 00:03:26.325\nHet museum is erg oud.\n\n60\n00:03:26.345 --> 00:03:30.625\nThe museum is very old.\n\n61\n00:03:30.685 --> 00:03:35.785\nIk kijk naar kunst in het museum.\n\n62\n00:03:35.925 --> 00:03:38.845\nI look 