93\n00:06:21.809 --> 00:06:24.709\nWaar is het station?\n\n94\n00:06:24.769 --> 00:06:26.769\nWhere is the station?\n\n95\n00:06:26.829 --> 00:06:30.329\nHet station is dichtbij.\n\n96\n00:06:30.369 --> 00:06:32.909\nThe station is nearby.\n\n97\n00:06:32.969 --> 00:06:34.789\nExcellent work today!\n\n98\n00:06:34.869 --> 00:06:37.469\nLet us do a quick recap.\n\n99\n00:06:37.509 --> 00:06:44.029\nVandaag leerden we: supermarkt, bibliotheek, ziekenhuis.\n\n100\n00:06:44.069 --> 00:06:49.690\nToday we learned: supermarket, library, hospital.\n\n101\n00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:56.790\nOok leerden we: postkantoor, station, park, apotheek.\n\n102\n00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:03.790\nAlso we learned: post office, station, park, pharmacy.\n\n103\n00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.830\nKeep practicing these words every day.\n\n104\n00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.910\nTot de volgende keer!\n\n105\n00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:09.770\nSee you next time!\n
