cw_degree_adverbs	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.360\nWelcome to today's Dutch lesson.\n\n2\n00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.100\nToday we learn degree adverbs.\n\n3\n00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.361\nDegree adverbs show intensity.\n\n4\n00:00:11.381 --> 00:00:15.821\nThey make words stronger or weaker.\n\n5\n00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:18.381\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n6\n00:00:18.421 --> 00:00:20.661\nLet us begin!\n\n7\n00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:24.242\nOur first word is heel.\n\n8\n00:00:24.302 --> 00:00:28.762\nHeel means very in English.\n\n9\n00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:31.282\nHet water is heel koud.\n\n10\n00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:37.102\nThe water is very cold.\n\n11\n00:00:37.142 --> 00:00:40.463\nZij is heel vriendelijk.\n\n12\n00:00:40.483 --> 00:00:43.823\nShe is very friendly.\n\n13\n00:00:43.883 --> 00:00:47.303\nOur second word is erg.\n\n14\n00:00:47.383 --> 00:00:51.403\nErg also means very.\n\n15\n00:00:51.463 --> 00:00:54.744\nHet is erg warm vandaag.\n\n16\n00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:58.544\nIt is very warm today.\n\n17\n00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:01.284\nIk ben erg moe.\n\n18\n00:01:01.384 --> 00:01:04.224\nI am very tired.\n\n19\n00:01:04.244 --> 00:01:06.724\nNext we have echt.\n\n20\n00:01:06.824 --> 00:01:11.825\nEcht means really or truly.\n\n21\n00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:15.205\nDit is echt lekker.\n\n22\n00:01:15.225 --> 00:01:18.105\nThis is really delicious.\n\n23\n00:01:18.165 --> 00:01:21.225\nHij is echt slim.\n\n24\n00:01:21.265 --> 00:01:24.006\nHe is really smart.\n\n25\n00:01:24.026 --> 00:01:27.186\nNow we look at zo.\n\n26\n00:01:27.346 --> 00:01:31.486\nZo means so in English.\n\n27\n00:01:31.526 --> 00:01:34.686\nJe bent zo lief.\n\n28\n00:01:34.726 --> 00:01:37.566\nYou are so sweet.\n\n29\n00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.527\nHet is zo laat.\n\n30\n00:01:40.587 --> 00:01:43.467\nIt is so late.\n\n31\n00:01:43.487 --> 00:01:46.667\nNext is the word vrij.\n\n32\n00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:51.667\nVrij means quite or fairly.\n\n33\n00:01:51.707 --> 00:01:55.208\nDe film is vrij goed.\n\n34\n00:01:55.228 --> 00:01:58.248\nThe movie is quite good.\n\n35\n00:01:58.288 --> 00:02:02.028\nHet huis is vrij groot.\n\n36\n00:02:02.068 --> 00:02:04.628\nThe house is fairly big.\n\n37\n00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:08.668\nOur sixth word is best.\n\n38\n00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:13.509\nBest means pretty or quite.\n\n39\n00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:17.609\nHet is best koud buiten.\n\n40\n00:02:17.669 --> 00:02:21.429\nIt is pretty cold outside.\n\n41\n00:02:21.489 --> 00:02:25.150\nIk vind dit best mooi.\n\n42\n00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.130\nI think this is pretty beautiful.\n\n43\n00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.250\nNext we study nogal.\n\n44\n00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:38.510\nNogal means rather or quite.\n\n45\n00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:42.351\nDe man is nogal druk.\n\n46\n00:02:42.371 --> 00:02:46.091\nThe man is rather busy.\n\n47\n00:02:46.151 --> 00:02:50.211\nDit boek is nogal saai.\n\n48\n00:02:50.251 --> 00:02:53.811\nThis book is rather boring.\n\n49\n00:02:53.991 --> 00:02:57.872\nOur last word is tamelijk.\n\n50\n00:02:57.892 --> 00:03:02.952\nTamelijk means fairly or rather.\n\n51\n00:03:02.992 --> 00:03:06.912\nDe prijs is tamelijk hoog.\n\n52\n00:03:06.932 --> 00:03:10.613\nThe price is fairly high.\n\n53\n00:03:10.673 --> 00:03:14.013\nHet is tamelijk ver lopen.\n\n54\n00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:18.033\nIt is fairly far to walk.\n\n55\n00:03:18.053 --> 00:03:21.433\nNow let us practice together.\n\n56\n00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:25.634\nListen and repeat the sentences.\n\n57\n00:03:25.674 --> 00:03:30.634\nDe soep is heel warm.\n\n58\n00:03:30.654 --> 00:03:34.934\nThe soup is very warm.\n\n59\n00:03:34.994 --> 00:03:39.134\nIk vind het erg leuk.\n\n60\n00:03:39.274 --> 00:03:42.635\nI find it very fun.\n\n61\n00:03:42.695 --> 00:03:46.135\nHet is echt waar.\n\n62\n00:03:46.175 --> 00:03:49.615\nIt is really true.\n\n63\n00:03:49.655 --> 00:03:53.735\nWaarom ben je zo moe?\n\n64\n00:03:53.775 --> 00:03:57.356\nWhy are you so tired?\n\n65\n00:03:57.436