\n\n65\n00:03:57.436 --> 00:04:01.276\nIt is fairly cheap.\n\n66\n00:04:01.336 --> 00:04:04.736\nIt is fairly cheap.\n\n67\n00:04:04.776 --> 00:04:09.416\nThe test is pretty difficult.\n\n68\n00:04:09.436 --> 00:04:12.637\nThe test is pretty difficult.\n\n69\n00:04:12.697 --> 00:04:15.437\nHe speaks rather fast.\n\n70\n00:04:15.477 --> 00:04:17.857\nHe speaks rather fast.\n\n71\n00:04:17.877 --> 00:04:21.097\nThe room is fairly small.\n\n72\n00:04:21.117 --> 00:04:23.877\nThe room is fairly small.\n\n73\n00:04:23.897 --> 00:04:25.638\nGreat job today!\n\n74\n00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:28.058\nLet us recap our words.\n\n75\n00:04:28.118 --> 00:04:32.278\nToday we learned heel and erg.\n\n76\n00:04:32.398 --> 00:04:36.158\nToday we learned heel and erg.\n\n77\n00:04:36.198 --> 00:04:39.678\nWe learned echt and zo.\n\n78\n00:04:39.698 --> 00:04:42.979\nWe learned echt and zo.\n\n79\n00:04:43.059 --> 00:04:44.739\nAnd also vrij and best.\n\n80\n00:04:44.779 --> 00:04:46.499\nAnd also vrij and best.\n\n81\n00:04:46.579 --> 00:04:50.619\nAnd finally nogal and tamelijk.\n\n82\n00:04:50.719 --> 00:04:54.639\nAnd finally nogal and tamelijk.\n\n83\n00:04:54.659 --> 00:04:56.900\nPractice these words every day.\n\n84\n00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.300\nSee you next time!\n\n85\n00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.780\nUntil next time!\n\n86\n00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.360\nUntil next time!\n
cw_direction_words	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.540\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.580\nWelcome to our Dutch direction lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.020\nWelkom bij de les!\n\n4\n00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.041\nWelcome to the lesson!\n\n5\n00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:15.581\nToday we learn words for giving directions.\n\n6\n00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.321\nThis helps you find your way.\n\n7\n00:00:18.421 --> 00:00:20.561\nAre you ready to learn?\n\n8\n00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:23.141\nLaten we nu beginnen!\n\n9\n00:00:23.201 --> 00:00:25.141\nLet us start now!\n\n10\n00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:28.461\nOur first word is LINKS.\n\n11\n00:00:28.521 --> 00:00:31.982\nLINKS means left in English.\n\n12\n00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:34.842\nGa hier naar links.\n\n13\n00:00:34.882 --> 00:00:36.662\nGo left here.\n\n14\n00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:39.962\nHet museum is links.\n\n15\n00:00:39.982 --> 00:00:42.622\nThe museum is on the left.\n\n16\n00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:46.362\nRemember that LINKS means left.\n\n17\n00:00:46.442 --> 00:00:49.843\nOur second word is RECHTS.\n\n18\n00:00:49.903 --> 00:00:53.503\nRECHTS means right in English.\n\n19\n00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:56.383\nSla af naar rechts.\n\n20\n00:00:56.403 --> 00:00:57.983\nTurn to the right.\n\n21\n00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:01.663\nDe bus staat rechts.\n\n22\n00:01:01.683 --> 00:01:04.443\nThe bus is on the right.\n\n23\n00:01:04.503 --> 00:01:08.203\nSo RECHTS is right.\n\n24\n00:01:08.223 --> 00:01:11.564\nNext we have RECHTDOOR.\n\n25\n00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.964\nRECHTDOOR means straight ahead.\n\n26\n00:01:15.044 --> 00:01:18.084\nGa gewoon rechtdoor.\n\n27\n00:01:18.124 --> 00:01:20.724\nJust go straight ahead.\n\n28\n00:01:20.764 --> 00:01:24.664\nLoop honderd meter rechtdoor.\n\n29\n00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:27.824\nWalk one hundred meters straight.\n\n30\n00:01:27.944 --> 00:01:31.445\nRECHTDOOR means straight ahead.\n\n31\n00:01:31.545 --> 00:01:35.745\nOur fourth phrase is OM DE HOEK.\n\n32\n00:01:35.765 --> 00:01:39.345\nThis phrase means around the corner.\n\n33\n00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.665\nDe bakker is om de hoek.\n\n34\n00:01:42.685 --> 00:01:45.685\nThe bakery is around the corner.\n\n35\n00:01:45.745 --> 00:01:49.266\nHet café is om de hoek.\n\n36\n00:01:49.286 --> 00:01:52.146\nThe cafe is around the corner.\n\n37\n00:01:52.226 --> 00:01:55.746\nOM DE HOEK is around the corner.\n\n38\n00:01:55.806 --> 00:02:00.886\nNext is the word DICHTBIJ.\n\n39\n00:02:00.926 --> 00:02:07.026\nDICHTBIJ means nearby or close.\n\n40\n00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:11.767\nDe school is dichtbij.\n\n41\n00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:15.787\nThe school is nearby.\n\n42\n00:02:15.827 --> 00:02:21.027\nMijn huis is heel dichtbij.\n\n43\n00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:25.307\nMy house is very close.\n\n44\n00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:31.128\nDICHTBIJ means close or nearby.\n\n45\n00:02:31.168 --> 00:02:35.788\nNow let us learn VER WEG.\n\n46\n00:02:35.848 --> 00:02:40.308\nVER WEG means far away.\n\n47\n00:02:40.348 --> 00:02:41.568\nHet station is ver weg.\n\n48\n00:02:41.588 --> 00:02:45.228\nThe station is far away.\n\n49\n00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:46.268\nDe stad is ver weg.\n\n50\n00:02:46.288 --> 00:02:49.289\nThe city is far away.\n\n51\n00:02:49.329 --> 00:02:53.929\nVER WEG means far away.\n\n52\n00:02:54.009 --> 00:02:58.429\nOur seventh word is HIER.\n\n53\n00:02:58.469 --> 00:03:03.069\nHIER simply means here.\n\n54\n00:03:03.109 --> 00:03:04.129\nStop hier even.\n\n55\n00:03:04.149 --> 00:03:07.250\nStop here for a moment.\n\n56\n00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:09.490\nIk ben hier nu.\n\n57\n00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.250\nI am here now.\n\n58\n00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:17.110\nHIER is easy, it means here.\n\n59\n00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:20.790\nNext we learn the word DAAR.\n\n60\n00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.290\nDAAR means there in English.\n\n61\n00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:26.771\nKijk maar daar.\n\n62\n00:03:26.811 --> 00:03:28.791\nJust look over there.\n\n63\n00:03:28.831 --> 00:03:32.031\nDe trein staat daar.\n\n64\n00:03:32.051 --> 00:03:34.391\nThe train is over there.\n\n65\n00:03:34.451 --> 00:03:37.091\nDAAR means there.\n\n66\n00:03:37.131 --> 00:03:39.851\nNow let us look at VOOR.\n\n67\n00:03:39.931 --> 00:03:42.751\nVOOR means in front of.\n\n68\n00:03:42.811 --> 00:03:45.772\nIk sta voor het park.\n\n69\n00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:48.912\nI stand in front of the park.\n\n70\n00:03:48.952 --> 00:03:52.452\nDe auto staat voor de deur.\n\n71\n00:03:52.472 --> 00:03:55.432\nThe car is in front of the door.\n\n72\n00:03:55.572 --> 00:03:58.392\nVOOR means in front of.\n\n73\n00:03:58.472 --> 00:04:03.292\nOur tenth word is ACHTER.\n\n74\n00:04:03.372 --> 00:04:07.593\nACHTER means behind.\n\n75\n00:04:07.653 --> 00:04:12.433\nDe tuin is achter het huis.\n\n76\n00:04:12.473 --> 00:04:16.993\nThe garden is behind the house.\n\n77\n00:04:17.053 --> 00:04:20.973\nHij loopt achter mij.\n\n78\n00:04:21.013 --> 00:04:24.514\nHe walks behind me.\n\n79\n00:04:24.574 --> 00:04:28.514\nACHTER means behind.\n\n80\n00:04:28.574 --> 00:04:33.214\nLet us learn the word NAAST.\n\n81\n00:04:33.254 --> 00:04:37.634\nNAAST means next to.\n\n82\n00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:42.454\nDe winkel is naast de bank.\n\n83\n00:04:42.474 --> 00:04:46.955\nThe shop is next to the bank.\n\n84\n00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:50.995\nZij zit naast mij.\n\n85\n00:04:51.055 --> 00:04:55.095\nShe sits next to me.\n\n86\n00:04:55.115 --> 00:04:59.535\nNAAST means next to.\n\n87\n00:04:59.575 --> 00:05:01.995\nNow consider the word BIJ.\n\n88\n00:05:02.015 --> 00:05:04.596\nBIJ means at or near.\n\n89\n00:05:04.616 --> 00:05:07.196\nIk ben bij de halte.\n\n90\n00:05:07.216 --> 00:05:09.156\nI am at the stop.\n\n91\n00:05:09.196 --> 00:05:13.516\nHij wacht bij de ingang.\n\n92\n00:05:13.536 --> 00:05:16.496\nHe waits at the entrance.\n\n93\n00:05:16.556 --> 00:05:21.356\nBIJ means at or near.\n\n94\n00:05:21.456 --> 00:05:25.397\nOur next word is NAAR.\n\n95\n00:05:25.437 --> 00:05:31.037\nNAAR means to or towards.\n\n96\n00:05:31.077 --> 00:05:35.357\nWij gaan naar huis.\n\n97\n00:05:35.377 --> 00:05:38.637\nWe are going home.\n\n98\n00:05:38.697 --> 00:05:43.918\nLoop naar het plein.\n\n99\n00:05:43.978 --> 00:05:46.498\nWalk to the square.\n\n100\n00:05:46.538 --> 00:05:50.258\nNAAR means to.\n\n101\n00:05:50.338 --> 00:05:54.638\nYou did a fantastic job today!\n\n102\n00:05:54.678 --> 00:05:59.818\nLet us review our main direction words.\n\n103\n00:05:59.858 --> 00:06:04.499\nWij kennen nu links en rechts.\n\n104\n00:06:04.519 --> 00:06:06.379\nWe now know left and right.\n\n105\n00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:09.559\nGa rechtdoor of om de hoek.\n\n106\n00:06:09.599 --> 00:06:11.979\nGo straight or around the corner.\n\n107\n00:06:11.999 --> 00:06:15.959\nHet is dichtbij of ver weg.\n\n108\n00:06:16.019 --> 00:06:20.620\nIt is nearby or far away.\n\n109\n00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:25.140\nPractice these direction words every day.\n\n110\n00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:29.060\nTot de volgende keer!\n\n111\n00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:29.820\nSee you next time!\n
cw_direction_words	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.540\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.580\nWelcome to our Dutch direction lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.020\nWelcome to the lesson!\n\n4\n00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.041\nWelcome to the lesson!\n\n5\n00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:15.581\nToday we learn words for giving directions.\n\n6\n00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.321\nThis helps you find your way.\n\n7\n00:00:18.421 --> 00:00:20.561\nAre you ready to learn?\n\n8\n00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:23.141\nLet us start now!\n\n9\n00:00:23.201 --> 00:00:25.141\nLet us start now!\n\n10\n00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:28.461\nOur first word is LINKS.\n\n11\n00:00:28.521 --> 00:00:31.982\nLINKS means left in English.\n\n12\n00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:34.842\nGo left here.\n\n13\n00:00:34.882 --> 00:00:36.662\nGo left here.\n\n14\n00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:39.962\nThe museum is on the left.\n\n15\n00:00:39.982 --> 00:00:42.622\nThe museum is on the left.\n\n16\n00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:46.362\nRemember that LINKS means left.\n\n17\n00:00:46.442 --> 00:00:49.843\nOur second word is RECHTS.\n\n18\n00:00:49.903 --> 00:00:53.503\nRECHTS means right in English.\n\n19\n00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:56.383\nTurn to the right.\n\n20\n00:00:56.403 --> 00:00:57.983\nTurn to the right.\n\n21\n00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:01.663\nThe bus is on the right.\n\n22\n00:01:01.683 --> 00:01:04.443\nThe bus is on the right.\n\n23\n00:01:04.503 --> 00:01:08.203\nSo RECHTS is right.\n\n24\n00:01:08.223 --> 00:01:11.564\nNext we have RECHTDOOR.\n\n25\n00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.964\nRECHTDOOR means straight ahead.\n\n26\n00:01:15.044 --> 00:01:18.084\nJust go straight ahead.\n\n27\n00:01:18.124 --> 00:01:20.724\nJust go straight ahead.\n\n28\n00:01:20.764 --> 00:01:24.664\nWalk one hundred meters straight.\n\n29\n00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:27.824\nWalk one hundred meters straight.\n\n30\n00:01:27.944 --> 00:01:31.445\nRECHTDOOR means straight ahead.\n\n31\n00:01:31.545 --> 00:01:35.745\nOur fourth phrase is OM DE HOEK.\n\n32\n00:01:35.765 --> 00:01:39.345\nThis phrase means around the corner.\n\n33\n00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.665\nThe bakery is around the corner.\n\n34\n00:01:42.685 --> 00:01:45.685\nThe bakery is around the corner.\n\n35\n00:01:45.745 --> 00:01:49.266\nThe cafe is around the corner.\n\n36\n00:01:49.286 --> 00:01:52.146\nThe cafe is around the corner.\n\n37\n00:01:52.226 --> 00:01:55.746\nOM DE HOEK is around the corner.\n\n38\n00:01:55.806 --> 00:02:00.886\nNext is the word DICHTBIJ.\n\n39\n00:02:00.926 --> 00:02:07.026\nDICHTBIJ means nearby or close.\n\n40\n00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:11.767\nThe school is nearby.\n\n41\n00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:15.787\nThe school is nearby.\n\n42\n00:02:15.827 --> 00:02:21.027\nMy house is very close.\n\n43\n00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:25.307\nMy house is very close.\n\n44\n00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:31.128\nDICHTBIJ means close or nearby.\n\n45\n00:02:31.168 --> 00:02:35.788\nNow let us learn VER WEG.\n\n46\n00:02:35.848 --> 00:02:40.308\nVER WEG means far away.\n\n47\n00:02:40.348 --> 00:02:41.568\nThe station is far away.\n\n48\n00:02:41.588 --> 00:02:45.228\nThe station is far away.\n\n49\n00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:46.268\nThe city is far away.\n\n50\n00:02:46.288 --> 00:02:49.289\nThe city is far away.\n\n51\n00:02:49.329 --> 00:02:53.929\nVER WEG means far away.\n\n52\n00:02:54.009 --> 00:02:58.429\nOur seventh word is HIER.\n\n53\n00:02:58.469 --> 00:03:03.069\nHIER simply means here.\n\n54\n00:03:03.109 --> 00:03:04.129\nStop here for a moment.\n\n55\n00:03:04.149 --> 00:03:07.250\nStop here for a moment.\n\n56\n00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:09.490\nI am here now.\n\n57\n00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.250\nI am here now.\n\n58\n00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:17.110\nHIER is easy, it means here.\n\n59\n00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:20.790\nNext we learn the word DAAR.\n\n60\n00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.290\nDAAR means there in English.\n\n61\n00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:26.771\nJust look over there.\n\n62\n00:03:26.811 --> 00:03:28.791\nJust look over there.\n\n63\n00:03:28.831 --> 00:03:32.031\nThe train is over there.\n\n64\n00:03:32.051 --> 00:03:34.391\nThe train is over there.\n\n65\n00:03:34.451 --> 00:03:37.091\nDAAR means there.\n\n66\n00:03:37.131 --> 00:03:39.851\nNow let us look at VOOR.\n\n67\n00:03:39.931 --> 00:03:42.751\nVOOR means in front of.\n\n68\n00:03:42.811 --> 00:03:45.772\nI stand in front of the park.\n\n69\n00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:48.912\nI stand in front of the park.\n\n70\n00:03:48.952 --> 00:03:52.452\nThe car is in front of the door.\n\n71\n00:03:52.472 --> 00:03:55.432\nThe car is in front of the door.\n\n72\n00:03:55.572 --> 00:03:58.392\nVOOR means in front of.\n\n73\n00:03:58.472 --> 00:04:03.292\nOur tenth word is ACHTER.\n\n74\n00:04:03.372 --> 00:04:07.593\nACHTER means behind.\n\n75\n00:04:07.653 --> 00:04:12.433\nThe garden is behind the house.\n\n76\n00:04:12.473 --> 00:04:16.993\nThe garden is behind the house.\n\n77\n00:04:17.053 --> 00:04:20.973\nHe walks behind me.\n\n78\n00:04:21.013 --> 00:04:24.514\nHe walks behind me.\n\n79\n00:04:24.574 --> 00:04:28.514\nACHTER means behind.\n\n80\n00:04:28.574 --> 00:04:33.214\nLet us learn the word NAAST.\n\n81\n00:04:33.254 --> 00:04:37.634\nNAAST means next to.\n\n82\n00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:42.454\nThe shop is next to the bank.\n\n83\n00:04:42.474 --> 00:04:46.955\nThe shop is next to the bank.\n\n84\n00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:50.995\nShe sits next to me.\n\n85\n00:04:51.055 --> 00:04:55.095\nShe sits next to me.\n\n86\n00:04:55.115 --> 00:04:59.535\nNAAST means next to.\n\n87\n00:04:59.575 --> 00:05:01.995\nNow consider the word BIJ.\n\n88\n00:05:02.015 --> 00:05:04.596\nBIJ means at or near.\n\n89\n00:05:04.616 --> 00:05:07.196\nI am at the stop.\n\n90\n00:05:07.216 --> 00:05:09.156\nI am at the stop.\n\n91\n00:05:09.196 --> 00:05:13.516\nHe waits at the entrance.\n\n92\n00:05:13.536 --> 00:05:16.496\nHe waits at the entrance.\n\n93\n00:05:16.556 --> 00:05:21.356\nBIJ means at or near.\n\n94\n00:05:21.456 --> 00:05:25.397\nOur next word is NAAR.\n\n95\n00:05:25.437 --> 00:05:31.037\nNAAR means to or towards.\n\n96\n00:05:31.077 --> 00:05:35.357\nWe are going home.\n\n97\n00:05:35.377 --> 00:05:38.637\nWe are going home.\n\n98\n00:05:38.697 --> 00:05:43.918\nWalk to the square.\n\n99\n00:05:43.978 --> 00:05:46.498\nWalk to the square.\n\n100\n00:05:46.538 --> 00:05:50.258\nNAAR means to.\n\n101\n00:05:50.338 --> 00:05:54.638\nYou did a fantastic job today!\n\n102\n00:05:54.678 --> 00:05:59.818\nLet us review our main direction words.\n\n103\n00:05:59.858 --> 00:06:04.499\nWe now know left and right.\n\n104\n00:06:04.519 --> 00:06:06.379\nWe now know left and right.\n\n105\n00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:09.559\nGo straight or around the corner.\n\n106\n00:06:09.599 --> 00:06:11.979\nGo straight or around the corner.\n\n107\n00:06:11.999 --> 00:06:15.959\nIt is nearby or far away.\n\n108\n00:06:16.019 --> 00:06:20.620\nIt is nearby or far away.\n\n109\n00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:25.140\nPractice these direction words every day.\n\n110\n00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:29.060\nSee you next time!\n\n111\n00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:29.820\nSee you next time!\n
cw_ordinal_numbers	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.160\nWelcome to today's Dutch lesson!\n\n2\n00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.520\nToday we learn ordinal numbers.\n\n3\n00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.200\nOrdinals show order in sentences.\n\n4\n00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.360\nWe count from first to tenth.\n\n5\n00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.201\nLaten we samen beginnen!\n\n6\n00:00:20.321 --> 00:00:23.561\nLet's start together!\n\n7\n00:00:23.641 --> 00:00:28.301\nOur first word is eerste.\n\n8\n00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:33.221\nEerste means first in English.\n\n9\n00:00:33.281 --> 00:00:38.301\nHet eerste huis is groen.\n\n10\n00:00:38.321 --> 00:00:42.741\nThe first house is green.\n\n11\n00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:46.761\nIk ben de eerste hier.\n\n12\n00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:50.521\nI am the first here.\n\n13\n00:00:50.581 --> 00:00:54.781\nDit is de eerste stap.\n\n14\n00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:58.641\nThis is the first step.\n\n15\n00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:03.662\nRemember, eerste means first.\n\n16\n00:01:03.762 --> 00:01:08.202\nOur second word is tweede.\n\n17\n00:01:08.242 --> 00:01:13.182\nTweede means second in English.\n\n18\n00:01:13.222 --> 00:01:17.782\nDe tweede man is lang.\n\n19\n00:01:17.802 --> 00:01:20.682\nThe second man is tall.\n\n20\n00:01:20.722 --> 00:01:24.702\nDit is mijn tweede kans.\n\n21\n00:01:24.782 --> 00:01:28.522\nThis is my second chance.\n\n22\n00:01:28.562 --> 00:01:32.922\nZij leest de tweede pagina.\n\n23\n00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:36.902\nShe reads the second page.\n\n24\n00:01:36.942 --> 00:01:42.203\nRemember, tweede means second.\n\n25\n00:01:42.283 --> 00:01:46.083\nOur third word is derde.\n\n26\n00:01:46.123 --> 00:01:50.843\nDerde means third in English.\n\n27\n00:01:50.863 --> 00:01:54.943\nDe derde dag is fijn.\n\n28\n00:01:54.963 --> 00:01:58.823\nThe third day is nice.\n\n29\n00:01:58.863 --> 00:02:02.863\nHij neemt de derde stoel.\n\n30\n00:02:02.883 --> 00:02:06.883\nHe takes the third chair.\n\n31\n00:02:06.923 --> 00:02:11.003\nWij zien de derde boom.\n\n32\n00:02:11.043 --> 00:02:14.843\nWe see the third tree.\n\n33\n00:02:14.903 --> 00:02:20.164\nRemember, derde means third.\n\n34\n00:02:20.244 --> 00:02:23.964\nOur fourth word is vierde.\n\n35\n00:02:24.044 --> 00:02:28.824\nVierde means fourth in English.\n\n36\n00:02:28.864 --> 00:02:31.824\nHet vierde kind speelt buiten.\n\n37\n00:02:31.844 --> 00:02:35.524\nThe fourth child plays outside.\n\n38\n00:02:35.564 --> 00:02:39.484\nWe nemen de vierde bus.\n\n39\n00:02:39.524 --> 00:02:42.224\nWe take the fourth bus.\n\n40\n00:02:42.284 --> 00:02:45.664\nDit is de vierde week.\n\n41\n00:02:45.684 --> 00:02:48.024\nThis is the fourth week.\n\n42\n00:02:48.084 --> 00:02:52.204\nRemember, vierde means fourth.\n\n43\n00:02:52.224 --> 00:02:53.004\nOur fifth word is vijfde.\n\n44\n00:02:53.024 --> 00:02:54.704\nVijfde means fifth in English.\n\n45\n00:02:54.724 --> 00:02:56.164\nDe vijfde kat slaapt nu.\n\n46\n00:02:56.184 --> 00:02:58.045\nThe fifth cat sleeps now.\n\n47\n00:02:58.065 --> 00:02:59.385\nHij woont op de vijfde.\n\n48\n00:02:59.425 --> 00:03:00.825\nHe lives on the fifth.\n\n49\n00:03:00.845 --> 00:03:02.465\nZij pakt de vijfde appel.\n\n50\n00:03:02.485 --> 00:03:03.205\nShe grabs the fifth apple.\n\n51\n00:03:03.225 --> 00:03:05.265\nRemember, vijfde means fifth.\n\n52\n00:03:05.305 --> 00:03:06.285\nOur sixth word is zesde.\n\n53\n00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:07.845\nZesde means sixth in English.\n\n54\n00:03:07.885 --> 00:03:08.565\nDe zesde les is makkelijk.\n\n55\n00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:10.125\nThe sixth lesson is easy.\n\n56\n00:03:10.165 --> 00:03:11.205\nDit is de zesde keer.\n\n57\n00:03:11.245 --> 00:03:12.805\nThis is the sixth time.\n\n58\n00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:13.425\nIk zie de zesde man.\n\n59\n00:03:13.445 --> 00:03:15.005\nI see the sixth man.\n\n60\n00:03:15.045 --> 00:03:18.785\nRemember, zesde means sixth.\n\n61\n00:03:18.885 --> 00:03:22.385\nOur seventh word is zevende.\n\n62\n00:03:22.465 --> 00:03:25.945\nZevende means seventh in English.\n\n63\n00:03:25.965 --> 00:03:28.765\nDe zevende vraag is goed.\n\n64\n00:03:28.785 --> 00:03:31.305\nThe seventh question is good.\n\n65\n00:03:31.385 --> 00:03:33.945\nHet is de zevende dag.\n\n66\n00:03:34.005 --> 00:03:36.445\nIt is the seventh day.\n\n67\n00:03:36.485 --> 00:03:39.526\nWij horen de zevende vogel.\n\n68\n00:03:39.566 --> 00:03:42.126\nWe hear the seventh bird.\n\n69\n00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:45.966\nRemember, zevende means seventh.\n\n70\n00:03:46.066 --> 00:03:49.686\nOur eighth word is achtste.\n\n71\n00:03:49.766 --> 00:03:54.026\nAchtste means eighth in English.\n\n72\n00:03:54.046 --> 00:03:57.646\nDe achtste hond is klein.\n\n73\n00:03:57.666 --> 00:04:01.366\nThe eighth dog is small.\n\n74\n00:04:01.406 --> 00:04:04.586\nWij zien de achtste auto.\n\n75\n00:04:04.706 --> 00:04:07.946\nWe see the eighth car.\n\n76\n00:04:08.026 --> 00:04:11.266\nZij zoekt de achtste deur.\n\n77\n00:04:11.406 --> 00:04:14.626\nShe looks for the eighth door.\n\n78\n00:04:14.706 --> 00:04:19.787\nRemember, achtste means eighth.\n\n79\n00:04:19.887 --> 00:04:23.967\nOur ninth word is negende.\n\n80\n00:04:24.027 --> 00:04:28.327\nNegende means ninth in English.\n\n81\n00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:32.067\nDe negende foto is mooi.\n\n82\n00:04:32.087 --> 00:04:35.827\nThe ninth photo is pretty.\n\n83\n00:04:35.887 --> 00:04:38.927\nZij heeft de negende plek.\n\n84\n00:04:39.027 --> 00:04:42.227\nShe has the ninth place.\n\n85\n00:04:42.327 --> 00:04:45.027\nIk lees de negende zin.\n\n86\n00:04:45.247 --> 00:04:49.027\nI read the ninth sentence.\n\n87\n00:04:49.087 --> 00:04:54.447\nRemember, negende means ninth.\n\n88\n00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:59.108\nOur tenth word is tiende.\n\n89\n00:04:59.148 --> 00:05:03.928\nTiende means tenth in English.\n\n90\n00:05:03.968 --> 00:05:09.628\nDe tiende man is oud.\n\n91\n00:05:09.648 --> 00:05:14.008\nThe tenth man is old.\n\n92\n00:05:14.088 --> 00:05:19.828\nHet is de tiende keer.\n\n93\n00:05:19.928 --> 00:05:24.528\nIt is the tenth time.\n\n94\n00:05:24.588 --> 00:05:30.828\nWe drinken de tiende thee.\n\n95\n00:05:30.848 --> 00:05:35.448\nWe drink the tenth tea.\n\n96\n00:05:35.508 --> 00:05:41.309\nRemember, tiende means tenth.\n\n97\n00:05:41.349 --> 00:05:42.909\nGreat work on learning these!\n\n98\n00:05:42.929 --> 00:05:47.989\nLet's review all our words.\n\n99\n00:05:48.049 --> 00:05:53.729\nVandaag leerden we deze woorden.\n\n100\n00:05:53.769 --> 00:05:57.909\nToday we learned these words.\n\n101\n00:05:58.129 --> 00:06:01.849\nEerste, tweede, derde, vierde.\n\n102\n00:06:01.869 --> 00:06:05.149\nFirst, second, third, fourth.\n\n103\n00:06:05.249 --> 00:06:12.449\nVijfde, zesde, zevende, achtste.\n\n104\n00:06:14.249 --> 00:06:21.449\nFifth, sixth, seventh, eighth.\n\n105\n00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:25.930\nNegende en tiende.\n\n106\n00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:30.190\nNinth and tenth.\n\n107\n00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.410\nPractice these every single day.\n\n108\n00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:34.930\nSee you in our next lesson!\n
