cw_emotions	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.620\nWelcome to today's Dutch lesson!\n\n2\n00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:08.101\nToday we will learn common emotion words.\n\n3\n00:00:08.161 --> 00:00:11.381\nHoe voel jij je vandaag?\n\n4\n00:00:11.461 --> 00:00:14.581\nHow do you feel today?\n\n5\n00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.141\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n6\n00:00:17.161 --> 00:00:19.362\nLet's begin!\n\n7\n00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:24.182\nOur first word is for happy: blij.\n\n8\n00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:28.022\nIk ben vandaag erg blij.\n\n9\n00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:31.143\nI am very happy today.\n\n10\n00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:34.543\nDe kinderen zijn heel blij.\n\n11\n00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:37.583\nThe children are very happy.\n\n12\n00:00:37.643 --> 00:00:41.283\nGreat job! Let's try the next word.\n\n13\n00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:46.504\nOur second word is for sad: verdrietig.\n\n14\n00:00:46.544 --> 00:00:49.424\nWaarom ben je verdrietig?\n\n15\n00:00:49.464 --> 00:00:51.964\nWhy are you sad?\n\n16\n00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:54.944\nHet kind is heel verdrietig.\n\n17\n00:00:54.964 --> 00:00:59.465\nThe child is very sad.\n\n18\n00:00:59.485 --> 00:01:06.425\nNow, let's learn the word for angry: boos.\n\n19\n00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:10.786\nDe man is erg boos.\n\n20\n00:01:10.846 --> 00:01:14.986\nThe man is very angry.\n\n21\n00:01:15.026 --> 00:01:18.966\nHij is boos op mij.\n\n22\n00:01:19.006 --> 00:01:22.487\nHe is angry with me.\n\n23\n00:01:22.527 --> 00:01:30.227\nNext, we have the word for afraid or scared: bang.\n\n24\n00:01:30.307 --> 00:01:34.148\nIk ben bang voor honden.\n\n25\n00:01:34.328 --> 00:01:38.008\nI am afraid of dogs.\n\n26\n00:01:38.048 --> 00:01:41.248\nBen jij ook bang?\n\n27\n00:01:41.328 --> 00:01:44.689\nAre you afraid too?\n\n28\n00:01:44.749 --> 00:01:48.529\nYou are doing wonderful!\n\n29\n00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:54.909\nNow let's learn the word for tired: moe.\n\n30\n00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:58.810\nIk ben nu heel moe.\n\n31\n00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:02.590\nI am very tired now.\n\n32\n00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:07.950\nHij is moe na het werk.\n\n33\n00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.931\nHe is tired after work.\n\n34\n00:02:12.011 --> 00:02:17.831\nOur sixth word is for sick: ziek.\n\n35\n00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:23.212\nMijn zus is vandaag ziek.\n\n36\n00:02:23.232 --> 00:02:26.672\nMy sister is sick today.\n\n37\n00:02:26.752 --> 00:02:31.072\nIk voel mij erg ziek.\n\n38\n00:02:31.212 --> 00:02:34.553\nI feel very sick.\n\n39\n00:02:34.573 --> 00:02:41.753\nNext, we have happy or fortunate: gelukkig.\n\n40\n00:02:41.813 --> 00:02:46.434\nWij zijn samen erg gelukkig.\n\n41\n00:02:46.514 --> 00:02:49.894\nWe are very happy together.\n\n42\n00:02:49.954 --> 00:02:54.214\nZe is een gelukkig mens.\n\n43\n00:02:54.254 --> 00:02:57.094\nShe is a happy person.\n\n44\n00:02:57.134 --> 00:03:03.255\nFinally, our word for nervous is: nerveus.\n\n45\n00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:07.595\nIk ben nerveus voor de test.\n\n46\n00:03:07.755 --> 00:03:10.215\nI am nervous for the test.\n\n47\n00:03:10.275 --> 00:03:13.976\nWaarom ben je zo nerveus?\n\n48\n00:03:13.996 --> 00:03:17.416\nWhy are you so nervous?\n\n49\n00:03:17.456 --> 00:03:22.636\nNow let's do a recap of all the words!\n\n50\n00:03:22.676 --> 00:03:33.157\nVandaag leerden we: blij, verdrietig, boos, bang.\n\n51\n00:03:33.197 --> 00:03:42.778\nToday we learned: happy, sad, angry, afraid.\n\n52\n00:03:42.838 --> 00:03:52.879\nEn ook: moe, ziek, gelukkig, nerveus.\n\n53\n00:03:52.959 --> 00:04:02.500\nAnd also: tired, sick, happy, nervous.\n\n54\n00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.680\nExcellent work today! Keep practicing!\n
