h word is berg.\n\n68\n00:04:17.388 --> 00:04:21.428\nBerg means mountain.\n\n69\n00:04:21.468 --> 00:04:25.708\nThe mountain is very high.\n\n70\n00:04:25.728 --> 00:04:29.748\nThe mountain is very high.\n\n71\n00:04:29.788 --> 00:04:34.188\nWe climb on the mountain.\n\n72\n00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:37.848\nWe climb on the mountain.\n\n73\n00:04:37.908 --> 00:04:42.048\nBerg means mountain.\n\n74\n00:04:42.088 --> 00:04:45.528\nTime for a quick recap!\n\n75\n00:04:45.588 --> 00:04:50.329\nToday we learned new words.\n\n76\n00:04:50.369 --> 00:04:54.729\nToday we learned new words.\n\n77\n00:04:54.789 --> 00:05:00.609\nTree, flower, grass, sun and moon.\n\n78\n00:05:00.649 --> 00:05:09.269\nTree, flower, grass, sun and moon.\n\n79\n00:05:09.389 --> 00:05:18.909\nAnd also sky, sea, river, mountain.\n\n80\n00:05:19.009 --> 00:05:28.290\nAnd also sky, sea, river, mountain.\n\n81\n00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.850\nYou did a fantastic job today!\n\n82\n00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.990\nPractice these words often.\n\n83\n00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.710\nSee you in the next lesson!\n
