cw_verbs_daily_actions	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.420\nWelcome to today's lesson on common Dutch verbs.\n\n2\n00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.380\nWe will practice eight essential daily action verbs.\n\n3\n00:00:11.441 --> 00:00:13.921\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n4\n00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:19.161\nOur first verb is eten, which means to eat.\n\n5\n00:00:19.221 --> 00:00:22.541\nIk eet een verse appel.\n\n6\n00:00:22.681 --> 00:00:25.561\nI eat a fresh apple.\n\n7\n00:00:25.621 --> 00:00:29.581\nWij eten samen warm brood.\n\n8\n00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:32.722\nWe eat warm bread together.\n\n9\n00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:38.082\nOur second verb is drinken, which means to drink.\n\n10\n00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:41.242\nHij drinkt warme koffie.\n\n11\n00:00:41.282 --> 00:00:43.862\nHe drinks hot coffee.\n\n12\n00:00:43.942 --> 00:00:47.282\nZij drinken koud water.\n\n13\n00:00:47.322 --> 00:00:49.982\nThey drink cold water.\n\n14\n00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:55.763\nOur third verb is slapen, which means to sleep.\n\n15\n00:00:55.803 --> 00:00:59.323\nDe baby slaapt heel goed.\n\n16\n00:00:59.343 --> 00:01:02.363\nThe baby sleeps very well.\n\n17\n00:01:02.423 --> 00:01:05.583\nIk slaap acht uur.\n\n18\n00:01:05.723 --> 00:01:08.983\nI sleep eight hours.\n\n19\n00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:13.843\nOur fourth verb is werken, which means to work.\n\n20\n00:01:13.903 --> 00:01:16.764\nJan werkt elke dag.\n\n21\n00:01:16.844 --> 00:01:20.044\nJan works every day.\n\n22\n00:01:20.104 --> 00:01:23.164\nWij werken in de stad.\n\n23\n00:01:23.204 --> 00:01:26.324\nWe work in the city.\n\n24\n00:01:26.384 --> 00:01:31.004\nOur fifth verb is lopen, which means to walk.\n\n25\n00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:33.424\nIk loop naar school.\n\n26\n00:01:33.584 --> 00:01:36.025\nI walk to school.\n\n27\n00:01:36.085 --> 00:01:38.785\nZij lopen in het park.\n\n28\n00:01:38.805 --> 00:01:41.785\nThey walk in the park.\n\n29\n00:01:41.845 --> 00:01:46.385\nOur sixth verb is rijden, which means to drive.\n\n30\n00:01:46.445 --> 00:01:49.325\nHij rijdt een rode auto.\n\n31\n00:01:49.365 --> 00:01:53.625\nHe drives a red car.\n\n32\n00:01:53.685 --> 00:01:58.646\nWij rijden naar huis.\n\n33\n00:01:58.706 --> 00:02:01.566\nWe drive home.\n\n34\n00:02:01.646 --> 00:02:07.406\nOur seventh verb is koken, which means to cook.\n\n35\n00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:12.166\nIk kook een lekkere soep.\n\n36\n00:02:12.366 --> 00:02:16.286\nI cook a tasty soup.\n\n37\n00:02:16.346 --> 00:02:20.927\nZij kookt elke avond.\n\n38\n00:02:20.987 --> 00:02:24.587\nShe cooks every evening.\n\n39\n00:02:24.647 --> 00:02:30.987\nOur eighth verb is bellen, which means to call on the phone.\n\n40\n00:02:31.047 --> 00:02:35.627\nIk bel mijn goede vriend.\n\n41\n00:02:35.807 --> 00:02:39.368\nI call my good friend.\n\n42\n00:02:39.428 --> 00:02:43.928\nZij bellen de dokter nu.\n\n43\n00:02:43.968 --> 00:02:47.688\nThey call the doctor now.\n\n44\n00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:51.148\nNow let us do a quick recap.\n\n45\n00:02:51.188 --> 00:02:54.928\nVandaag kennen we acht acties.\n\n46\n00:02:54.948 --> 00:02:58.709\nToday we know eight actions.\n\n47\n00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:03.809\nEten, drinken en slapen.\n\n48\n00:03:03.869 --> 00:03:08.409\nEating, drinking, and sleeping.\n\n49\n00:03:08.449 --> 00:03:13.549\nWerken, lopen en rijden.\n\n50\n00:03:13.589 --> 00:03:17.929\nWorking, walking, and driving.\n\n51\n00:03:18.009 --> 00:03:21.470\nEn koken en bellen.\n\n52\n00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.950\nAnd cooking and calling.\n\n53\n00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:28.510\nExcellent work today! Practice these verbs daily.\n\n54\n00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:29.430\nTot ziens!\n
