0:01:49.325\nHe drives a red car.\n\n31\n00:01:49.365 --> 00:01:53.625\nHe drives a red car.\n\n32\n00:01:53.685 --> 00:01:58.646\nWe drive home.\n\n33\n00:01:58.706 --> 00:02:01.566\nWe drive home.\n\n34\n00:02:01.646 --> 00:02:07.406\nOur seventh verb is koken, which means to cook.\n\n35\n00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:12.166\nI cook a tasty soup.\n\n36\n00:02:12.366 --> 00:02:16.286\nI cook a tasty soup.\n\n37\n00:02:16.346 --> 00:02:20.927\nShe cooks every evening.\n\n38\n00:02:20.987 --> 00:02:24.587\nShe cooks every evening.\n\n39\n00:02:24.647 --> 00:02:30.987\nOur eighth verb is bellen, which means to call on the phone.\n\n40\n00:02:31.047 --> 00:02:35.627\nI call my good friend.\n\n41\n00:02:35.807 --> 00:02:39.368\nI call my good friend.\n\n42\n00:02:39.428 --> 00:02:43.928\nThey call the doctor now.\n\n43\n00:02:43.968 --> 00:02:47.688\nThey call the doctor now.\n\n44\n00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:51.148\nNow let us do a quick recap.\n\n45\n00:02:51.188 --> 00:02:54.928\nToday we know eight actions.\n\n46\n00:02:54.948 --> 00:02:58.709\nToday we know eight actions.\n\n47\n00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:03.809\nEating, drinking, and sleeping.\n\n48\n00:03:03.869 --> 00:03:08.409\nEating, drinking, and sleeping.\n\n49\n00:03:08.449 --> 00:03:13.549\nWorking, walking, and driving.\n\n50\n00:03:13.589 --> 00:03:17.929\nWorking, walking, and driving.\n\n51\n00:03:18.009 --> 00:03:21.470\nAnd cooking and calling.\n\n52\n00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.950\nAnd cooking and calling.\n\n53\n00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:28.510\nExcellent work today! Practice these verbs daily.\n\n54\n00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:29.430\nGoodbye!\n
dialogue_at_pharmacy	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:04.933\nGoedemiddag! Welkom bij de apotheek.\n\n2\n00:00:04.978 --> 00:00:06.622\nGoedemiddag.\n\n3\n00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.400\nHoe kan ik u vandaag helpen?\n\n4\n00:00:09.511 --> 00:00:11.846\nIk voel me niet zo goed.\n\n5\n00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.001\nWat vervelend. Wat voor klachten heeft u?\n\n6\n00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:19.357\nIk heb hoofdpijn en spierpijn.\n\n7\n00:00:19.401 --> 00:00:22.157\nHoelang heeft u er al last van?\n\n8\n00:00:22.179 --> 00:00:24.379\nSinds gisterenavond.\n\n9\n00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:26.468\nHeeft u ook koorts?\n\n10\n00:00:26.557 --> 00:00:30.334\nIk denk het wel. Ik heb het heel koud.\n\n11\n00:00:30.379 --> 00:00:33.402\nHeeft u uw temperatuur gemeten?\n\n12\n00:00:33.447 --> 00:00:36.980\nNee, dat heb ik nog niet gedaan.\n\n13\n00:00:37.024 --> 00:00:40.469\nDat is verstandig om straks even te doen.\n\n14\n00:00:40.513 --> 00:00:42.669\nJa, dat zal ik doen.\n\n15\n00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:45.291\nHeeft u ook last van uw keel?\n\n16\n00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:48.047\nJa, mijn keel doet veel pijn.\n\n17\n00:00:48.136 --> 00:00:50.780\nIs het slikken ook moeilijk?\n\n18\n00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:53.803\nJa, slikken doet erg veel zeer.\n\n19\n00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.537\nEn hoest u ook?\n\n20\n00:00:55.603 --> 00:00:58.648\nJa, ik hoest sinds vanmorgen.\n\n21\n00:00:58.714 --> 00:01:02.848\nIs het een droge hoest of zit er slijm vast?\n\n22\n00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:05.714\nHet voelt als een droge hoest.\n\n23\n00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:11.359\nOké, duidelijk. Heeft u ook een verstopte neus?\n\n24\n00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:15.538\nJa, ik kan bijna niet door mijn neus ademen.\n\n25\n00:01:15.582 --> 00:01:19.604\nDat is erg naar. U bent echt verkouden.\n\n26\n00:01:19.649 --> 00:01:23.538\nJa, helaas wel. Wat kunt u mij aanraden?\n\n27\n00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:27.649\nWe kunnen verschillende dingen doen voor uw klachten.\n\n28\n00:01:27.716 --> 00:01:32.693\nFijn. Welke medicijnen heeft u voor de hoofdpijn?\n\n29\n00:01:32.738 --> 00:01:35.294\nGebruikt u al paracetamol?\n\n30\n00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:38.739\nNee, ik heb nu niks meer in huis.\n\n31\n00:01:38.783 --> 00:01:43.361\nParacetamol is het beste middel om mee te beginnen.\n\n32\n00:01:43.428 --> 00:01:46.561\nHelpt dat ook tegen de spierpijn?\n\n33\n00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:51.961\nJa, paracetamol helpt tegen pijn en verlaagt de koorts.\n\n34\n00:01:52.117 --> 00:01:54.540\nOké, dat wil ik graag.\n\n35\n00:01:54.584 --> 00:01:59.140\nHoeveel milligram wilt u, vijfhonderd milligram?\n\n36\n00:01:59.207 --> 00:02:01.851\nIs dat de normale dosering?\n\n37\n00:02:01.896 --> 00:02:07.096\nJa, voor volwassenen is vijfhonderd milligram standaard.\n\n38\n00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.918\nHoeveel tabletten mag ik per dag nemen?\n\n39\n00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:15.008\nU mag maximaal zes tabletten per dag nemen.\n\n40\n00:02:15.097 --> 00:02:18.630\nOm de hoeveel uur neem ik er een?\n\n41\n00:02:18.697 --> 00:02:23.141\nU kunt elke vier tot zes uur een tablet nemen.\n\n42\n00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:26.874\nMoet ik de tablet met water innemen?\n\n43\n00:02:26.919 --> 00:02:30.830\nJa, neem het in met een groot glas water.\n\n44\n00:02:30.852 --> 00:02:36.098\nKan ik de tablet het beste voor of na het eten nemen?\n\n45\n00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:39.787\nDat maakt voor paracetamol niet veel uit.\n\n46\n00:02:39.853 --> 00:02:42.164\nOké, dat is makkelijk.\n\n47\n00:02:42.209 --> 00:02:46.320\nWilt u een doosje van twintig of vijftig stuks?\n\n48\n00:02:46.342 --> 00:02:49.942\nDoe maar een doosje van vijftig stuks.\n\n49\n00:02:49.964 --> 00:02:54.587\nPrima, ik leg het doosje paracetamol hier neer.\n\n50\n00:02:54.631 --> 00:02:58.832\nBedankt. En wat kan ik doen tegen de keelpijn?\n\n51\n00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:02.832\nWe hebben keeltabletten die de pijn verdoven.\n\n52\n00:03:02.899 --> 00:03:04.743\nWerken die snel?\n\n53\n00:03:04.788 --> 00:03:08.632\nJa, die zuigtabletten werken heel snel.\n\n54\n00:03:08.699 --> 00:03:11.099\nWelke smaak hebben ze?\n\n55\n00:03:11.143 --> 00:03:14.543\nWe hebben honing-citroen en menthol.\n\n56\n00:03:14.632 --> 00:03:18.411\nIk wil graag de honing-citroensmaak.\n\n57\n00:03:18.478 --> 00:03:22.856\nGoede keuze, die verzacht de keel erg goed.\n\n58\n00:03:22.878 --> 00:03:26.433\nHoe vaak mag ik zo'n zuigtablet nemen?\n\n59\n00:03:26.522 --> 00:03:30.233\nU mag er elke twee tot drie uur een nemen.\n\n60\n00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:33.011\nIs er een maximum per dag?\n\n61\n00:03:33.078 --> 00:03:36.657\nJa, maximaal acht tabletten per dag.\n\n62\n00:03:36.701 --> 00:03:40.857\nDuidelijk. En heeft u ook iets tegen de hoest?\n\n63\n00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:45.946\nVoor de droge hoest heb ik een hele fijne hoestsiroop.\n\n64\n00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:48.212\nHoe werkt die siroop?\n\n65\n00:03:48.257 --> 00:03:53.012\nDe siroop legt een beschermend laagje in uw keel.\n\n66\n00:03:53.057 --> 00:03:55.190\nDaardoor hoest ik minder?\n\n67\n00:03:55.212 --> 00:03:59.036\nPrecies, de hoestprikkel wordt minder erg.\n\n68\n00:03:59.058 --> 00:04:02.458\nDat klinkt goed. Hoe vaak neem ik die?\n\n69\n00:04:02.502 --> 00:04:05.636\nDriemaal daags een maatlepeltje.\n\n70\n00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.569\nZit er een maatlepeltje in de verpakking?\n\n71\n00:04:09.613 --> 00:04:13.747\nJa, er zit een klein lepeltje bij in de doos.\n\n72\n00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:18.526\nMooi. Moet ik de siroop voor het slapen innemen?\n\n73\n00:04:18.592 --> 00:04:24.014\nJa, een dosering voor het slapen helpt u beter te rusten.\n\n74\n00:04:24.059 --> 00:04:27.370\nDat heeft mijn lichaam nu wel nodig.\n\n75\n00:04:27.414 --> 00:04:31.614\nRust is inderdaad heel belangrijk als u ziek bent.\n\n76\n00:04:31.681 --> 00:04:35.281\nZeker. Wat heeft u voor de verstopte neus?\n\n77\n00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.438\nIk heb een neusspray met xylometazoline.\n\n78\n00:04:39.482 --> 00:04:41.549\nWat doet dat precies?\n\n79\n00:04:41.593 --> 00:04:46.438\nHet laat de gezwollen slijmvliezen in de neus slinken.\n\n80\n00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:49.038\nDan kan ik weer vrij ademen?\n\n81\n00:04:49.127 --> 00:04:52.616\nJa, het werkt binnen een paar minuten.\n\n82\n00:04:52.638 --> 00:04:56.060\nHoe vaak mag ik die neusspray gebruiken?\n\n83\n00:04:56.193 --> 00:05:01.394\nMaximaal drie keer per dag, één spray per neusgat.\n\n84\n00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:05.572\nMag ik die spray lang achter elkaar gebruiken?\n\n85\n00:05:05.594 --> 00:05:11.283\nNee, gebruik hem niet langer dan zeven dagen achter elkaar.\n\n86\n00:05:11.417 --> 00:05:13.483\nWaarom mag dat niet?\n\n87\n00:05:13.572 --> 00:05:17.239\nAnders kan uw neus eraan gewend raken.\n\n88\n00:05:17.328 --> 00:05:20.662\nO, dat wist ik niet. Goed dat u het zegt.\n\n89\n00:05:20.751 --> 00:05:25.107\nAls alternatief hebben we ook een zoutoplossing.\n\n90\n00:05:25.151 --> 00:05:27.751\nIs zoutoplossing veiliger?\n\n91\n00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:33.062\nJa, een zoutoplossing mag u zo vaak gebruiken als u wilt.\n\n92\n00:05:33.107 --> 00:05:38.151\nGeef mij de sterke neusspray maar, maar ik gebruik hem kort.\n\n93\n00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:43.263\nAfgesproken. Let u wel goed op die zeven dagen.\n\n94\n00:05:43.308 --> 00:05:47.352\nZal ik doen. Verkoopt u ook vitamines?\n\n95\n00:05:47.419 --> 00:05:51.019\nJa, we hebben veel soorten vitamines.\n\n96\n00:05:51.063 --> 00:05:55.152\nWelke vitamine is nu goed voor mijn weerstand?\n\n97\n00:05:55.197 --> 00:06:01.109\nVitamine C en vitamine D zijn erg populair bij verkoudheid.\n\n98\n00:06:01.131 --> 00:06:04.887\nHeeft u bruistabletten met vitamine C?\n\n99\n00:06:04.953 --> 00:06:10.042\nJa, we hebben bruistabletten met sinaasappelsmaak.\n\n100\n00:06:10.087 --> 00:06:13.709\nDie vind ik erg lekker. Doe die er maar bij.\n\n101\n00:06:13.753 --> 00:06:18.420\nEen tablet per dag in een glas water is genoeg.\n\n102\n00:06:18.442 --> 00:06:23.888\nPrima. Verkoopt u toevallig ook papieren zakdoekjes?\n\n103\n00:06:23.932 --> 00:06:26.888\nJa, die liggen hier bij de kassa.\n\n104\n00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.466\nMag ik daar twee pakjes van?\n\n105\n00:06:29.577 --> 00:06:33.643\nNatuurlijk. Heeft u ook droge lippen?\n\n106\n00:06:33.688 --> 00:06:39.266\nNu u het zegt, mijn lippen voelen heel droog aan.\n\n107\n00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:43.978\nWe hebben een fijne lippenbalsem tegen droge lippen.\n\n108\n00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.267\nDoe die er maar ook bij, alstublieft.\n\n109\n00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:52.289\nZo te zien heeft u nu een heel pakket verzameld!\n\n110\n00:06:52.356 --> 00:06:55.978\nJa, hopelijk ben ik snel weer beter.\n\n111\n00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.311\nBent u al klant bij onze apotheek?\n\n112\n00:06:59.378 --> 00:07:03.557\nNee, dit is de eerste keer dat ik hier ben.\n\n113\n00:07:03.579 --> 00:07:08.623\nWilt u zich inschrijven, of wilt u zo afrekenen?\n\n114\n00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.912\nIk wil nu gewoon zo afrekenen.\n\n115\n00:07:11.934 --> 00:07:14.312\nDat is geen enkel probleem.\n\n116\n00:07:14.379 --> 00:07:17.046\nHoeveel kost alles bij elkaar?\n\n117\n00:07:17.134 --> 00:07:24.847\nEven kijken... dat is in totaal tweeëntwintig euro en vijftig cent.\n\n118\n00:07:24.869 --> 00:07:28.291\nKan ik met mijn pinpas betalen?\n\n119\n00:07:28.336 --> 00:07:33.958\nJa hoor, u kunt de pas tegen het pinapparaat houden.\n\n120\n00:07:34.002 --> 00:07:37.824\nMomentje, ik pak mijn portemonnee.\n\n121\n00:07:37.869 --> 00:07:40.202\nNeem gerust uw tijd.\n\n122\n00:07:40.269 --> 00:07:45.559\nZo, het signaal geeft aan dat de betaling is gelukt.\n\n123\n00:07:45.581 --> 00:07:48.337\nKlopt, ik zie het op mijn scherm.\n\n124\n00:07:48.381 --> 00:07:50.603\nWilt u er een bonnetje bij?\n\n125\n00:07:50.781 --> 00:07:54.426\nJa graag, voor mijn administratie.\n\n126\n00:07:54.492 --> 00:07:59.448\nIk doe de bon en de bijsluiters netjes in het tasje.\n\n127\n00:07:59.492 --> 00:08:03.249\nHeel erg bedankt voor het advies en de hulp.\n\n128\n00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:07.538\nGraag gedaan. Heel veel beterschap!\n\n129\n00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.538\nDank u wel. Fijne dag nog!\n\n130\n00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.116\nFijne dag en tot ziens!\n\n131\n00:08:13.138 --> 00:08:14.716\nTot ziens!\n
dialogue_at_pharmacy	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:04.933\nGood afternoon! Welcome to the pharmacy.\n\n2\n00:00:04.978 --> 00:00:06.622\nGood afternoon.\n\n3\n00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.400\nHow can I help you today?\n\n4\n00:00:09.511 --> 00:00:11.846\nI'm not feeling very well.\n\n5\n00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.001\nI'm sorry to hear that. What kind of symptoms do you have?\n\n6\n00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:19.357\nI have a headache and muscle aches.\n\n7\n00:00:19.401 --> 00:00:22.157\nHow long have you been feeling like this?\n\n8\n00:00:22.179 --> 00:00:24.379\nSince yesterday evening.\n\n9\n00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:26.468\nDo you have a fever as well?\n\n10\n00:00:26.557 --> 00:00:30.334\nI think so. I'm feeling really cold.\n\n11\n00:00:30.379 --> 00:00:33.402\nHave you taken your temperature?\n\n12\n00:00:33.447 --> 00:00:36.980\nNo, I haven't done that yet.\n\n13\n00:00:37.024 --> 00:00:40.469\nIt would be a good idea to check it later.\n\n14\n00:00:40.513 --> 00:00:42.669\nYes, I'll do that.\n\n15\n00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:45.291\nDo you have a sore throat as well?\n\n16\n00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:48.047\nYes, my throat hurts a lot.\n\n17\n00:00:48.136 --> 00:00:50.780\nIs it hard to swallow?\n\n18\n00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:53.803\nYes, swallowing is really painful.\n\n19\n00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.537\nAnd do you have a cough?\n\n20\n00:00:55.603 --> 00:00:58.648\nYes, I've been coughing since this morning.\n\n21\n00:00:58.714 --> 00:01:02.848\nIs it a dry cough, or are you coughing up phlegm?\n\n22\n00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:05.714\nIt feels like a dry cough.\n\n23\n00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:11.359\nOkay, got it. Do you have a stuffy nose too?\n\n24\n00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:15.538\nYes, I can barely breathe through my nose.\n\n25\n00:01:15.582 --> 00:01:19.604\nThat's awful. Sounds like you've really come down with a cold.\n\n26\n00:01:19.649 --> 00:01:23.538\nYes, unfortunately. What would you recommend?\n\n27\n00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:27.649\nWe have a few options to help with your symptoms.\n\n28\n00:01:27.716 --> 00:01:32.693\nGreat. What medicine do you have for the headache?\n\n29\n00:01:32.738 --> 00:01:35.294\nAre you already taking paracetamol?\n\n30\n00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:38.739\nNo, I don't have any left at home.\n\n31\n00:01:38.783 --> 00:01:43.361\nParacetamol is the best place to start.\n\n32\n00:01:43.428 --> 00:01:46.561\nDoes that help with the muscle aches as well?\n\n33\n00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:51.961\nYes, paracetamol relieves pain and reduces fever.\n\n34\n00:01:52.117 --> 00:01:54.540\nOkay, I'd like that then.\n\n35\n00:01:54.584 --> 00:01:59.140\nWhich dosage would you like—500 milligrams?\n\n36\n00:01:59.207 --> 00:02:01.851\nIs that the standard dose?\n\n37\n00:02:01.896 --> 00:02:07.096\nYes, 500 milligrams is standard for adults.\n\n38\n00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.918\nHow many tablets can I take a day?\n\n39\n00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:15.008\nYou can take up to six tablets per day.\n\n40\n00:02:15.097 --> 00:02:18.630\nHow many hours apart should I take them?\n\n41\n00:02:18.697 --> 00:02:23.141\nYou can take one tablet every four to six hours.\n\n42\n00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:26.874\nShould I take the tablet with water?\n\n43\n00:02:26.919 --> 00:02:30.830\nYes, take it with a large glass of water.\n\n44\n00:02:30.852 --> 00:02:36.098\nIs it best to take it before or after meals?\n\n45\n00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:39.787\nWith paracetamol, that doesn't really matter.\n\n46\n00:02:39.853 --> 00:02:42.164\nOkay, that's convenient.\n\n47\n00:02:42.209 --> 00:02:46.320\nWould you like a pack of 20 or 50?\n\n48\n00:02:46.342 --> 00:02:49.942\nI'll take the pack of 50.\n\n49\n00:02:49.964 --> 00:02:54.587\nGreat, I'll set the paracetamol right here.\n\n50\n00:02:54.631 --> 00:02:58.832\nThanks. And what can I take for my sore throat?\n\n51\n00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:02.832\nWe have throat lozenges that numb the pain.\n\n52\n00:03:02.899 --> 00:03:04.743\nDo they work fast?\n\n53\n00:03:04.788 --> 00:03:08.632\nYes, those lozenges work very quickly.\n\n54\n00:03:08.699 --> 00:03:11.099\nWhat flavors do they come in?\n\n55\n00:03:11.143 --> 00:03:14.543\nWe have honey-lemon and menthol.\n\n56\n00:03:14.632 --> 00:03:18.411\nI'd like the honey-lemon flavor, please.\n\n57\n00:03:18.478 --> 00:03:22.856\nGood choice, that one is really soothing for the throat.\n\n58\n00:03:22.878 --> 00:03:26.433\nHow often can I take a lozenge?\n\n59\n00:03:26.522 --> 00:03:30.233\nYou can take one every two to three hours.\n\n60\n00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:33.011\nIs there a daily maximum?\n\n61\n00:03:33.078 --> 00:03:36.657\nYes, a maximum of eight tablets per day.\n\n62\n00:03:36.701 --> 00:03:40.857\nGot it. And do you have anything for the cough?\n\n63\n00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:45.946\nFor a dry cough, I have a very good cough syrup.\n\n64\n00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:48.212\nHow does that syrup work?\n\n65\n00:03:48.257 --> 00:03:53.012\nThe syrup coats your throat with a protective layer.\n\n66\n00:03:53.057 --> 00:03:55.190\nSo that makes me cough less?\n\n67\n00:03:55.212 --> 00:03:59.036\nExactly, it suppresses the urge to cough.\n\n68\n00:03:59.058 --> 00:04:02.458\nThat sounds good. How often do I take it?\n\n69\n00:04:02.502 --> 00:04:05.636\nOne measuring spoon three times a day.\n\n70\n00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.569\nDoes it come with a measuring spoon?\n\n71\n00:04:09.613 --> 00:04:13.747\nYes, there's a small spoon included in the box.\n\n72\n00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:18.526\nGreat. Should I take the syrup before going to sleep?\n\n73\n00:04:18.592 --> 00:04:24.014\nYes, a dose before bed will help you sleep better.\n\n74\n00:04:24.059 --> 00:04:27.370\nMy body definitely needs that right now.\n\n75\n00:04:27.414 --> 00:04:31.614\nRest is indeed very important when you're sick.\n\n76\n00:04:31.681 --> 00:04:35.281\nDefinitely. What do you have for a stuffy nose?\n\n77\n00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.438\nI have a nasal spray with xylometazoline.\n\n78\n00:04:39.482 --> 00:04:41.549\nWhat does that do exactly?\n\n79\n00:04:41.593 --> 00:04:46.438\nIt reduces swelling in the nasal passages.\n\n80\n00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:49.038\nSo I'll be able to breathe freely again?\n\n81\n00:04:49.127 --> 00:04:52.616\nYes, it starts working within a few minutes.\n\n82\n00:04:52.638 --> 00:04:56.060\nHow often can I use that nasal spray?\n\n83\n00:04:56.193 --> 00:05:01.394\nA maximum of three times a day, one spray per nostril.\n\n84\n00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:05.572\nCan I use that spray for a long time continuously?\n\n85\n00:05:05.594 --> 00:05:11.283\nNo, don't use it for more than seven consecutive days.\n\n86\n00:05:11.417 --> 00:05:13.483\nWhy shouldn't I?\n\n87\n00:05:13.572 --> 00:05:17.239\nOtherwise, your nose can become dependent on it.\n\n88\n00:05:17.328 --> 00:05:20.662\nOh, I didn't know that. Good to know.\n\n89\n00:05:20.751 --> 00:05:25.107\nAs an alternative, we also have a saline spray.\n\n90\n00:05:25.151 --> 00:05:27.751\nIs a saline spray safer?\n\n91\n00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:33.062\nYes, you can use a saline spray as often as you like.\n\n92\n00:05:33.107 --> 00:05:38.151\nI'll take the stronger nasal spray, but I'll only use it for a short time.\n\n93\n00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:43.263\nSounds like a plan. Just keep an eye on that seven-day limit.\n\n94\n00:05:43.308 --> 00:05:47.352\nI will. Do you sell vitamins as well?\n\n95\n00:05:47.419 --> 00:05:51.019\nYes, we have many types of vitamins.\n\n96\n00:05:51.063 --> 00:05:55.152\nWhich vitamin is good for boosting my immune system right now?\n\n97\n00:05:55.197 --> 00:06:01.109\nVitamin C and Vitamin D are very popular when you have a cold.\n\n98\n00:06:01.131 --> 00:06:04.887\nDo you have effervescent Vitamin C tablets?\n\n99\n00:06:04.953 --> 00:06:10.042\nYes, we have orange-flavored effervescent tablets.\n\n100\n00:06:10.087 --> 00:06:13.709\nI really like those. Add those as well, please.\n\n101\n00:06:13.753 --> 00:06:18.420\nOne tablet a day in a glass of water is enough.\n\n102\n00:06:18.442 --> 00:06:23.888\nGreat. By any chance, do you sell tissues?\n\n103\n00:06:23.932 --> 00:06:26.888\nYes, they're right here by the checkout.\n\n104\n00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.466\nCould I get two packs of those?\n\n105\n00:06:29.577 --> 00:06:33.643\nOf course. Do you have dry lips as well?\n\n106\n00:06:33.688 --> 00:06:39.266\nNow that you mention it, my lips do feel very dry.\n\n107\n00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:43.978\nWe have a nice lip balm for dry lips.\n\n108\n00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.267\nPlease add that too.\n\n109\n00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:52.289\nLooks like you've put together quite a package!\n\n110\n00:06:52.356 --> 00:06:55.978\nYes, hopefully I'll feel better soon.\n\n111\n00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.311\nAre you already registered at our pharmacy?\n\n112\n00:06:59.378 --> 00:07:03.557\nNo, this is my first time here.\n\n113\n00:07:03.579 --> 00:07:08.623\nWould you like to register, or just pay right now?\n\n114\n00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.912\nI'd just like to pay for now.\n\n115\n00:07:11.934 --> 00:07:14.312\nThat's no problem at all.\n\n116\n00:07:14.379 --> 00:07:17.046\nHow much does everything come to?\n\n117\n00:07:17.134 --> 00:07:24.847\nLet's see... that comes to twenty-two euros and fifty cents in total.\n\n118\n00:07:24.869 --> 00:07:28.291\nCan I pay by card?\n\n119\n00:07:28.336 --> 00:07:33.958\nYes, you can just tap your card on the terminal.\n\n120\n00:07:34.002 --> 00:07:37.824\nJust a moment, let me get my wallet.\n\n121\n00:07:37.869 --> 00:07:40.202\nTake your time.\n\n122\n00:07:40.269 --> 00:07:45.559\nThere, the beep indicates the payment went through.\n\n123\n00:07:45.581 --> 00:07:48.337\nThat's right, I see it on my screen.\n\n124\n00:07:48.381 --> 00:07:50.603\nWould you like a receipt?\n\n125\n00:07:50.781 --> 00:07:54.426\nYes please, for my records.\n\n126\n00:07:54.492 --> 00:07:59.448\nI'll put the receipt and the leaflets neatly in the bag for you.\n\n127\n00:07:59.492 --> 00:08:03.249\nThank you so much for the advice and help.\n\n128\n00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:07.538\nYou're very welcome. Get well soon!\n\n129\n00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.538\nThank you. Have a nice day!\n\n130\n00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.116\nHave a nice day, goodbye!\n\n131\n00:08:13.138 --> 00:08:14.716\nGoodbye!\n
dialogue_restaurant_meal	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:05.400\nGoedemiddag! Welkom in ons restaurant.\n\n2\n00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:10.378\nGoedemiddag! Heeft u een tafel voor één persoon?\n\n3\n00:00:10.422 --> 00:00:12.933\nJazeker. Volg mij maar.\n\n4\n00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:17.867\nDank u wel. Is deze tafel bij het raam vrij?\n\n5\n00:00:17.911 --> 00:00:22.733\nJa, die is helemaal vrij. Gaat u lekker zitten.\n\n6\n00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.378\nFijn, dank u wel. Het is hier erg licht.\n\n7\n00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.067\nDank u! Wilt u alvast iets drinken?\n\n8\n00:00:31.111 --> 00:00:33.644\nWat voor sapjes heeft u?\n\n9\n00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:38.956\nWe hebben vers sinaasappelsap, appelsap en ijsthee.\n\n10\n00:00:38.978 --> 00:00:43.733\nDoe maar een vers sinaasappelsapje, alstublieft.\n\n11\n00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.957\nWilt u daar ook een glas water bij?\n\n12\n00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:50.312\nJa, een glas plat water graag.\n\n13\n00:00:50.357 --> 00:00:55.090\nHelemaal goed. Ik breng meteen de menukaart mee.\n\n14\n00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:57.468\nPrima, hartelijk dank.\n\n15\n00:00:57.534 --> 00:01:02.868\nAlsjeblieft, hier is uw sinaasappelsap en het water.\n\n16\n00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:06.579\nDank u wel. Het ziet er lekker uit.\n\n17\n00:01:06.668 --> 00:01:09.246\nEn hier is de menukaart.\n\n18\n00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:13.334\nDank u. Heeft u ook dagschotels?\n\n19\n00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:16.934\nJa, de dagschotel staat op het bord daar.\n\n20\n00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:21.668\nAh, ik zie het. Wat is de soep van de dag?\n\n21\n00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.112\nVandaag hebben we verse tomatensoep met brood.\n\n22\n00:01:26.157 --> 00:01:30.557\nKlinkt goed. Is de tomatensoep vegetarisch?\n\n23\n00:01:30.646 --> 00:01:34.868\nJa, de tomatensoep is helemaal vegetarisch.\n\n24\n00:01:34.912 --> 00:01:39.023\nMooi. En wat is de dagschotel precies?\n\n25\n00:01:39.068 --> 00:01:43.823\nDat is kipfilet met patat en een kleine salade.\n\n26\n00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:46.401\nIs de kip met een sausje?\n\n27\n00:01:46.446 --> 00:01:50.357\nJa, er zit een milde champignonsaus bij.\n\n28\n00:01:50.468 --> 00:01:53.890\nO, ik hou erg van champignons.\n\n29\n00:01:53.912 --> 00:01:57.468\nHet is inderdaad een populair gerecht.\n\n30\n00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:01.557\nMaar ik twijfel nog tussen de kip en de zalm.\n\n31\n00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:06.979\nDe zalm komt met gebakken aardappels en verse groenten.\n\n32\n00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:10.112\nWat voor groenten zitten daarbij?\n\n33\n00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:13.690\nVandaag hebben we broccoli en worteltjes.\n\n34\n00:02:13.757 --> 00:02:16.780\nIs de zalm gegrild of gebakken?\n\n35\n00:02:16.802 --> 00:02:20.447\nDe zalm wordt vers gegrild op de plaat.\n\n36\n00:02:20.469 --> 00:02:23.447\nDat klinkt heel gezond en lekker.\n\n37\n00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:25.069\nDat is het zeker.\n\n38\n00:02:25.136 --> 00:02:28.358\nIk neem toch de zalm met aardappels!\n\n39\n00:02:28.402 --> 00:02:34.158\nEen uitstekende keuze. Wilt u ook de tomatensoep vooraf?\n\n40\n00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:36.158\nJa, heel graag.\n\n41\n00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:38.580\nWilt u brood bij de soep?\n\n42\n00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:41.424\nJa, bruin brood als dat kan.\n\n43\n00:02:41.469 --> 00:02:44.958\nGeen probleem, dat schrijf ik op.\n\n44\n00:02:45.024 --> 00:02:46.936\nSuper, dank u wel.\n\n45\n00:02:47.002 --> 00:02:50.691\nIk geef de bestelling meteen door aan de kok.\n\n46\n00:02:50.758 --> 00:02:53.736\nIs goed, ik wacht rustig af.\n\n47\n00:02:53.802 --> 00:02:57.402\nHier heeft u alvast het bruine brood.\n\n48\n00:02:57.424 --> 00:03:00.624\nDank u. Is er ook boter bij?\n\n49\n00:03:00.691 --> 00:03:04.402\nO ja, hier is wat verse kruidenboter.\n\n50\n00:03:04.447 --> 00:03:07.469\nDank u wel, dat ruikt al goed.\n\n51\n00:03:07.558 --> 00:03:10.869\nEn hier is de warme tomatensoep.\n\n52\n00:03:10.936 --> 00:03:13.380\nZo, die is snel klaar!\n\n53\n00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:16.113\nPas op, het bord is vrij warm.\n\n54\n00:03:16.136 --> 00:03:18.558\nBedankt voor de waarschuwing.\n\n55\n00:03:18.647 --> 00:03:20.691\nEet smakelijk!\n\n56\n00:03:20.713 --> 00:03:22.358\nDank u wel.\n\n57\n00:03:22.447 --> 00:03:24.558\nSmaakt de soep u?\n\n58\n00:03:24.624 --> 00:03:29.869\nJa, hij is echt heerlijk. Lekker vol van smaak.\n\n59\n00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:31.958\nFijn om te horen!\n\n60\n00:03:32.002 --> 00:03:34.491\nIs het brood zelfgemaakt?\n\n61\n00:03:34.558 --> 00:03:39.313\nJa, de bakker hier om de hoek bakt het elke ochtend.\n\n62\n00:03:39.336 --> 00:03:41.602\nDat proef je meteen.\n\n63\n00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:45.248\nKan ik nog een glas sap voor u inschenken?\n\n64\n00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:49.359\nNee hoor, ik heb nog genoeg water.\n\n65\n00:03:49.381 --> 00:03:52.803\nPrima. Laat de soep u smaken.\n\n66\n00:03:52.848 --> 00:03:54.114\nDank u!\n\n67\n00:03:54.159 --> 00:03:57.759\nMag ik het bord van de soep meenemen?\n\n68\n00:03:57.826 --> 00:04:02.514\nJa hoor, ik ben klaar. Het was erg lekker.\n\n69\n00:04:02.581 --> 00:04:06.403\nFijn! Het hoofdgerecht komt er zo aan.\n\n70\n00:04:06.448 --> 00:04:08.181\nHelemaal goed.\n\n71\n00:04:08.226 --> 00:04:13.692\nZo, hier is uw gegrilde zalm met aardappels en groenten.\n\n72\n00:04:13.759 --> 00:04:17.292\nWauw, het ziet er prachtig uit!\n\n73\n00:04:17.314 --> 00:04:20.914\nPas op, het bord is ook nu weer warm.\n\n74\n00:04:20.981 --> 00:04:23.381\nIk zal voorzichtig zijn.\n\n75\n00:04:23.426 --> 00:04:27.270\nHier is ook mayonaise voor bij de aardappels.\n\n76\n00:04:27.359 --> 00:04:30.181\nO, wat attent, dank u wel.\n\n77\n00:04:30.226 --> 00:04:33.781\nHeeft u zo alles wat u nodig heeft?\n\n78\n00:04:33.848 --> 00:04:36.159\nJa, alles is compleet.\n\n79\n00:04:36.248 --> 00:04:38.492\nEet smakelijk dan!\n\n80\n00:04:38.514 --> 00:04:40.003\nDank u wel!\n\n81\n00:04:40.048 --> 00:04:41.870\nIs alles naar wens?\n\n82\n00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:45.114\nJa, de zalm is echt super mals!\n\n83\n00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:47.314\nHeel fijn om te horen.\n\n84\n00:04:47.381 --> 00:04:50.514\nEn de groenten zijn lekker knapperig.\n\n85\n00:04:50.559 --> 00:04:54.826\nMooi zo. Wilt u nog wat extra water?\n\n86\n00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.448\nEen klein glaasje zou wel fijn zijn.\n\n87\n00:04:58.514 --> 00:05:02.092\nIk breng meteen een nieuw flesje water.\n\n88\n00:05:02.159 --> 00:05:03.803\nHartelijk dank.\n\n89\n00:05:03.892 --> 00:05:07.226\nAlsjeblieft, uw schone glas en water.\n\n90\n00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.670\nDank u wel voor de goede service.\n\n91\n00:05:10.714 --> 00:05:14.448\nGraag gedaan! Geniet van uw maaltijd.\n\n92\n00:05:14.516 --> 00:05:16.049\nZal ik doen.\n\n93\n00:05:16.071 --> 00:05:18.649\nKan ik het bord al meenemen?\n\n94\n00:05:18.716 --> 00:05:22.449\nJa hoor, het was echt heerlijk.\n\n95\n00:05:22.471 --> 00:05:24.804\nFijn dat het gesmaakt heeft.\n\n96\n00:05:24.849 --> 00:05:27.693\nDe zalm was perfect gegaard.\n\n97\n00:05:27.738 --> 00:05:31.271\nWilt u misschien de dessertkaart zien?\n\n98\n00:05:31.338 --> 00:05:35.849\nIk zit al best vol, maar ik ben wel benieuwd.\n\n99\n00:05:35.938 --> 00:05:38.249\nIk breng de kaart even.\n\n100\n00:05:38.293 --> 00:05:39.538\nDank u.\n\n101\n00:05:39.582 --> 00:05:43.360\nHier is de kaart met toetjes en koffie.\n\n102\n00:05:43.404 --> 00:05:47.538\nDank u wel. Wat voor ijs heeft u?\n\n103\n00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:52.116\nWe hebben vanille, aardbei en chocolade-ijs.\n\n104\n00:05:52.182 --> 00:05:54.516\nEn heeft u ook appeltaart?\n\n105\n00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:58.138\nJa, warme appeltaart met slagroom.\n\n106\n00:05:58.227 --> 00:06:02.004\nO, warme appeltaart is mijn favoriet!\n\n107\n00:06:02.049 --> 00:06:05.516\nWilt u er een kopje koffie of thee bij?\n\n108\n00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:09.716\nDoe maar een cappuccino, alstublieft.\n\n109\n00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.493\nMet gewone melk of havermelk?\n\n110\n00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:15.071\nMet havermelk als dat kan.\n\n111\n00:06:15.138 --> 00:06:17.116\nZeker, dat kan.\n\n112\n00:06:17.204 --> 00:06:20.782\nEn de appeltaart graag zonder slagroom.\n\n113\n00:06:20.849 --> 00:06:27.982\nDus een warme appeltaart zonder slagroom en een cappuccino met havermelk?\n\n114\n00:06:28.027 --> 00:06:30.471\nJa, dat klopt helemaal.\n\n115\n00:06:30.538 --> 00:06:33.271\nIk ga het meteen voor u maken.\n\n116\n00:06:33.293 --> 00:06:34.582\nBedankt.\n\n117\n00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:38.849\nAlsjeblieft, uw cappuccino met havermelk.\n\n118\n00:06:38.871 --> 00:06:42.427\nDank u, het schuim ziet er goed uit.\n\n119\n00:06:42.516 --> 00:06:45.539\nEn hier is de warme appeltaart.\n\n120\n00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:48.939\nHeerlijk, het ruikt naar kaneel.\n\n121\n00:06:49.006 --> 00:06:50.761\nGeniet ervan!\n\n122\n00:06:50.806 --> 00:06:52.339\nDank u wel.\n\n123\n00:06:52.383 --> 00:06:55.383\nWas de koffie en de taart lekker?\n\n124\n00:06:55.450 --> 00:07:01.917\nJa, ontzettend lekker. De appeltaart was erg vers.\n\n125\n00:07:01.939 --> 00:07:06.006\nFijn om te horen! Kan ik nog iets voor u doen?\n\n126\n00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.961\nNee dank u, mag ik de rekening vragen?\n\n127\n00:07:09.983 --> 00:07:14.806\nNatúúrlijk. Wilt u pinnen of contant betalen?\n\n128\n00:07:14.872 --> 00:07:18.206\nIk wil graag pinnen met mijn pinpas.\n\n129\n00:07:18.228 --> 00:07:22.317\nDat is prima. Ik haal het pinapparaat.\n\n130\n00:07:22.361 --> 00:07:23.761\nHeel goed.\n\n131\n00:07:23.828 --> 00:07:31.561\nHier is het pinapparaat. Het bedrag is achtentwintig euro en vijftig cent.\n\n132\n00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:35.539\nPrima. Ik houd mijn pas tegen de scanner.\n\n133\n00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:39.650\nHij is goedgekeurd. Wilt u de bon hebben?\n\n134\n00:07:39.672 --> 00:07:42.050\nNee hoor, de bon hoeft niet.\n\n135\n00:07:42.117 --> 00:07:46.228\nIs goed. Was alles verder naar wens vandaag?\n\n136\n00:07:46.294 --> 00:07:51.983\nJa, de service was erg vriendelijk en het eten was heerlijk.\n\n137\n00:07:52.028 --> 00:07:54.650\nHartelijk dank voor uw bezoek.\n\n138\n00:07:54.672 --> 00:07:57.739\nBedankt en een fijne dag verder!\n\n139\n00:07:57.761 --> 00:08:00.939\nFijne dag en tot de volgende keer!\n\n140\n00:08:00.983 --> 00:08:02.383\nTot ziens!\n
dialogue_restaurant_meal	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:05.400\nGood afternoon! Welcome to our restaurant.\n\n2\n00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:10.378\nGood afternoon! Do you have a table for one?\n\n3\n00:00:10.422 --> 00:00:12.933\nCertainly. Follow me, please.\n\n4\n00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:17.867\nThank you. Is this table by the window free?\n\n5\n00:00:17.911 --> 00:00:22.733\nYes, it's completely available. Please, take a seat.\n\n6\n00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.378\nGreat, thank you. It's very bright here.\n\n7\n00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.067\nThank you! Can I get you something to drink to start?\n\n8\n00:00:31.111 --> 00:00:33.644\nWhat kind of juices do you have?\n\n9\n00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:38.956\nWe have fresh orange juice, apple juice, and iced tea.\n\n10\n00:00:38.978 --> 00:00:43.733\nI'll have a fresh orange juice, please.\n\n11\n00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.957\nWould you like a glass of water with that?\n\n12\n00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:50.312\nYes, a glass of still water, please.\n\n13\n00:00:50.357 --> 00:00:55.090\nPerfect. I'll bring the menu right over.\n\n14\n00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:57.468\nGreat, thank you very much.\n\n15\n00:00:57.534 --> 00:01:02.868\nHere you go, your orange juice and water.\n\n16\n00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:06.579\nThank you. It looks lovely.\n\n17\n00:01:06.668 --> 00:01:09.246\nAnd here is the menu.\n\n18\n00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:13.334\nThank you. Do you have any daily specials?\n\n19\n00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:16.934\nYes, today's special is written on the board over there.\n\n20\n00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:21.668\nAh, I see. What's the soup of the day?\n\n21\n00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.112\nToday we have fresh tomato soup with bread.\n\n22\n00:01:26.157 --> 00:01:30.557\nSounds good. Is the tomato soup vegetarian?\n\n23\n00:01:30.646 --> 00:01:34.868\nYes, the tomato soup is completely vegetarian.\n\n24\n00:01:34.912 --> 00:01:39.023\nGreat. And what exactly is the daily special?\n\n25\n00:01:39.068 --> 00:01:43.823\nIt's chicken breast with fries and a side salad.\n\n26\n00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:46.401\nDoes the chicken come with a sauce?\n\n27\n00:01:46.446 --> 00:01:50.357\nYes, it comes with a mild mushroom sauce.\n\n28\n00:01:50.468 --> 00:01:53.890\nOh, I really love mushrooms.\n\n29\n00:01:53.912 --> 00:01:57.468\nIt's a very popular dish, indeed.\n\n30\n00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:01.557\nI'm still torn between the chicken and the salmon, though.\n\n31\n00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:06.979\nThe salmon comes with roasted potatoes and fresh vegetables.\n\n32\n00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:10.112\nWhat kind of vegetables come with it?\n\n33\n00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:13.690\nToday we have broccoli and carrots.\n\n34\n00:02:13.757 --> 00:02:16.780\nIs the salmon grilled or pan-fried?\n\n35\n00:02:16.802 --> 00:02:20.447\nThe salmon is freshly grilled on the flat top.\n\n36\n00:02:20.469 --> 00:02:23.447\nThat sounds very healthy and delicious.\n\n37\n00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:25.069\nIt certainly is.\n\n38\n00:02:25.136 --> 00:02:28.358\nI think I'll go with the salmon and potatoes after all!\n\n39\n00:02:28.402 --> 00:02:34.158\nAn excellent choice. Would you also like the tomato soup as a starter?\n\n40\n00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:36.158\nYes, I'd love that.\n\n41\n00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:38.580\nWould you like some bread with the soup?\n\n42\n00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:41.424\nYes, brown bread if possible.\n\n43\n00:02:41.469 --> 00:02:44.958\nNo problem, I'll write that down.\n\n44\n00:02:45.024 --> 00:02:46.936\nGreat, thank you.\n\n45\n00:02:47.002 --> 00:02:50.691\nI'll put the order through to the kitchen right away.\n\n46\n00:02:50.758 --> 00:02:53.736\nSounds good, I'll hang tight.\n\n47\n00:02:53.802 --> 00:02:57.402\nHere's the brown bread to start.\n\n48\n00:02:57.424 --> 00:03:00.624\nThank you. Does it come with butter as well?\n\n49\n00:03:00.691 --> 00:03:04.402\nOh yes, here's some fresh herb butter.\n\n50\n00:03:04.447 --> 00:03:07.469\nThank you, that smells delicious already.\n\n51\n00:03:07.558 --> 00:03:10.869\nAnd here is the hot tomato soup.\n\n52\n00:03:10.936 --> 00:03:13.380\nWow, that was fast!\n\n53\n00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:16.113\nCareful, the bowl is quite hot.\n\n54\n00:03:16.136 --> 00:03:18.558\nThanks for the warning.\n\n55\n00:03:18.647 --> 00:03:20.691\nEnjoy your meal!\n\n56\n00:03:20.713 --> 00:03:22.358\nThank you.\n\n57\n00:03:22.447 --> 00:03:24.558\nHow is the soup?\n\n58\n00:03:24.624 --> 00:03:29.869\nIt's really delicious. Full of flavor.\n\n59\n00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:31.958\nGlad to hear that!\n\n60\n00:03:32.002 --> 00:03:34.491\nIs the bread homemade?\n\n61\n00:03:34.558 --> 00:03:39.313\nYes, the baker just around the corner bakes it fresh every morning.\n\n62\n00:03:39.336 --> 00:03:41.602\nYou can really taste the difference.\n\n63\n00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:45.248\nCan I pour you another glass of juice?\n\n64\n00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:49.359\nNo thanks, I still have plenty of water.\n\n65\n00:03:49.381 --> 00:03:52.803\nAlright. Enjoy the rest of your soup.\n\n66\n00:03:52.848 --> 00:03:54.114\nThank you!\n\n67\n00:03:54.159 --> 00:03:57.759\nMay I take your soup bowl?\n\n68\n00:03:57.826 --> 00:04:02.514\nYes, go ahead, I'm finished. It was lovely.\n\n69\n00:04:02.581 --> 00:04:06.403\nWonderful! The main course will be out shortly.\n\n70\n00:04:06.448 --> 00:04:08.181\nSounds great.\n\n71\n00:04:08.226 --> 00:04:13.692\nHere is your grilled salmon with potatoes and vegetables.\n\n72\n00:04:13.759 --> 00:04:17.292\nWow, it looks beautiful!\n\n73\n00:04:17.314 --> 00:04:20.914\nCareful, the plate is hot again.\n\n74\n00:04:20.981 --> 00:04:23.381\nI'll be careful.\n\n75\n00:04:23.426 --> 00:04:27.270\nHere's some mayonnaise for the potatoes as well.\n\n76\n00:04:27.359 --> 00:04:30.181\nOh, how thoughtful, thank you.\n\n77\n00:04:30.226 --> 00:04:33.781\nDo you have everything you need for now?\n\n78\n00:04:33.848 --> 00:04:36.159\nYes, everything is here.\n\n79\n00:04:36.248 --> 00:04:38.492\nEnjoy your meal then!\n\n80\n00:04:38.514 --> 00:04:40.003\nThank you!\n\n81\n00:04:40.048 --> 00:04:41.870\nHow is everything?\n\n82\n00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:45.114\nThe salmon is really tender!\n\n83\n00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:47.314\nVery glad to hear that.\n\n84\n00:04:47.381 --> 00:04:50.514\nAnd the vegetables are nice and crisp.\n\n85\n00:04:50.559 --> 00:04:54.826\nWonderful. Would you like some more water?\n\n86\n00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.448\nA small glass would be nice.\n\n87\n00:04:58.514 --> 00:05:02.092\nI'll bring a fresh bottle of water right away.\n\n88\n00:05:02.159 --> 00:05:03.803\nThank you very much.\n\n89\n00:05:03.892 --> 00:05:07.226\nHere you go, your fresh glass and water.\n\n90\n00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.670\nThank you for the great service.\n\n91\n00:05:10.714 --> 00:05:14.448\nMy pleasure! Enjoy your food.\n\n92\n00:05:14.516 --> 00:05:16.049\nWill do.\n\n93\n00:05:16.071 --> 00:05:18.649\nMay I clear your plate?\n\n94\n00:05:18.716 --> 00:05:22.449\nYes, please, it was truly delicious.\n\n95\n00:05:22.471 --> 00:05:24.804\nGlad you enjoyed it.\n\n96\n00:05:24.849 --> 00:05:27.693\nThe salmon was cooked to perfection.\n\n97\n00:05:27.738 --> 00:05:31.271\nWould you like to see the dessert menu?\n\n98\n00:05:31.338 --> 00:05:35.849\nI'm quite full, but I am curious.\n\n99\n00:05:35.938 --> 00:05:38.249\nI'll grab the menu for you.\n\n100\n00:05:38.293 --> 00:05:39.538\nThank you.\n\n101\n00:05:39.582 --> 00:05:43.360\nHere is the menu with desserts and coffee.\n\n102\n00:05:43.404 --> 00:05:47.538\nThank you. What ice cream flavors do you have?\n\n103\n00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:52.116\nWe have vanilla, strawberry, and chocolate ice cream.\n\n104\n00:05:52.182 --> 00:05:54.516\nAnd do you have apple pie?\n\n105\n00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:58.138\nYes, warm apple pie with whipped cream.\n\n106\n00:05:58.227 --> 00:06:02.004\nOh, warm apple pie is my favorite!\n\n107\n00:06:02.049 --> 00:06:05.516\nWould you like a cup of coffee or tea with that?\n\n108\n00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:09.716\nI'll have a cappuccino, please.\n\n109\n00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.493\nWith regular milk or oat milk?\n\n110\n00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:15.071\nWith oat milk, if possible.\n\n111\n00:06:15.138 --> 00:06:17.116\nCertainly, we can do that.\n\n112\n00:06:17.204 --> 00:06:20.782\nAnd the apple pie without whipped cream, please.\n\n113\n00:06:20.849 --> 00:06:27.982\nSo one warm apple pie without whipped cream and an oat milk cappuccino?\n\n114\n00:06:28.027 --> 00:06:30.471\nYes, that's exactly right.\n\n115\n00:06:30.538 --> 00:06:33.271\nI'll get that ready for you right away.\n\n116\n00:06:33.293 --> 00:06:34.582\nThanks.\n\n117\n00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:38.849\nHere you go, your cappuccino with oat milk.\n\n118\n00:06:38.871 --> 00:06:42.427\nThank you, the froth looks great.\n\n119\n00:06:42.516 --> 00:06:45.539\nAnd here is the warm apple pie.\n\n120\n00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:48.939\nWonderful, it smells like cinnamon.\n\n121\n00:06:49.006 --> 00:06:50.761\nEnjoy!\n\n122\n00:06:50.806 --> 00:06:52.339\nThank you.\n\n123\n00:06:52.383 --> 00:06:55.383\nHow were the coffee and pie?\n\n124\n00:06:55.450 --> 00:07:01.917\nReally lovely. The apple pie was so fresh.\n\n125\n00:07:01.939 --> 00:07:06.006\nGlad to hear that! Can I get you anything else?\n\n126\n00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.961\nNo thank you, could I have the bill, please?\n\n127\n00:07:09.983 --> 00:07:14.806\nOf course. Will you be paying by card or cash?\n\n128\n00:07:14.872 --> 00:07:18.206\nI'd like to pay by card, please.\n\n129\n00:07:18.228 --> 00:07:22.317\nNo problem. I'll get the card reader.\n\n130\n00:07:22.361 --> 00:07:23.761\nSounds good.\n\n131\n00:07:23.828 --> 00:07:31.561\nHere is the card reader. The total is twenty-eight euros and fifty cents.\n\n132\n00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:35.539\nGreat. I'll tap my card.\n\n133\n00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:39.650\nIt went through. Would you like a receipt?\n\n134\n00:07:39.672 --> 00:07:42.050\nNo thanks, no need for a receipt.\n\n135\n00:07:42.117 --> 00:07:46.228\nAlright. Was everything else to your satisfaction today?\n\n136\n00:07:46.294 --> 00:07:51.983\nYes, the service was very friendly and the food was delicious.\n\n137\n00:07:52.028 --> 00:07:54.650\nThank you very much for coming.\n\n138\n00:07:54.672 --> 00:07:57.739\nThank you, and have a nice rest of your day!\n\n139\n00:07:57.761 --> 00:08:00.939\nHave a great day and see you next time!\n\n140\n00:08:00.983 --> 00:08:02.383\nGoodbye!\n
grammar_als_conditional	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.780\nImagine you are making weekend plans.\n\n2\n00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.721\nYou want to say a condition.\n\n3\n00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:13.001\nFor example: If I have time...\n\n4\n00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:16.741\nIn Dutch, we use 'als'.\n\n5\n00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.562\n'Als' means 'if' or 'when'.\n\n6\n00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:24.462\nIt creates a conditional sentence.\n\n7\n00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:28.302\nLet me show you a simple sentence.\n\n8\n00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:34.143\nAls het regent, blijf ik binnen.\n\n9\n00:00:34.203 --> 00:00:38.563\nIf it rains, I stay inside.\n\n10\n00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:41.544\nLook at the order of words.\n\n11\n00:00:41.604 --> 00:00:46.164\nIn first clause, verb goes end.\n\n12\n00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:49.584\nRegent is at the end.\n\n13\n00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:54.145\nIn second clause, verb comes first.\n\n14\n00:00:54.205 --> 00:00:58.545\nBlijf comes right after the comma!\n\n15\n00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:02.086\nLet me give you another example.\n\n16\n00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:08.926\nAls ik tijd heb, ga ik fietsen.\n\n17\n00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:13.167\nIf I have time, I go cycling.\n\n18\n00:01:13.207 --> 00:01:16.987\nNotice where the verb 'heb' goes?\n\n19\n00:01:17.027 --> 00:01:19.967\nIt goes directly to the end!\n\n20\n00:01:20.047 --> 00:01:22.907\nAnd 'ga' comes right after!\n\n21\n00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:26.548\nNow, can you guess the next sentence?\n\n22\n00:01:26.588 --> 00:01:29.968\nHow do you say: If you come...\n\n23\n00:01:30.028 --> 00:01:31.848\n...I will cook soup?\n\n24\n00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.289\nListen carefully to the answer.\n\n25\n00:01:34.349 --> 00:01:38.409\nAls jij komt, kook ik soep.\n\n26\n00:01:38.469 --> 00:01:41.469\nIf you come, I cook soup.\n\n27\n00:01:41.509 --> 00:01:43.769\nGreat job if you got that!\n\n28\n00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:46.790\nLet's repeat the core pattern.\n\n29\n00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.310\nFirst clause: als plus subject plus verb.\n\n30\n00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:58.131\nSecond clause: verb plus subject.\n\n31\n00:01:58.171 --> 00:02:00.371\nLet me show you a few more!\n\n32\n00:02:00.431 --> 00:02:04.511\nAls het zonnig is, wandel ik.\n\n33\n00:02:04.571 --> 00:02:07.312\nIf it is sunny, I walk.\n\n34\n00:02:07.372 --> 00:02:11.272\nAls ik honger heb, eet ik.\n\n35\n00:02:11.332 --> 00:02:11.792\nIf I am hungry, I eat.\n\n36\n00:02:11.892 --> 00:02:13.892\nAls zij belt, neem ik op.\n\n37\n00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:17.913\nIf she calls, I pick up.\n\n38\n00:02:17.953 --> 00:02:22.133\nNow let's look at common mistakes.\n\n39\n00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:26.513\nMistake one: wrong verb position.\n\n40\n00:02:26.553 --> 00:02:31.614\nBeginners often say: Als ik heb tijd...\n\n41\n00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:34.594\nThat is not correct in Dutch.\n\n42\n00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:39.334\nThe verb 'heb' must go end.\n\n43\n00:02:39.394 --> 00:02:44.375\nAls ik tijd heb, lees ik.\n\n44\n00:02:44.455 --> 00:02:48.675\nIf I have time, I read.\n\n45\n00:02:48.715 --> 00:02:52.936\nMistake two: forgetting verb swap.\n\n46\n00:02:52.956 --> 00:02:58.176\nDon't say: Als het regent, ik blijf.\n\n47\n00:02:58.236 --> 00:03:02.897\nAfter the comma, start with verb!\n\n48\n00:03:02.957 --> 00:03:07.337\nAls het regent, blijf ik.\n\n49\n00:03:07.397 --> 00:03:10.897\nIf it rains, I stay.\n\n50\n00:03:10.937 --> 00:03:14.498\nRemember this quick memory tip:\n\n51\n00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:18.218\n'Als' pushes the verb to end,\n\n52\n00:03:18.278 --> 00:03:21.838\nthen two verbs meet at comma!\n\n53\n00:03:21.878 --> 00:03:25.759\nHeb and ga meet at comma!\n\n54\n00:03:25.859 --> 00:03:29.559\nLet me summarize our main rule.\n\n55\n00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:32.899\nVandaag leerden we zinnen met als.\n\n56\n00:03:32.939 --> 00:03:37.300\nToday we learned sentences with als.\n\n57\n00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.640\nKeep practicing your Dutch conditionals!\n
grammar_als_conditional	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.780\nImagine you are making weekend plans.\n\n2\n00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.721\nYou want to say a condition.\n\n3\n00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:13.001\nFor example: If I have time...\n\n4\n00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:16.741\nIn Dutch, we use 'als'.\n\n5\n00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.562\n'Als' means 'if' or 'when'.\n\n6\n00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:24.462\nIt creates a conditional sentence.\n\n7\n00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:28.302\nLet me show you a simple sentence.\n\n8\n00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:34.143\nIf it rains, I stay inside.\n\n9\n00:00:34.203 --> 00:00:38.563\nIf it rains, I stay inside.\n\n10\n00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:41.544\nLook at the order of words.\n\n11\n00:00:41.604 --> 00:00:46.164\nIn first clause, verb goes end.\n\n12\n00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:49.584\nRegent is at the end.\n\n13\n00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:54.145\nIn second clause, verb comes first.\n\n14\n00:00:54.205 --> 00:00:58.545\nBlijf comes right after the comma!\n\n15\n00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:02.086\nLet me give you another example.\n\n16\n00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:08.926\nIf I have time, I go cycling.\n\n17\n00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:13.167\nIf I have time, I go cycling.\n\n18\n00:01:13.207 --> 00:01:16.987\nNotice where the verb 'heb' goes?\n\n19\n00:01:17.027 --> 00:01:19.967\nIt goes directly to the end!\n\n20\n00:01:20.047 --> 00:01:22.907\nAnd 'ga' comes right after!\n\n21\n00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:26.548\nNow, can you guess the next sentence?\n\n22\n00:01:26.588 --> 00:01:29.968\nHow do you say: If you come...\n\n23\n00:01:30.028 --> 00:01:31.848\n...I will cook soup?\n\n24\n00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.289\nListen carefully to the answer.\n\n25\n00:01:34.349 --> 00:01:38.409\nIf you come, I cook soup.\n\n26\n00:01:38.469 --> 00:01:41.469\nIf you come, I cook soup.\n\n27\n00:01:41.509 --> 00:01:43.769\nGreat job if you got that!\n\n28\n00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:46.790\nLet's repeat the core pattern.\n\n29\n00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.310\nFirst clause: als plus subject plus verb.\n\n30\n00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:58.131\nSecond clause: verb plus subject.\n\n31\n00:01:58.171 --> 00:02:00.371\nLet me show you a few more!\n\n32\n00:02:00.431 --> 00:02:04.511\nIf it is sunny, I walk.\n\n33\n00:02:04.571 --> 00:02:07.312\nIf it is sunny, I walk.\n\n34\n00:02:07.372 --> 00:02:11.272\nIf I am hungry, I eat.\n\n35\n00:02:11.332 --> 00:02:11.792\nIf I am hungry, I eat.\n\n36\n00:02:11.892 --> 00:02:13.892\nIf she calls, I pick up.\n\n37\n00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:17.913\nIf she calls, I pick up.\n\n38\n00:02:17.953 --> 00:02:22.133\nNow let's look at common mistakes.\n\n39\n00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:26.513\nMistake one: wrong verb position.\n\n40\n00:02:26.553 --> 00:02:31.614\nBeginners often say: Als ik heb tijd...\n\n41\n00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:34.594\nThat is not correct in Dutch.\n\n42\n00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:39.334\nThe verb 'heb' must go end.\n\n43\n00:02:39.394 --> 00:02:44.375\nIf I have time, I read.\n\n44\n00:02:44.455 --> 00:02:48.675\nIf I have time, I read.\n\n45\n00:02:48.715 --> 00:02:52.936\nMistake two: forgetting verb swap.\n\n46\n00:02:52.956 --> 00:02:58.176\nDon't say: Als het regent, ik blijf.\n\n47\n00:02:58.236 --> 00:03:02.897\nAfter the comma, start with verb!\n\n48\n00:03:02.957 --> 00:03:07.337\nIf it rains, I stay.\n\n49\n00:03:07.397 --> 00:03:10.897\nIf it rains, I stay.\n\n50\n00:03:10.937 --> 00:03:14.498\nRemember this quick memory tip:\n\n51\n00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:18.218\n'Als' pushes the verb to end,\n\n52\n00:03:18.278 --> 00:03:21.838\nthen two verbs meet at comma!\n\n53\n00:03:21.878 --> 00:03:25.759\nHeb and ga meet at comma!\n\n54\n00:03:25.859 --> 00:03:29.559\nLet me summarize our main rule.\n\n55\n00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:32.899\nToday we learned sentences with als.\n\n56\n00:03:32.939 --> 00:03:37.300\nToday we learned sentences with als.\n\n57\n00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.640\nKeep practicing your Dutch conditionals!\n
grammar_comparative	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.380\nImagine shopping in Amsterdam today.\n\n2\n00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.340\nYou want a bigger jacket.\n\n3\n00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.380\nHow do you say that?\n\n4\n00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:17.721\nIn Dutch, comparing is easy.\n\n5\n00:00:17.781 --> 00:00:24.921\nWe add -er for comparative.\n\n6\n00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:28.961\nAnd we use 'dan'.\n\n7\n00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:31.981\nThis means 'than' in English.\n\n8\n00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:34.901\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n9\n00:00:34.941 --> 00:00:36.281\nLet's begin!\n\n10\n00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:39.461\nLet's start with 'klein'.\n\n11\n00:00:39.481 --> 00:00:43.701\nDe tas is klein.\n\n12\n00:00:43.741 --> 00:00:47.682\nThe bag is small.\n\n13\n00:00:47.722 --> 00:00:49.842\nNow make it smaller.\n\n14\n00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:54.422\nDe tas is kleiner.\n\n15\n00:00:54.442 --> 00:00:58.562\nThe bag is smaller.\n\n16\n00:00:58.602 --> 00:01:00.782\nNow compare two bags!\n\n17\n00:01:00.842 --> 00:01:05.422\nDeze tas is kleiner.\n\n18\n00:01:05.442 --> 00:01:09.362\nThis bag is smaller.\n\n19\n00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:13.462\nHij is kleiner dan die.\n\n20\n00:01:13.522 --> 00:01:17.582\nIt is smaller than that.\n\n21\n00:01:17.622 --> 00:01:20.483\nWhat about the superlative?\n\n22\n00:01:20.523 --> 00:01:23.863\nWe add -st to adjectives.\n\n23\n00:01:23.923 --> 00:01:27.603\nAnd put 'het' in front.\n\n24\n00:01:27.703 --> 00:01:32.603\nHet is het kleinst.\n\n25\n00:01:32.663 --> 00:01:36.123\nIt is the smallest.\n\n26\n00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:39.203\nLet's review the pattern.\n\n27\n00:01:39.243 --> 00:01:42.063\nDit is het kleinst.\n\n28\n00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:47.143\nThis is the smallest.\n\n29\n00:01:47.183 --> 00:01:50.124\nNow let me ask you!\n\n30\n00:01:50.164 --> 00:01:53.864\nHow do you say 'groot'?\n\n31\n00:01:53.904 --> 00:01:57.324\nHow about 'bigger than'?\n\n32\n00:01:57.364 --> 00:01:59.784\nCan you guess the answer?\n\n33\n00:01:59.804 --> 00:02:04.304\nThe answer is: groter dan!\n\n34\n00:02:04.364 --> 00:02:08.604\nHet huis is groter.\n\n35\n00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:11.264\nThe house is bigger.\n\n36\n00:02:11.304 --> 00:02:15.924\nHet is groter dan dat.\n\n37\n00:02:15.964 --> 00:02:18.664\nIt is bigger than that.\n\n38\n00:02:18.724 --> 00:02:22.225\nAnd for the absolute biggest?\n\n39\n00:02:22.265 --> 00:02:26.525\nDit is het grootst.\n\n40\n00:02:26.565 --> 00:02:28.505\nThis is the biggest.\n\n41\n00:02:28.645 --> 00:02:32.565\nLet me show another word.\n\n42\n00:02:32.605 --> 00:02:36.825\nThe word is 'snel'.\n\n43\n00:02:36.885 --> 00:02:40.625\nIt means fast.\n\n44\n00:02:40.685 --> 00:02:45.565\nDe auto is snel.\n\n45\n00:02:45.585 --> 00:02:50.005\nThe car is fast.\n\n46\n00:02:50.065 --> 00:02:55.046\nDe trein is sneller.\n\n47\n00:02:55.066 --> 00:02:59.266\nThe train is faster.\n\n48\n00:02:59.386 --> 00:03:04.406\nSneller dan de auto.\n\n49\n00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:08.166\nFaster than the car.\n\n50\n00:03:08.246 --> 00:03:14.566\nHet vliegtuig is het snelst.\n\n51\n00:03:14.586 --> 00:03:18.866\nThe plane is the fastest.\n\n52\n00:03:18.906 --> 00:03:21.166\nGreat work so far!\n\n53\n00:03:21.206 --> 00:03:24.587\nNow for the Error Clinic!\n\n54\n00:03:24.607 --> 00:03:27.347\nHere is a common mistake.\n\n55\n00:03:27.367 --> 00:03:31.067\nBeginners often say 'als'.\n\n56\n00:03:31.107 --> 00:03:35.167\nListen to this wrong sentence.\n\n57\n00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:40.727\nHij is groter als mij.\n\n58\n00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:45.127\nHe is bigger than me.\n\n59\n00:03:45.187 --> 00:03:48.627\nThat is wrong in Dutch.\n\n60\n00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:51.927\nDo not use 'als' here!\n\n61\n00:03:52.027 --> 00:03:55.468\nAlways use 'dan'!\n\n62\n00:03:55.508 --> 00:03:59.288\nHere is the correct version.\n\n63\n00:03:59.388 --> 00:04:04.728\nHij is groter dan ik.\n\n64\n00:04:04.768 --> 00:04:07.988\nHe is bigger than I.\n\n65\n00:04:08.028 --> 00:04:11.068\nHere is another mistake.\n\n66\n00:04:11.088 --> 00:04:15.388\nDo not say 'meer groot'.\n\n67\n00:04:15.428 --> 00:04:19.108\nListen to this wrong sentence.\n\n68\n00:04:19.148 --> 00:04:22.768\nHet is meer groot.\n\n69\n00:04:22.808 --> 00:04:25.568\nIt is more big.\n\n70\n00:04:25.608 --> 00:04:28.889\nIn Dutch, we add -er!\n\n71\n00:04:28.909 --> 00:04:33.489\nSo say 'groter' instead.\n\n72\n00:04:33.529 --> 00:04:37.749\nHet is veel groter.\n\n73\n00:04:37.809 --> 00:04:40.889\nIt is much bigger.\n\n74\n00:04:40.929 --> 00:04:44.489\nRemember this quick tip!\n\n75\n00:04:44.529 --> 00:04:49.089\nComparative uses -er and dan.\n\n76\n00:04:49.149 --> 00:04:54.049\nSuperlative uses het and -st.\n\n77\n00:04:54.069 --> 00:04:57.570\nLet's summarize our lesson.\n\n78\n00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.950\nVandaag leerden we vergelijken.\n\n79\n00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.190\nToday we learned to compare.\n\n80\n00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.170\nGroter dan, het grootst!\n\n81\n00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.990\nBigger than, the biggest!\n\n82\n00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.090\nTot ziens!\n
grammar_comparative	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:06.380\nImagine shopping in Amsterdam today.\n\n2\n00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:10.340\nYou want a bigger jacket.\n\n3\n00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.380\nHow do you say that?\n\n4\n00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:18.721\nIn Dutch, comparing is easy.\n\n5\n00:00:18.781 --> 00:00:25.921\nWe add -er for comparative.\n\n6\n00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:29.961\nAnd we use 'dan'.\n\n7\n00:00:30.001 --> 00:00:32.981\nThis means 'than' in English.\n\n8\n00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:35.901\nLet's begin!\n\n9\n00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:37.281\nLet's begin!\n\n10\n00:00:37.321 --> 00:00:40.461\nLet's start with 'klein'.\n\n11\n00:00:40.481 --> 00:00:44.701\nThe bag is small.\n\n12\n00:00:44.741 --> 00:00:48.682\nThe bag is small.\n\n13\n00:00:48.722 --> 00:00:50.842\nNow make it smaller.\n\n14\n00:00:50.882 --> 00:00:55.422\nThe bag is smaller.\n\n15\n00:00:55.442 --> 00:00:59.562\nThe bag is smaller.\n\n16\n00:00:59.602 --> 00:01:01.782\nNow compare two bags!\n\n17\n00:01:01.842 --> 00:01:06.422\nThis bag is smaller.\n\n18\n00:01:06.442 --> 00:01:10.362\nThis bag is smaller.\n\n19\n00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:14.462\nIt is smaller than that.\n\n20\n00:01:14.522 --> 00:01:18.582\nIt is smaller than that.\n\n21\n00:01:18.622 --> 00:01:21.483\nWhat about the superlative?\n\n22\n00:01:21.523 --> 00:01:24.863\nWe add -st to adjectives.\n\n23\n00:01:24.923 --> 00:01:28.603\nAnd put 'het' in front.\n\n24\n00:01:28.703 --> 00:01:33.603\nIt is the smallest.\n\n25\n00:01:33.663 --> 00:01:37.123\nIt is the smallest.\n\n26\n00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:40.203\nLet's review the pattern.\n\n27\n00:01:40.243 --> 00:01:43.063\nThis is the smallest.\n\n28\n00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:48.143\nThis is the smallest.\n\n29\n00:01:48.183 --> 00:01:51.124\nNow let me ask you!\n\n30\n00:01:51.164 --> 00:01:54.864\nHow do you say 'groot'?\n\n31\n00:01:54.904 --> 00:01:58.324\nHow about 'bigger than'?\n\n32\n00:01:58.364 --> 00:02:00.784\nCan you guess the answer?\n\n33\n00:02:00.804 --> 00:02:05.304\nThe answer is: groter dan!\n\n34\n00:02:05.364 --> 00:02:09.604\nThe house is bigger.\n\n35\n00:02:09.624 --> 00:02:12.264\nThe house is bigger.\n\n36\n00:02:12.304 --> 00:02:16.924\nIt is bigger than that.\n\n37\n00:02:16.964 --> 00:02:19.664\nIt is bigger than that.\n\n38\n00:02:19.724 --> 00:02:23.225\nAnd for the absolute biggest?\n\n39\n00:02:23.265 --> 00:02:27.525\nThis is the biggest.\n\n40\n00:02:27.565 --> 00:02:29.505\nThis is the biggest.\n\n41\n00:02:29.645 --> 00:02:33.565\nLet me show another word.\n\n42\n00:02:33.605 --> 00:02:37.825\nThe word is 'snel'.\n\n43\n00:02:37.885 --> 00:02:41.625\nIt means fast.\n\n44\n00:02:41.685 --> 00:02:46.565\nThe car is fast.\n\n45\n00:02:46.585 --> 00:02:51.005\nThe car is fast.\n\n46\n00:02:51.065 --> 00:02:56.046\nThe train is faster.\n\n47\n00:02:56.066 --> 00:03:00.266\nThe train is faster.\n\n48\n00:03:00.386 --> 00:03:05.406\nFaster than the car.\n\n49\n00:03:05.466 --> 00:03:09.166\nFaster than the car.\n\n50\n00:03:09.246 --> 00:03:15.566\nThe plane is the fastest.\n\n51\n00:03:15.586 --> 00:03:19.866\nThe plane is the fastest.\n\n52\n00:03:19.906 --> 00:03:22.166\nGreat work so far!\n\n53\n00:03:22.206 --> 00:03:25.587\nNow for the Error Clinic!\n\n54\n00:03:25.607 --> 00:03:28.347\nHere is a common mistake.\n\n55\n00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:32.067\nBeginners often say 'als'.\n\n56\n00:03:32.107 --> 00:03:36.167\nListen to this wrong sentence.\n\n57\n00:03:36.267 --> 00:03:41.727\nHe is bigger than me.\n\n58\n00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:46.127\nHe is bigger than me.\n\n59\n00:03:46.187 --> 00:03:49.627\nThat is wrong in Dutch.\n\n60\n00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:52.927\nDo not use 'als' here!\n\n61\n00:03:53.027 --> 00:03:56.468\nAlways use 'dan'!\n\n62\n00:03:56.508 --> 00:04:00.288\nHere is the correct version.\n\n63\n00:04:00.388 --> 00:04:05.728\nHe is bigger than I.\n\n64\n00:04:05.768 --> 00:04:08.988\nHe is bigger than I.\n\n65\n00:04:09.028 --> 00:04:12.068\nHere is another mistake.\n\n66\n00:04:12.088 --> 00:04:16.388\nDo not say 'meer groot'.\n\n67\n00:04:16.428 --> 00:04:20.108\nListen to this wrong sentence.\n\n68\n00:04:20.148 --> 00:04:23.768\nIt is more big.\n\n69\n00:04:23.808 --> 00:04:26.568\nIt is more big.\n\n70\n00:04:26.608 --> 00:04:29.889\nIn Dutch, we add -er!\n\n71\n00:04:29.909 --> 00:04:34.489\nSo say 'groter' instead.\n\n72\n00:04:34.529 --> 00:04:38.749\nIt is much bigger.\n\n73\n00:04:38.809 --> 00:04:41.889\nIt is much bigger.\n\n74\n00:04:41.929 --> 00:04:45.489\nRemember this quick tip!\n\n75\n00:04:45.529 --> 00:04:50.089\nComparative uses -er and dan.\n\n76\n00:04:50.149 --> 00:04:55.049\nSuperlative uses het and -st.\n\n77\n00:04:55.069 --> 00:04:58.570\nLet's summarize our lesson.\n\n78\n00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.950\nToday we learned to compare.\n\n79\n00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:06.190\nToday we learned to compare.\n\n80\n00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:10.170\nBigger than, the biggest!\n\n81\n00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.990\nBigger than, the biggest!\n\n82\n00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.090\nGoodbye!\n
grammar_conditional_zou	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:05.880\nImagine ordering coffee in Amsterdam.\n\n2\n00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.340\nYou want to sound polite and friendly!\n\n3\n00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:15.241\nInstead of ordering directly, be polite.\n\n4\n00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:21.641\nIn Dutch, we use zou or zouden.\n\n5\n00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:25.781\nThis makes your request soft.\n\n6\n00:00:25.821 --> 00:00:28.981\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n7\n00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:31.721\nLet's begin!\n\n8\n00:00:31.741 --> 00:00:36.401\nFor singular persons, use zou.\n\n9\n00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:41.501\nFor plural persons, use zouden.\n\n10\n00:00:41.581 --> 00:00:45.582\nIt works like would in English.\n\n11\n00:00:45.662 --> 00:00:49.842\nIk zou graag koffie willen.\n\n12\n00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:53.202\nI would like to have coffee.\n\n13\n00:00:53.242 --> 00:00:56.542\nNotice how polite that sounds!\n\n14\n00:00:56.642 --> 00:01:00.642\nLet's build sentences step by step.\n\n15\n00:01:00.702 --> 00:01:04.602\nFirst, we practice with ik.\n\n16\n00:01:04.662 --> 00:01:07.842\nIk zou dat graag doen.\n\n17\n00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:10.683\nI would like to do that.\n\n18\n00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:13.443\nNow, let's use je.\n\n19\n00:01:13.523 --> 00:01:15.423\nZou je mij kunnen helpen?\n\n20\n00:01:15.443 --> 00:01:17.943\nCould you help me?\n\n21\n00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:20.843\nTime to test your memory!\n\n22\n00:01:20.883 --> 00:01:24.363\nHow to ask for water politely?\n\n23\n00:01:24.403 --> 00:01:26.863\nThink about it for a second.\n\n24\n00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:29.743\nHere is the correct sentence:\n\n25\n00:01:29.803 --> 00:01:34.043\nIk zou graag water willen.\n\n26\n00:01:34.223 --> 00:01:36.383\nI would like water.\n\n27\n00:01:36.423 --> 00:01:38.224\nGreat job!\n\n28\n00:01:38.244 --> 00:01:41.584\nNow let's try with hij.\n\n29\n00:01:41.664 --> 00:01:45.204\nHij zou morgen komen.\n\n30\n00:01:45.264 --> 00:01:47.944\nHe would come tomorrow.\n\n31\n00:01:47.984 --> 00:01:51.084\nNow let's look at hypotheticals.\n\n32\n00:01:51.124 --> 00:01:54.984\nTalking about fun ideas or plans!\n\n33\n00:01:55.024 --> 00:01:58.384\nDat zou heel leuk zijn!\n\n34\n00:01:58.404 --> 00:02:01.024\nThat would be very nice!\n\n35\n00:02:01.044 --> 00:02:04.164\nNow let's move to plural words.\n\n36\n00:02:04.184 --> 00:02:08.245\nWe use zouden for plural subjects.\n\n37\n00:02:08.305 --> 00:02:12.165\nWij zouden graag meegaan.\n\n38\n00:02:12.185 --> 00:02:14.285\nWe would like to come along.\n\n39\n00:02:14.305 --> 00:02:16.905\nCan you guess the plural form?\n\n40\n00:02:16.965 --> 00:02:20.625\nHow do we say: they would?\n\n41\n00:02:20.685 --> 00:02:24.045\nHere is the full sentence:\n\n42\n00:02:24.105 --> 00:02:30.525\nZij zouden naar school gaan.\n\n43\n00:02:30.545 --> 00:02:33.546\nThey would go to school.\n\n44\n00:02:33.566 --> 00:02:36.066\nLet me repeat the pattern now.\n\n45\n00:02:36.106 --> 00:02:39.566\nRepeat after me each time!\n\n46\n00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:45.006\nIk zou dat vragen.\n\n47\n00:02:45.146 --> 00:02:47.686\nI would ask that.\n\n48\n00:02:47.746 --> 00:02:53.146\nJij zou dat vragen.\n\n49\n00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:56.206\nYou would ask that.\n\n50\n00:02:56.266 --> 00:03:02.107\nWij zouden dat vragen.\n\n51\n00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:05.107\nWe would ask that.\n\n52\n00:03:05.187 --> 00:03:10.687\nZij zouden dat vragen.\n\n53\n00:03:10.727 --> 00:03:13.667\nThey would ask that.\n\n54\n00:03:13.687 --> 00:03:17.567\nNow let's look at common mistakes.\n\n55\n00:03:17.647 --> 00:03:23.707\nMistake one: using zou for plural.\n\n56\n00:03:23.727 --> 00:03:28.487\nDon't say: Wij zou gaan.\n\n57\n00:03:28.527 --> 00:03:34.088\nThat is wrong because wij is plural!\n\n58\n00:03:34.168 --> 00:03:38.308\nAlways use zouden with wij.\n\n59\n00:03:38.368 --> 00:03:42.268\nWij zouden gaan.\n\n60\n00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:44.988\nWe would go.\n\n61\n00:03:45.088 --> 00:03:49.568\nMistake two: wrong word order.\n\n62\n00:03:49.648 --> 00:03:53.548\nDon't say: Ik zou willen koffie.\n\n63\n00:03:53.588 --> 00:03:57.409\nPut the infinitive verb at the end!\n\n64\n00:03:57.469 --> 00:04:01.289\nIk zou koffie willen.\n\n65\n00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:04.189\nI would like coffee.\n\n66\n00:04:04.229 --> 00:04:07.149\nHere is your memory tip:\n\n67\n00:04:07.189 --> 00:04:13.389\nSingular gets zou, plural gets zouden!\n\n68\n00:04:13.489 --> 00:04:17.209\nOther verbs go to the end.\n\n69\n00:04:17.249 --> 00:04:21.109\nTime for our spoken recap!\n\n70\n00:04:21.149 --> 00:04:26.890\nVandaag leerden we: zou en zouden.\n\n71\n00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:31.850\nToday we learned: zou and zouden.\n\n72\n00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:35.350\nUse them to be polite!\n\n73\n00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.070\nTot ziens!\n\n74\n00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:37.560\nGoodbye!\n
