es, to the very end!\n\n32\n00:01:50.668 --> 00:01:55.108\nHe drinks because he is thirsty.\n\n33\n00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:58.489\nHe drinks because he is thirsty.\n\n34\n00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:00.849\nLet's try another one.\n\n35\n00:02:00.889 --> 00:02:04.269\nWe want to say: She sleeps.\n\n36\n00:02:04.289 --> 00:02:06.929\nBecause she is tired.\n\n37\n00:02:06.969 --> 00:02:08.949\nWith want:\n\n38\n00:02:09.029 --> 00:02:13.670\nShe sleeps because she is tired.\n\n39\n00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:17.310\nShe sleeps because she is tired.\n\n40\n00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:20.330\nNow with omdat:\n\n41\n00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:24.551\nShe sleeps because she is tired.\n\n42\n00:02:24.591 --> 00:02:28.651\nShe sleeps because she is tired.\n\n43\n00:02:28.671 --> 00:02:31.711\nCan you guess the next one?\n\n44\n00:02:31.771 --> 00:02:33.311\nHow do we say:\n\n45\n00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:37.571\nWe stay home because it is cold.\n\n46\n00:02:37.671 --> 00:02:40.192\nUsing want:\n\n47\n00:02:40.232 --> 00:02:45.232\nWe stay home because it is cold.\n\n48\n00:02:45.252 --> 00:02:49.312\nWe stay home because it is cold.\n\n49\n00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:53.473\nNow, how about with omdat?\n\n50\n00:02:53.513 --> 00:02:57.213\nThink about the verb is.\n\n51\n00:02:57.233 --> 00:03:02.453\nWe stay home because it is cold.\n\n52\n00:03:02.533 --> 00:03:06.774\nWe stay home because it is cold.\n\n53\n00:03:06.814 --> 00:03:09.334\nLet us look at some errors.\n\n54\n00:03:09.374 --> 00:03:11.834\nBeginners often say:\n\n55\n00:03:11.914 --> 00:03:16.254\nI am home because I am sick.\n\n56\n00:03:16.354 --> 00:03:19.875\nI am home because I am sick.\n\n57\n00:03:19.895 --> 00:03:21.855\nThis is wrong!\n\n58\n00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:26.175\nOmdat must send ben to the end.\n\n59\n00:03:26.215 --> 00:03:28.195\nThe correct sentence is:\n\n60\n00:03:28.255 --> 00:03:32.455\nI am home because I am sick.\n\n61\n00:03:32.616 --> 00:03:35.996\nI am home because I am sick.\n\n62\n00:03:36.056 --> 00:03:38.176\nAnother common mistake:\n\n63\n00:03:38.216 --> 00:03:41.976\nUsing want with verb at the end.\n\n64\n00:03:42.056 --> 00:03:45.296\nI eat because I am hungry.\n\n65\n00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:48.377\nI eat because I am hungry.\n\n66\n00:03:48.397 --> 00:03:50.737\nThis is also incorrect.\n\n67\n00:03:50.917 --> 00:03:53.857\nWant needs the normal order.\n\n68\n00:03:53.917 --> 00:03:55.177\nSo we say:\n\n69\n00:03:55.237 --> 00:03:58.517\nI eat because I am hungry.\n\n70\n00:03:58.617 --> 00:04:01.618\nI eat because I am hungry.\n\n71\n00:04:01.738 --> 00:04:04.078\nRemember this simple rule:\n\n72\n00:04:04.138 --> 00:04:06.458\nWant is normal.\n\n73\n00:04:06.518 --> 00:04:09.578\nOmdat kicks the verb away.\n\n74\n00:04:09.678 --> 00:04:11.958\nLet us do a quick recap.\n\n75\n00:04:11.998 --> 00:04:13.779\nToday we learned:\n\n76\n00:04:13.839 --> 00:04:18.159\nToday we learned want and omdat.\n\n77\n00:04:18.199 --> 00:04:21.979\nToday we learned want and omdat.\n\n78\n00:04:21.999 --> 00:04:25.419\nUse want for normal order.\n\n79\n00:04:25.599 --> 00:04:29.700\nUse omdat for verb at the end.\n\n80\n00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.520\nUntil next time!\n\n81\n00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.940\nUntil next time!\n
hotel_checkin	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:05.111\nGoedemiddag! Welkom in ons hotel.\n\n2\n00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:08.511\nGoedemiddag. Ik wil graag inchecken.\n\n3\n00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:13.133\nDat kan zeker. Heeft u een reservering?\n\n4\n00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:15.579\nJa, ik heb gereserveerd.\n\n5\n00:00:15.623 --> 00:00:18.757\nWat is uw achternaam, alstublieft?\n\n6\n00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:21.312\nMijn achternaam is De Jong.\n\n7\n00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.668\nKunt u dat spellen voor mij?\n\n8\n00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:28.068\nJa, natuurlijk. D-E-J-O-N-G.\n\n9\n00:00:28.134 --> 00:00:32.312\nDank u wel. Even kijken in de computer.\n\n10\n00:00:32.379 --> 00:00:34.179\nIs het gelukt?\n\n11\n00:00:34.246 --> 00:00:38.534\nJa, ik zie het. Meneer Thomas de Jong?\n\n12\n00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:40.824\nJa, dat klopt helemaal.\n\n13\n00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:44.536\nU blijft twee nachten bij ons, klopt dat?\n\n14\n00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.469\nJa, dat klopt. Tot zondag.\n\n15\n00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:51.091\nHeeft u een identiteitsbewijs voor mij?\n\n16\n00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:53.758\nJa, hier is mijn paspoort.\n\n17\n00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.624\nDank u wel. Ik maak even een kopie.\n\n18\n00:00:57.669 --> 00:00:59.536\nGeen probleem.\n\n19\n00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:03.047\nAlstublieft, uw paspoort terug.\n\n20\n00:01:03.091 --> 00:01:04.691\nDank u wel.\n\n21\n00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:09.626\nU heeft een tweepersoonskamer met een groot bed.\n\n22\n00:01:09.714 --> 00:01:13.226\nJa, met uitzicht op de stad, toch?\n\n23\n00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:16.114\nKlopt, op de vierde verdieping.\n\n24\n00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.759\nDat is mooi. Is er een lift?\n\n25\n00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:21.626\nJa, de lift is daar om de hoek.\n\n26\n00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.559\nGelukkig, ik heb een zware koffer.\n\n27\n00:01:25.581 --> 00:01:29.714\nDe lift gaat direct naar de vierde verdieping.\n\n28\n00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:32.382\nHoe kom ik in mijn kamer?\n\n29\n00:01:32.404 --> 00:01:37.027\nHier is uw kamersleutel. Het is een pasje.\n\n30\n00:01:37.071 --> 00:01:40.427\nMoet ik het pasje tegen de deur houden?\n\n31\n00:01:40.471 --> 00:01:44.649\nJa, dat klopt. Het lampje wordt dan groen.\n\n32\n00:01:44.716 --> 00:01:47.071\nEn wat is het kamernummer?\n\n33\n00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.804\nUw kamernummer is 412.\n\n34\n00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:53.849\nKamer 412, ik zal het onthouden.\n\n35\n00:01:53.871 --> 00:01:56.939\nWilt u ook ontbijt morgenochtend?\n\n36\n00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.206\nIs het ontbijt inclusief?\n\n37\n00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:03.050\nNee, het ontbijt kost vijftien euro per dag.\n\n38\n00:02:03.139 --> 00:02:07.650\nAh, oké. Dat is prima. Ik wil graag ontbijt.\n\n39\n00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:10.694\nIk zet het op uw kamerrekening.\n\n40\n00:02:10.717 --> 00:02:12.983\nHeel fijn, dank u wel.\n\n41\n00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:16.939\nHet ontbijt is in het restaurant hier beneden.\n\n42\n00:02:16.983 --> 00:02:19.917\nVanaf hoe laat is het ontbijt?\n\n43\n00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.607\nDoordeweeks van zeven tot tien uur.\n\n44\n00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.584\nEn in het weekend?\n\n45\n00:02:25.651 --> 00:02:29.362\nIn het weekend is het van acht tot elf uur.\n\n46\n00:02:29.384 --> 00:02:33.940\nDat is goed om te weten. Dan kan ik uitslapen.\n\n47\n00:02:34.029 --> 00:02:37.184\nZeker! Het is immers weekend.\n\n48\n00:02:37.229 --> 00:02:39.762\nHeeft het hotel ook wifi?\n\n49\n00:02:39.829 --> 00:02:44.340\nJa, we hebben gratis wifi in het hele hotel.\n\n50\n00:02:44.362 --> 00:02:46.963\nWat is de code voor de wifi?\n\n51\n00:02:47.008 --> 00:02:50.674\nDe code staat op dit kaartje bij de sleutel.\n\n52\n00:02:50.763 --> 00:02:56.074\nAh, ik zie het. 'HotelWelkom2024'.\n\n53\n00:02:56.141 --> 00:02:58.808\nJa, dat is de juiste code.\n\n54\n00:02:58.897 --> 00:03:02.474\nMoet ik elke keer opnieuw inloggen?\n\n55\n00:03:02.519 --> 00:03:06.474\nNee, uw telefoon onthoudt het netwerk.\n\n56\n00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:09.386\nDat is erg handig. Bedankt.\n\n57\n00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.874\nHeeft u een auto bij u?\n\n58\n00:03:11.919 --> 00:03:15.098\nJa, ik heb mijn auto geparkeerd.\n\n59\n00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.431\nWaar staat uw auto nu?\n\n60\n00:03:17.453 --> 00:03:20.831\nHij staat nu aan de straat hierbuiten.\n\n61\n00:03:20.898 --> 00:03:25.853\nU kunt parkeren in onze garage onder het hotel.\n\n62\n00:03:25.898 --> 00:03:28.498\nIs dat gratis voor gasten?\n\n63\n00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.564\nNee, dat kost tien euro per nacht.\n\n64\n00:03:31.587 --> 00:03:34.942\nDat is goedkoper dan op de straat.\n\n65\n00:03:35.098 --> 00:03:38.854\nJa, op de straat is het erg duur.\n\n66\n00:03:38.899 --> 00:03:42.032\nHoe kom ik in de parkeergarage?\n\n67\n00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.832\nU kunt met uw kamersleutel de poort openen.\n\n68\n00:03:45.877 --> 00:03:49.210\nKan ik nu direct mijn auto daar zetten?\n\n69\n00:03:49.277 --> 00:03:54.254\nJa, dat kan zeker. Rijdt u maar naar de zijkant.\n\n70\n00:03:54.321 --> 00:03:57.543\nMoet ik mijn kenteken doorgeven?\n\n71\n00:03:57.566 --> 00:04:01.366\nJa, graag. Wat is uw kenteken?\n\n72\n00:04:01.388 --> 00:04:04.856\nMijn kenteken is 12-ABC-3.\n\n73\n00:04:04.922 --> 00:04:08.167\nIk schrijf het op. Dank u wel.\n\n74\n00:04:08.189 --> 00:04:12.033\nDank u. Nu staat de auto veilig.\n\n75\n00:04:12.122 --> 00:04:15.456\nZeker, de garage is beveiligd.\n\n76\n00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.078\nDat geeft een goed gevoel.\n\n77\n00:04:18.122 --> 00:04:20.589\nHeeft u nog andere vragen?\n\n78\n00:04:20.656 --> 00:04:25.033\nJa, ik zoek een goed restaurant voor vanavond.\n\n79\n00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.678\nWat voor eten vindt u lekker?\n\n80\n00:04:27.722 --> 00:04:30.901\nIk houd erg van Italiaans eten.\n\n81\n00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:35.790\nEr is een heel goed Italiaans restaurant hier vlakbij.\n\n82\n00:04:35.834 --> 00:04:38.346\nHoe heet dat restaurant?\n\n83\n00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:43.412\nHet heet 'Da Mario'. Het is erg gezellig.\n\n84\n00:04:43.457 --> 00:04:46.879\nIs het ver lopen vanaf het hotel?\n\n85\n00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:51.123\nNee, het is ongeveer vijf minuten lopen.\n\n86\n00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.857\nMoet ik een tafel reserveren?\n\n87\n00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:58.058\nIn het weekend is het vaak druk. Dus ja.\n\n88\n00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:01.902\nKunt u een tafel voor mij reserveren?\n\n89\n00:05:01.924 --> 00:05:06.324\nNatuurlijk. Voor hoe laat wilt u eten?\n\n90\n00:05:06.413 --> 00:05:10.524\nOm zeven uur vanavond, alsjeblieft.\n\n91\n00:05:10.569 --> 00:05:14.502\nVoor hoeveel personen is de reservering?\n\n92\n00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:18.147\nVoor twee personen, alstublieft.\n\n93\n00:05:18.236 --> 00:05:22.614\nIk ga nu bellen voor u. Een momentje.\n\n94\n00:05:22.659 --> 00:05:25.259\nHeel erg bedankt voor uw hulp.\n\n95\n00:05:25.303 --> 00:05:29.503\nGeen probleem... Ja, het is gelukt!\n\n96\n00:05:29.548 --> 00:05:34.348\nFantastisch! Staat de reservering op mijn naam?\n\n97\n00:05:34.414 --> 00:05:38.459\nJa, op naam van De Jong om zeven uur.\n\n98\n00:05:38.526 --> 00:05:40.992\nSuper. Waar is het precies?\n\n99\n00:05:41.059 --> 00:05:45.192\nAls u het hotel uitloopt, gaat u naar rechts.\n\n100\n00:05:45.237 --> 00:05:47.882\nNaar rechts, oké. En dan?\n\n101\n00:05:47.971 --> 00:05:51.527\nAan het einde van de straat weer naar links.\n\n102\n00:05:51.593 --> 00:05:54.149\nIs het dan aan de linkerkant?\n\n103\n00:05:54.193 --> 00:05:57.971\nJa, naast de grote kerk op het plein.\n\n104\n00:05:58.016 --> 00:06:00.860\nDat kan niet missen. Dank u.\n\n105\n00:06:00.949 --> 00:06:05.327\nGraag gedaan. Heeft u nog meer vragen?\n\n106\n00:06:05.393 --> 00:06:09.016\nTot hoe laat kan ik zondag uitchecken?\n\n107\n00:06:09.038 --> 00:06:12.639\nDe uitchecktijd is tot elf uur 's ochtends.\n\n108\n00:06:12.683 --> 00:06:17.039\nIs er een mogelijkheid om later uit te checken?\n\n109\n00:06:17.061 --> 00:06:21.083\nJa, dat kan tot één uur tegen betaling.\n\n110\n00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.772\nHoeveel kost dat extra?\n\n111\n00:06:23.794 --> 00:06:26.572\nDat kost twintig euro extra.\n\n112\n00:06:26.706 --> 00:06:30.128\nOké, ik denk dat elf uur prima is.\n\n113\n00:06:30.194 --> 00:06:33.906\nAls u wilt, kunnen wij uw koffers bewaren.\n\n114\n00:06:34.261 --> 00:06:37.462\nOh, dat is handig. Is dat gratis?\n\n115\n00:06:37.507 --> 00:06:41.751\nJa, dat is een gratis service voor onze gasten.\n\n116\n00:06:41.773 --> 00:06:45.084\nSuper, dan doen we dat op zondag.\n\n117\n00:06:45.129 --> 00:06:49.529\nPerfect. Dan is alles geregeld voor nu.\n\n118\n00:06:49.573 --> 00:06:53.040\nHeel erg bedankt voor de goede service.\n\n119\n00:06:53.107 --> 00:06:58.262\nGraag gedaan. Ik wens u een heel fijn verblijf!\n\n120\n00:06:58.307 --> 00:07:00.662\nDank u wel, tot ziens!\n\n121\n00:07:00.684 --> 00:07:03.663\nTot ziens en een fijne middag!\n
hotel_checkin	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:05.111\nGood afternoon! Welcome to our hotel.\n\n2\n00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:08.511\nGood afternoon. I would like to check in.\n\n3\n00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:13.133\nOf course. Do you have a reservation?\n\n4\n00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:15.579\nYes, I have a reservation.\n\n5\n00:00:15.623 --> 00:00:18.757\nWhat is your last name, please?\n\n6\n00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:21.312\nMy last name is De Jong.\n\n7\n00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.668\nCould you spell that for me?\n\n8\n00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:28.068\nYes, of course. D-E-J-O-N-G.\n\n9\n00:00:28.134 --> 00:00:32.312\nThank you. Let me check the computer.\n\n10\n00:00:32.379 --> 00:00:34.179\nDid you find it?\n\n11\n00:00:34.246 --> 00:00:38.534\nYes, I see it. Mr. Thomas de Jong?\n\n12\n00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:40.824\nYes, that is correct.\n\n13\n00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:44.536\nYou are staying with us for two nights, is that correct?\n\n14\n00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.469\nYes, that's right. Until Sunday.\n\n15\n00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:51.091\nDo you have an ID for me?\n\n16\n00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:53.758\nYes, here is my passport.\n\n17\n00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.624\nThank you. I will make a quick copy.\n\n18\n00:00:57.669 --> 00:00:59.536\nNo problem.\n\n19\n00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:03.047\nHere is your passport back.\n\n20\n00:01:03.091 --> 00:01:04.691\nThank you.\n\n21\n00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:09.626\nYou have a double room with a big bed.\n\n22\n00:01:09.714 --> 00:01:13.226\nYes, with a city view, right?\n\n23\n00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:16.114\nThat's right, on the fourth floor.\n\n24\n00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.759\nThat is nice. Is there an elevator?\n\n25\n00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:21.626\nYes, the elevator is just around the corner.\n\n26\n00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.559\nLuckily, I have a heavy suitcase.\n\n27\n00:01:25.581 --> 00:01:29.714\nThe elevator goes directly to the fourth floor.\n\n28\n00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:32.382\nHow do I get into my room?\n\n29\n00:01:32.404 --> 00:01:37.027\nHere is your room key. It is a key card.\n\n30\n00:01:37.071 --> 00:01:40.427\nDo I have to hold the card against the door?\n\n31\n00:01:40.471 --> 00:01:44.649\nYes, that's right. The light will turn green.\n\n32\n00:01:44.716 --> 00:01:47.071\nAnd what is the room number?\n\n33\n00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.804\nYour room number is 412.\n\n34\n00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:53.849\nRoom 412, I will remember it.\n\n35\n00:01:53.871 --> 00:01:56.939\nWould you also like breakfast tomorrow morning?\n\n36\n00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.206\nIs breakfast included?\n\n37\n00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:03.050\nNo, breakfast costs fifteen euros per day.\n\n38\n00:02:03.139 --> 00:02:07.650\nAh, okay. That is fine. I would like breakfast.\n\n39\n00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:10.694\nI will add it to your room bill.\n\n40\n00:02:10.717 --> 00:02:12.983\nVery nice, thank you.\n\n41\n00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:16.939\nBreakfast is in the restaurant downstairs.\n\n42\n00:02:16.983 --> 00:02:19.917\nWhat time does breakfast start?\n\n43\n00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.607\nOn weekdays from seven to ten o'clock.\n\n44\n00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.584\nAnd on the weekend?\n\n45\n00:02:25.651 --> 00:02:29.362\nOn the weekend it is from eight to eleven o'clock.\n\n46\n00:02:29.384 --> 00:02:33.940\nThat is good to know. Then I can sleep in.\n\n47\n00:02:34.029 --> 00:02:37.184\nDefinitely! It is the weekend, after all.\n\n48\n00:02:37.229 --> 00:02:39.762\nDoes the hotel also have Wi-Fi?\n\n49\n00:02:39.829 --> 00:02:44.340\nYes, we have free Wi-Fi in the entire hotel.\n\n50\n00:02:44.362 --> 00:02:46.963\nWhat is the Wi-Fi code?\n\n51\n00:02:47.008 --> 00:02:50.674\nThe code is on this little card with the key.\n\n52\n00:02:50.763 --> 00:02:56.074\nAh, I see it. 'HotelWelkom2024'.\n\n53\n00:02:56.141 --> 00:02:58.808\nYes, that is the correct code.\n\n54\n00:02:58.897 --> 00:03:02.474\nDo I have to log in every time?\n\n55\n00:03:02.519 --> 00:03:06.474\nNo, your phone will remember the network.\n\n56\n00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:09.386\nThat is very convenient. Thanks.\n\n57\n00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.874\nDo you have a car with you?\n\n58\n00:03:11.919 --> 00:03:15.098\nYes, I parked my car.\n\n59\n00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.431\nWhere is your car now?\n\n60\n00:03:17.453 --> 00:03:20.831\nIt is currently on the street outside.\n\n61\n00:03:20.898 --> 00:03:25.853\nYou can park in our garage under the hotel.\n\n62\n00:03:25.898 --> 00:03:28.498\nIs that free for guests?\n\n63\n00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.564\nNo, that costs ten euros per night.\n\n64\n00:03:31.587 --> 00:03:34.942\nThat is cheaper than on the street.\n\n65\n00:03:35.098 --> 00:03:38.854\nYes, on the street it is very expensive.\n\n66\n00:03:38.899 --> 00:03:42.032\nHow do I get into the parking garage?\n\n67\n00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.832\nYou can open the gate with your room key.\n\n68\n00:03:45.877 --> 00:03:49.210\nCan I put my car there right now?\n\n69\n00:03:49.277 --> 00:03:54.254\nYes, of course. Just drive to the side.\n\n70\n00:03:54.321 --> 00:03:57.543\nDo I need to give you my license plate number?\n\n71\n00:03:57.566 --> 00:04:01.366\nYes, please. What is your license plate?\n\n72\n00:04:01.388 --> 00:04:04.856\nMy license plate is 12-ABC-3.\n\n73\n00:04:04.922 --> 00:04:08.167\nI will write it down. Thank you.\n\n74\n00:04:08.189 --> 00:04:12.033\nThank you. Now the car is safe.\n\n75\n00:04:12.122 --> 00:04:15.456\nDefinitely, the garage is secured.\n\n76\n00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.078\nThat gives a good feeling.\n\n77\n00:04:18.122 --> 00:04:20.589\nDo you have any other questions?\n\n78\n00:04:20.656 --> 00:04:25.033\nYes, I am looking for a good restaurant for tonight.\n\n79\n00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.678\nWhat kind of food do you like?\n\n80\n00:04:27.722 --> 00:04:30.901\nI really like Italian food.\n\n81\n00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:35.790\nThere is a very good Italian restaurant nearby.\n\n82\n00:04:35.834 --> 00:04:38.346\nWhat is the name of that restaurant?\n\n83\n00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:43.412\nIt is called 'Da Mario'. It is very cozy.\n\n84\n00:04:43.457 --> 00:04:46.879\nIs it a long walk from the hotel?\n\n85\n00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:51.123\nNo, it is about a five-minute walk.\n\n86\n00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.857\nDo I need to reserve a table?\n\n87\n00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:58.058\nOn weekends it is often busy. So yes.\n\n88\n00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:01.902\nCould you reserve a table for me?\n\n89\n00:05:01.924 --> 00:05:06.324\nOf course. For what time would you like to eat?\n\n90\n00:05:06.413 --> 00:05:10.524\nAt seven o'clock tonight, please.\n\n91\n00:05:10.569 --> 00:05:14.502\nFor how many people is the reservation?\n\n92\n00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:18.147\nFor two people, please.\n\n93\n00:05:18.236 --> 00:05:22.614\nI will call for you now. Just a moment.\n\n94\n00:05:22.659 --> 00:05:25.259\nThank you very much for your help.\n\n95\n00:05:25.303 --> 00:05:29.503\nNo problem... Yes, it worked!\n\n96\n00:05:29.548 --> 00:05:34.348\nFantastic! Is the reservation in my name?\n\n97\n00:05:34.414 --> 00:05:38.459\nYes, under the name De Jong at seven o'clock.\n\n98\n00:05:38.526 --> 00:05:40.992\nSuper. Where is it exactly?\n\n99\n00:05:41.059 --> 00:05:45.192\nWhen you walk out of the hotel, you go right.\n\n100\n00:05:45.237 --> 00:05:47.882\nTo the right, okay. And then?\n\n101\n00:05:47.971 --> 00:05:51.527\nAt the end of the street, turn left again.\n\n102\n00:05:51.593 --> 00:05:54.149\nIs it on the left side then?\n\n103\n00:05:54.193 --> 00:05:57.971\nYes, next to the big church on the square.\n\n104\n00:05:58.016 --> 00:06:00.860\nCan't miss it. Thank you.\n\n105\n00:06:00.949 --> 00:06:05.327\nYou're welcome. Do you have any more questions?\n\n106\n00:06:05.393 --> 00:06:09.016\nUntil what time can I check out on Sunday?\n\n107\n00:06:09.038 --> 00:06:12.639\nThe check-out time is until eleven in the morning.\n\n108\n00:06:12.683 --> 00:06:17.039\nIs there a possibility to check out later?\n\n109\n00:06:17.061 --> 00:06:21.083\nYes, that is possible until one o'clock for a fee.\n\n110\n00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.772\nHow much extra does that cost?\n\n111\n00:06:23.794 --> 00:06:26.572\nThat costs twenty euros extra.\n\n112\n00:06:26.706 --> 00:06:30.128\nOkay, I think eleven o'clock is fine.\n\n113\n00:06:30.194 --> 00:06:33.906\nIf you want, we can store your suitcases.\n\n114\n00:06:34.261 --> 00:06:37.462\nOh, that is convenient. Is that free?\n\n115\n00:06:37.507 --> 00:06:41.751\nYes, that is a free service for our guests.\n\n116\n00:06:41.773 --> 00:06:45.084\nGreat, then we will do that on Sunday.\n\n117\n00:06:45.129 --> 00:06:49.529\nPerfect. Then everything is arranged for now.\n\n118\n00:06:49.573 --> 00:06:53.040\nThank you very much for the good service.\n\n119\n00:06:53.107 --> 00:06:58.262\nYou're welcome. I wish you a very pleasant stay!\n\n120\n00:06:58.307 --> 00:07:00.662\nThank you, goodbye!\n\n121\n00:07:00.684 --> 00:07:03.663\nGoodbye and have a nice afternoon!\n
making_appointment	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:06.933\nGoedemiddag, Adviesbureau De Jong, u spreekt met Sanne.\n\n2\n00:00:06.978 --> 00:00:10.356\nGoedemiddag Sanne, met Mark de Vries.\n\n3\n00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.690\nHallo meneer De Vries. Wat kan ik voor u doen?\n\n4\n00:00:14.757 --> 00:00:18.001\nIk wil graag een afspraak maken.\n\n5\n00:00:18.046 --> 00:00:22.490\nDat kan zeker. Met wie wilt u een afspraak?\n\n6\n00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.668\nMet meneer De Jong, als dat kan.\n\n7\n00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:29.446\nGoed. Waar gaat de afspraak over?\n\n8\n00:00:29.468 --> 00:00:32.401\nHet gaat over een nieuw project.\n\n9\n00:00:32.446 --> 00:00:36.580\nHeeft u al eerder een afspraak bij ons gehad?\n\n10\n00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:38.891\nNee, dit is de eerste keer.\n\n11\n00:00:39.047 --> 00:00:45.424\nOké, welkom! Bent u een particuliere of zakelijke klant?\n\n12\n00:00:45.513 --> 00:00:48.091\nIk ben een zakelijke klant.\n\n13\n00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:51.980\nFijn. Heeft u al een klantnummer?\n\n14\n00:00:52.002 --> 00:00:54.047\nNee, dat heb ik nog niet.\n\n15\n00:00:54.091 --> 00:00:58.803\nGeen probleem. Ik maak direct een profiel aan.\n\n16\n00:00:58.848 --> 00:01:00.492\nDank u wel.\n\n17\n00:01:00.537 --> 00:01:02.981\nMag ik uw volledige naam?\n\n18\n00:01:03.048 --> 00:01:05.648\nMijn naam is Mark de Vries.\n\n19\n00:01:05.692 --> 00:01:07.892\nHoe schrijft u De Vries?\n\n20\n00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:10.270\nMet V-R-I-E-S.\n\n21\n00:01:10.314 --> 00:01:14.403\nDuidelijk, dank u. En Mark met een K?\n\n22\n00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.448\nJa, M-A-R-K met een K.\n\n23\n00:01:17.537 --> 00:01:21.827\nUitstekend. En voor welk bedrijf werkt u?\n\n24\n00:01:21.849 --> 00:01:24.916\nMijn bedrijf heet Groen Advies.\n\n25\n00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:28.538\nMooie naam. Hoe schrijft u dat?\n\n26\n00:01:28.604 --> 00:01:31.960\nG-R-O-E-N, en dan Advies.\n\n27\n00:01:32.049 --> 00:01:34.871\nGoed, ik heb het genoteerd.\n\n28\n00:01:34.893 --> 00:01:36.493\nSuper, bedankt.\n\n29\n00:01:36.582 --> 00:01:40.271\nEn waar gaat het project precies over?\n\n30\n00:01:40.293 --> 00:01:43.139\nHet gaat over duurzaam bouwen.\n\n31\n00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.939\nAh, dat is erg interessant.\n\n32\n00:01:45.983 --> 00:01:48.317\nJa, we zoeken een expert.\n\n33\n00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:51.717\nMeneer De Jong kan u zeker helpen.\n\n34\n00:01:51.761 --> 00:01:53.917\nWat fijn om te horen!\n\n35\n00:01:53.961 --> 00:01:57.094\nHoeveel tijd denkt u nodig te hebben?\n\n36\n00:01:57.161 --> 00:01:59.628\nIk denk ongeveer een uur.\n\n37\n00:01:59.694 --> 00:02:02.606\nEen uur is meestal standaard.\n\n38\n00:02:02.672 --> 00:02:04.917\nIs dat voldoende tijd?\n\n39\n00:02:05.006 --> 00:02:08.118\nJa, voor een eerste gesprek wel.\n\n40\n00:02:08.162 --> 00:02:09.651\nMooi, dat is goed.\n\n41\n00:02:09.718 --> 00:02:12.296\nLaat me in de agenda kijken.\n\n42\n00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.362\nNeem gerust de tijd.\n\n43\n00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:16.696\nKunt u deze week nog?\n\n44\n00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.518\nDeze week is lastig voor mij.\n\n45\n00:02:19.584 --> 00:02:21.896\nIs woensdag geen optie?\n\n46\n00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.673\nNee, dan heb ik al een training.\n\n47\n00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.873\nEn donderdagmiddag om drie uur?\n\n48\n00:02:27.896 --> 00:02:31.052\nDonderdag zit ik helaas al vol.\n\n49\n00:02:31.141 --> 00:02:33.363\nEn vrijdagmorgen?\n\n50\n00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.541\nVrijdag werk ik niet.\n\n51\n00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:39.208\nOké, dan kijken we naar volgende week.\n\n52\n00:02:39.252 --> 00:02:42.341\nJa, graag. Dat komt beter uit.\n\n53\n00:02:42.363 --> 00:02:45.363\nHoe komt maandag tien uur uit?\n\n54\n00:02:45.386 --> 00:02:48.830\nMaandagochtend heb ik al een overleg.\n\n55\n00:02:48.852 --> 00:02:51.342\nKunt u maandag in de middag?\n\n56\n00:02:51.387 --> 00:02:53.387\nHoe laat in de middag?\n\n57\n00:02:53.498 --> 00:02:56.253\nOm twee uur, bijvoorbeeld?\n\n58\n00:02:56.298 --> 00:02:59.031\nTwee uur is helaas te vroeg.\n\n59\n00:02:59.098 --> 00:03:00.964\nEn om vier uur?\n\n60\n00:03:01.053 --> 00:03:03.520\nVier uur schikt mij goed!\n\n61\n00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:07.342\nWacht, ik zie dat meneer De Jong dan bezet is.\n\n62\n00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.476\nOh, dat is jammer.\n\n63\n00:03:09.498 --> 00:03:12.431\nBiedt dinsdag een mogelijkheid?\n\n64\n00:03:12.476 --> 00:03:14.521\nDinsdag kan ik wel.\n\n65\n00:03:14.566 --> 00:03:17.166\nDinsdagochtend om tien uur?\n\n66\n00:03:17.188 --> 00:03:19.877\nTien uur komt heel goed uit.\n\n67\n00:03:19.921 --> 00:03:23.321\nDus dinsdag om tien uur op kantoor?\n\n68\n00:03:23.388 --> 00:03:26.277\nIs dat dinsdag de veertiende?\n\n69\n00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:30.832\nLaat me kijken... Ja, de veertiende.\n\n70\n00:03:30.854 --> 00:03:34.232\nPerfect, dat staat in mijn agenda.\n\n71\n00:03:34.321 --> 00:03:38.611\nFijn! Zal ik het definitief vastzetten?\n\n72\n00:03:38.656 --> 00:03:40.878\nJa, heel graag.\n\n73\n00:03:40.967 --> 00:03:44.744\nIk heb nu nog een paar gegevens nodig.\n\n74\n00:03:44.811 --> 00:03:47.589\nNatuurlijk, vraagt u maar.\n\n75\n00:03:47.633 --> 00:03:49.944\nWat is uw telefoonnummer?\n\n76\n00:03:49.989 --> 00:03:55.456\nMijn nummer is 06 12 34 56 78.\n\n77\n00:03:55.567 --> 00:04:01.590\nIk herhaal: 06 12 34 56 78?\n\n78\n00:04:01.723 --> 00:04:04.012\nJa, dat klopt helemaal.\n\n79\n00:04:04.079 --> 00:04:06.234\nEn wat is uw e-mailadres?\n\n80\n00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:10.346\nMijn e-mail is mark@groenadvies.nl.\n\n81\n00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.990\nHoe spel je groenadvies?\n\n82\n00:04:13.057 --> 00:04:15.057\nG-R-O-E-N-A-D-V-I-E-S.\n\n83\n00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:20.212\nDus mark at groenadvies punt nl?\n\n84\n00:04:20.257 --> 00:04:21.791\nJa, exact.\n\n85\n00:04:21.836 --> 00:04:25.658\nDank u wel. Ik stuur een bevestiging.\n\n86\n00:04:25.747 --> 00:04:28.347\nOntvang ik die per e-mail?\n\n87\n00:04:28.391 --> 00:04:31.147\nJa, direct na dit gesprek.\n\n88\n00:04:31.191 --> 00:04:33.191\nDat is heel fijn.\n\n89\n00:04:33.236 --> 00:04:36.080\nWe zitten op het hoofdkantoor.\n\n90\n00:04:36.124 --> 00:04:38.080\nWaar is dat precies?\n\n91\n00:04:38.169 --> 00:04:40.791\nOp de Marktstraat nummer tien.\n\n92\n00:04:40.858 --> 00:04:43.102\nIs dat in het centrum?\n\n93\n00:04:43.169 --> 00:04:45.814\nJa, vlak bij het station.\n\n94\n00:04:45.837 --> 00:04:48.726\nKun je daar makkelijk parkeren?\n\n95\n00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.948\nWe hebben een eigen parkeerterrein.\n\n96\n00:04:52.059 --> 00:04:54.370\nMoet ik daarvoor betalen?\n\n97\n00:04:54.503 --> 00:04:58.148\nNee, dat is gratis voor bezoekers.\n\n98\n00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:00.326\nDat is erg handig.\n\n99\n00:05:00.392 --> 00:05:03.370\nU kunt zich melden bij de balie.\n\n100\n00:05:03.437 --> 00:05:06.148\nEn bij wie moet ik me melden?\n\n101\n00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.571\nBij mij, bij de receptie.\n\n102\n00:05:08.593 --> 00:05:11.082\nWat leuk, dan zie ik u daar.\n\n103\n00:05:11.127 --> 00:05:13.993\nMoet ik nog documenten meenemen?\n\n104\n00:05:14.127 --> 00:05:16.371\nNee, dat hoeft niet per se.\n\n105\n00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.993\nMisschien een notitieblok?\n\n106\n00:05:19.082 --> 00:05:22.771\nJa, een notitieblok is altijd handig.\n\n107\n00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.016\nEn vergeet uw legitimatie niet.\n\n108\n00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:30.683\nGoed dat u het zegt, ik neem mijn paspoort mee.\n\n109\n00:05:30.728 --> 00:05:34.572\nPrima. Heeft u nog andere vragen?\n\n110\n00:05:34.661 --> 00:05:37.083\nIs er ook koffie op kantoor?\n\n111\n00:05:37.172 --> 00:05:41.172\nZeker, wij hebben heerlijke koffie en thee.\n\n112\n00:05:41.217 --> 00:05:43.039\nDat klinkt goed!\n\n113\n00:05:43.061 --> 00:05:46.861\nWilt u de afspraak ook in uw online agenda?\n\n114\n00:05:47.061 --> 00:05:50.772\nJa, een uitnodiging per e-mail is prima.\n\n115\n00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:53.951\nDie zit bij de bevestigingsmail.\n\n116\n00:05:53.996 --> 00:05:55.773\nHelemaal goed.\n\n117\n00:05:55.818 --> 00:05:59.751\nMocht er iets tussen komen, bel ons dan.\n\n118\n00:05:59.796 --> 00:06:02.218\nTot wanneer kan ik afzeggen?\n\n119\n00:06:02.329 --> 00:06:06.729\nGraag minimaal vierentwintig uur van tevoren.\n\n120\n00:06:06.773 --> 00:06:09.818\nDuidelijk, dat zal ik onthouden.\n\n121\n00:06:09.862 --> 00:06:14.351\nDan staat alles vast voor dinsdag de veertiende.\n\n122\n00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:16.752\nDinsdag om tien uur.\n\n123\n00:06:16.819 --> 00:06:19.419\nKlopt. We zien u graag dan.\n\n124\n00:06:19.486 --> 00:06:22.486\nHartelijk dank voor uw hulp, Sanne.\n\n125\n00:06:22.574 --> 00:06:25.041\nGraag gedaan, meneer De Vries.\n\n126\n00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.263\nEen fijne dag nog!\n\n127\n00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:31.152\nDank u wel, voor u ook een fijne dag.\n\n128\n00:06:31.197 --> 00:06:32.974\nTot dinsdag!\n\n129\n00:06:33.019 --> 00:06:35.108\nTot dinsdag, dag!\n\n130\n00:06:35.152 --> 00:06:35.774\nDag!\n
making_appointment	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:06.933\nGood afternoon, De Jong Consultancy, you are speaking with Sanne.\n\n2\n00:00:06.978 --> 00:00:10.356\nGood afternoon Sanne, this is Mark de Vries.\n\n3\n00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.690\nHello Mr. De Vries. How can I help you?\n\n4\n00:00:14.757 --> 00:00:18.001\nI would like to make an appointment.\n\n5\n00:00:18.046 --> 00:00:22.490\nCertainly. Who would you like to meet with?\n\n6\n00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.668\nWith Mr. De Jong, if possible.\n\n7\n00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:29.446\nGood. What is the appointment regarding?\n\n8\n00:00:29.468 --> 00:00:32.401\nIt is about a new project.\n\n9\n00:00:32.446 --> 00:00:36.580\nHave you had an appointment with us before?\n\n10\n00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:38.891\nNo, this is the first time.\n\n11\n00:00:39.047 --> 00:00:45.424\nOkay, welcome! Are you a private or business client?\n\n12\n00:00:45.513 --> 00:00:48.091\nI am a business client.\n\n13\n00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:51.980\nGreat. Do you already have a customer number?\n\n14\n00:00:52.002 --> 00:00:54.047\nNo, I don't have one yet.\n\n15\n00:00:54.091 --> 00:00:58.803\nNo problem. I will create a profile right away.\n\n16\n00:00:58.848 --> 00:01:00.492\nThank you.\n\n17\n00:01:00.537 --> 00:01:02.981\nMay I have your full name?\n\n18\n00:01:03.048 --> 00:01:05.648\nMy name is Mark de Vries.\n\n19\n00:01:05.692 --> 00:01:07.892\nHow do you spell De Vries?\n\n20\n00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:10.270\nWith V-R-I-E-S.\n\n21\n00:01:10.314 --> 00:01:14.403\nClear, thank you. And Mark with a K?\n\n22\n00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.448\nYes, M-A-R-K with a K.\n\n23\n00:01:17.537 --> 00:01:21.827\nExcellent. And which company do you work for?\n\n24\n00:01:21.849 --> 00:01:24.916\nMy company is called Groen Advies.\n\n25\n00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:28.538\nNice name. How do you spell that?\n\n26\n00:01:28.604 --> 00:01:31.960\nG-R-O-E-N, and then Advies.\n\n27\n00:01:32.049 --> 00:01:34.871\nGood, I have noted it down.\n\n28\n00:01:34.893 --> 00:01:36.493\nGreat, thanks.\n\n29\n00:01:36.582 --> 00:01:40.271\nAnd what is the project about exactly?\n\n30\n00:01:40.293 --> 00:01:43.139\nIt is about sustainable construction.\n\n31\n00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.939\nAh, that is very interesting.\n\n32\n00:01:45.983 --> 00:01:48.317\nYes, we are looking for an expert.\n\n33\n00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:51.717\nMr. De Jong can certainly help you.\n\n34\n00:01:51.761 --> 00:01:53.917\nHow nice to hear!\n\n35\n00:01:53.961 --> 00:01:57.094\nHow much time do you think you will need?\n\n36\n00:01:57.161 --> 00:01:59.628\nI think about an hour.\n\n37\n00:01:59.694 --> 00:02:02.606\nAn hour is usually standard.\n\n38\n00:02:02.672 --> 00:02:04.917\nIs that enough time?\n\n39\n00:02:05.006 --> 00:02:08.118\nYes, for a first meeting it is.\n\n40\n00:02:08.162 --> 00:02:09.651\nGreat, that is good.\n\n41\n00:02:09.718 --> 00:02:12.296\nLet me check the calendar.\n\n42\n00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.362\nTake your time.\n\n43\n00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:16.696\nCan you still make it this week?\n\n44\n00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.518\nThis week is difficult for me.\n\n45\n00:02:19.584 --> 00:02:21.896\nIs Wednesday not an option?\n\n46\n00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.673\nNo, I already have a training then.\n\n47\n00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.873\nAnd Thursday afternoon at three o'clock?\n\n48\n00:02:27.896 --> 00:02:31.052\nUnfortunately, I am full on Thursday.\n\n49\n00:02:31.141 --> 00:02:33.363\nAnd Friday morning?\n\n50\n00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.541\nI don't work on Friday.\n\n51\n00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:39.208\nOkay, then we will look at next week.\n\n52\n00:02:39.252 --> 00:02:42.341\nYes, please. That suits me better.\n\n53\n00:02:42.363 --> 00:02:45.363\nHow does Monday at ten o'clock suit you?\n\n54\n00:02:45.386 --> 00:02:48.830\nMonday morning I already have a meeting.\n\n55\n00:02:48.852 --> 00:02:51.342\nCan you do Monday afternoon?\n\n56\n00:02:51.387 --> 00:02:53.387\nWhat time in the afternoon?\n\n57\n00:02:53.498 --> 00:02:56.253\nAt two o'clock, for example?\n\n58\n00:02:56.298 --> 00:02:59.031\nTwo o'clock is unfortunately too early.\n\n59\n00:02:59.098 --> 00:03:00.964\nAnd at four o'clock?\n\n60\n00:03:01.053 --> 00:03:03.520\nFour o'clock suits me well!\n\n61\n00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:07.342\nWait, I see that Mr. De Jong is busy then.\n\n62\n00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.476\nOh, that's a pity.\n\n63\n00:03:09.498 --> 00:03:12.431\nDoes Tuesday offer a possibility?\n\n64\n00:03:12.476 --> 00:03:14.521\nI can do Tuesday.\n\n65\n00:03:14.566 --> 00:03:17.166\nTuesday morning at ten o'clock?\n\n66\n00:03:17.188 --> 00:03:19.877\nTen o'clock suits me very well.\n\n67\n00:03:19.921 --> 00:03:23.321\nSo Tuesday at ten o'clock at the office?\n\n68\n00:03:23.388 --> 00:03:26.277\nIs that Tuesday the fourteenth?\n\n69\n00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:30.832\nLet me check... Yes, the fourteenth.\n\n70\n00:03:30.854 --> 00:03:34.232\nPerfect, that is in my calendar.\n\n71\n00:03:34.321 --> 00:03:38.611\nGreat! Shall I confirm it permanently?\n\n72\n00:03:38.656 --> 00:03:40.878\nYes, please.\n\n73\n00:03:40.967 --> 00:03:44.744\nI now need a few more details.\n\n74\n00:03:44.811 --> 00:03:47.589\nOf course, go ahead and ask.\n\n75\n00:03:47.633 --> 00:03:49.944\nWhat is your phone number?\n\n76\n00:03:49.989 --> 00:03:55.456\nMy number is 06 12 34 56 78.\n\n77\n00:03:55.567 --> 00:04:01.590\nI repeat: 06 12 34 56 78?\n\n78\n00:04:01.723 --> 00:04:04.012\nYes, that is completely correct.\n\n79\n00:04:04.079 --> 00:04:06.234\nAnd what is your email address?\n\n80\n00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:10.346\nMy email is mark@groenadvies.nl.\n\n81\n00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.990\nHow do you spell groenadvies?\n\n82\n00:04:13.057 --> 00:04:15.057\nG-R-O-E-N-A-D-V-I-E-S.\n\n83\n00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:20.212\nSo mark at groenadvies dot nl?\n\n84\n00:04:20.257 --> 00:04:21.791\nYes, exactly.\n\n85\n00:04:21.836 --> 00:04:25.658\nThank you. I will send a confirmation.\n\n86\n00:04:25.747 --> 00:04:28.347\nWill I receive that by email?\n\n87\n00:04:28.391 --> 00:04:31.147\nYes, immediately after this call.\n\n88\n00:04:31.191 --> 00:04:33.191\nThat is very nice.\n\n89\n00:04:33.236 --> 00:04:36.080\nWe are at the main office.\n\n90\n00:04:36.124 --> 00:04:38.080\nWhere is that exactly?\n\n91\n00:04:38.169 --> 00:04:40.791\nAt Marktstraat number ten.\n\n92\n00:04:40.858 --> 00:04:43.102\nIs that in the city center?\n\n93\n00:04:43.169 --> 00:04:45.814\nYes, close to the station.\n\n94\n00:04:45.837 --> 00:04:48.726\nCan you park easily there?\n\n95\n00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.948\nWe have our own parking lot.\n\n96\n00:04:52.059 --> 00:04:54.370\nDo I have to pay for that?\n\n97\n00:04:54.503 --> 00:04:58.148\nNo, that is free for visitors.\n\n98\n00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:00.326\nThat is very convenient.\n\n99\n00:05:00.392 --> 00:05:03.370\nYou can report to the reception desk.\n\n100\n00:05:03.437 --> 00:05:06.148\nAnd who should I report to?\n\n101\n00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.571\nTo me, at the reception.\n\n102\n00:05:08.593 --> 00:05:11.082\nHow nice, then I will see you there.\n\n103\n00:05:11.127 --> 00:05:13.993\nDo I need to bring any documents?\n\n104\n00:05:14.127 --> 00:05:16.371\nNo, that is not strictly necessary.\n\n105\n00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.993\nMaybe a notepad?\n\n106\n00:05:19.082 --> 00:05:22.771\nYes, a notepad is always useful.\n\n107\n00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.016\nAnd do not forget your ID.\n\n108\n00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:30.683\nGood that you mention it, I will bring my passport.\n\n109\n00:05:30.728 --> 00:05:34.572\nGreat. Do you have any other questions?\n\n110\n00:05:34.661 --> 00:05:37.083\nIs there also coffee at the office?\n\n111\n00:05:37.172 --> 00:05:41.172\nCertainly, we have delicious coffee and tea.\n\n112\n00:05:41.217 --> 00:05:43.039\nThat sounds good!\n\n113\n00:05:43.061 --> 00:05:46.861\nWould you also like the appointment in your online calendar?\n\n114\n00:05:47.061 --> 00:05:50.772\nYes, an email invitation is fine.\n\n115\n00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:53.951\nThat is included in the confirmation email.\n\n116\n00:05:53.996 --> 00:05:55.773\nAll good.\n\n117\n00:05:55.818 --> 00:05:59.751\nIf something comes up, please call us.\n\n118\n00:05:59.796 --> 00:06:02.218\nUntil when can I cancel?\n\n119\n00:06:02.329 --> 00:06:06.729\nPreferably at least 24 hours in advance.\n\n120\n00:06:06.773 --> 00:06:09.818\nClear, I will remember that.\n\n121\n00:06:09.862 --> 00:06:14.351\nThen everything is set for Tuesday the fourteenth.\n\n122\n00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:16.752\nTuesday at ten o'clock.\n\n123\n00:06:16.819 --> 00:06:19.419\nCorrect. We look forward to seeing you then.\n\n124\n00:06:19.486 --> 00:06:22.486\nThank you very much for your help, Sanne.\n\n125\n00:06:22.574 --> 00:06:25.041\nYou're welcome, Mr. De Vries.\n\n126\n00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.263\nHave a nice day!\n\n127\n00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:31.152\nThank you, have a nice day as well.\n\n128\n00:06:31.197 --> 00:06:32.974\nSee you Tuesday!\n\n129\n00:06:33.019 --> 00:06:35.108\nSee you Tuesday, bye!\n\n130\n00:06:35.152 --> 00:06:35.774\nBye!\n
phone_call_basic	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.644\nGoedemorgen, kantoor Jansen. Met Daan.\n\n2\n00:00:04.711 --> 00:00:08.400\nGoedemorgen Daan, met Sophie van Dijk.\n\n3\n00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:11.579\nHallo Sophie! Hoe gaat het met je?\n\n4\n00:00:11.646 --> 00:00:14.690\nGoed, dank je. En met jou?\n\n5\n00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:18.246\nMet mij gaat het ook goed, bedankt.\n\n6\n00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.446\nFijn om te horen.\n\n7\n00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.401\nWat kan ik vandaag voor je doen?\n\n8\n00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.757\nIk zou graag Thomas willen spreken.\n\n9\n00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.624\nThomas? Laat me even kijken.\n\n10\n00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:31.958\nIs hij aanwezig vandaag?\n\n11\n00:00:32.069 --> 00:00:34.269\nEen momentje hoor.\n\n12\n00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:36.224\nJa, natuurlijk.\n\n13\n00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:39.691\nIk zie dat hij niet op zijn plek zit.\n\n14\n00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:42.158\nAh, wat jammer.\n\n15\n00:00:42.202 --> 00:00:45.692\nWacht, ik kijk even in het systeem.\n\n16\n00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:47.003\nIs goed.\n\n17\n00:00:47.026 --> 00:00:49.381\nHij is in een vergadering.\n\n18\n00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.714\nO, begrijpelijk.\n\n19\n00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:55.626\nDe vergadering duurt tot twee uur.\n\n20\n00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.959\nTot twee uur vanmiddag?\n\n21\n00:00:58.026 --> 00:00:59.626\nJa, klopt.\n\n22\n00:00:59.714 --> 00:01:04.271\nEn daarna? Is hij dan wel beschikbaar?\n\n23\n00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:07.427\nDaarna heeft hij nog een gesprek.\n\n24\n00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:09.360\nDrukke dag dus!\n\n25\n00:01:09.404 --> 00:01:11.782\nJa, heel druk vandaag.\n\n26\n00:01:11.827 --> 00:01:14.404\nIs Sanne er misschien wel?\n\n27\n00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:18.027\nSanne? Nee, Sanne is er niet.\n\n28\n00:01:18.049 --> 00:01:20.360\nWerkt zij vandaag niet?\n\n29\n00:01:20.404 --> 00:01:23.872\nNee, Sanne is op vrijdag altijd vrij.\n\n30\n00:01:24.006 --> 00:01:26.606\nAh, dat was ik vergeten.\n\n31\n00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:28.694\nZij is er maandag weer.\n\n32\n00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:31.072\nOke, geen probleem.\n\n33\n00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:34.450\nKan ik een boodschap voor je opnemen?\n\n34\n00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:36.783\nJa, heel graag!\n\n35\n00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:38.628\nWacht heel even.\n\n36\n00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.362\nNeem je tijd.\n\n37\n00:01:40.451 --> 00:01:42.651\nIk zoek even een pen.\n\n38\n00:01:42.673 --> 00:01:44.184\nGeen haast.\n\n39\n00:01:44.251 --> 00:01:48.140\nZo, ik heb een pen en een blaadje.\n\n40\n00:01:48.162 --> 00:01:49.340\nSuper.\n\n41\n00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:51.251\nVertel het maar.\n\n42\n00:01:51.273 --> 00:01:54.851\nKun je vragen of Thomas mij terugbelt?\n\n43\n00:01:54.896 --> 00:01:56.986\nJa, dat schrijf ik op.\n\n44\n00:01:57.008 --> 00:01:58.452\nDank je wel.\n\n45\n00:01:58.497 --> 00:02:00.674\nWat is je telefoonnummer?\n\n46\n00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:08.563\nMijn nummer is 06 12 34 56 78.\n\n47\n00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.163\nWacht, iets langzamer graag.\n\n48\n00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.963\nExcuus! Ik begin opnieuw.\n\n49\n00:02:14.052 --> 00:02:16.276\nGoed, zeg maar.\n\n50\n00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.764\nNul zes.\n\n51\n00:02:17.809 --> 00:02:19.920\nNul zes... ja.\n\n52\n00:02:19.964 --> 00:02:21.276\nTwaalf.\n\n53\n00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.542\nTwaalf... ja.\n\n54\n00:02:23.564 --> 00:02:25.498\nVier en dertig.\n\n55\n00:02:25.542 --> 00:02:27.853\nVier en dertig... ja.\n\n56\n00:02:27.942 --> 00:02:29.942\nZes en vijftig.\n\n57\n00:02:30.009 --> 00:02:32.610\nZes en vijftig... ja.\n\n58\n00:02:32.677 --> 00:02:34.921\nEn acht en zeventig.\n\n59\n00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.054\nAcht en zeventig.\n\n60\n00:02:37.121 --> 00:02:39.032\nHeb je het helemaal?\n\n61\n00:02:39.121 --> 00:02:41.321\nIk herhaal het even.\n\n62\n00:02:41.343 --> 00:02:42.543\nPrima.\n\n63\n00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:47.232\n06 12 34 56 78.\n\n64\n00:02:47.277 --> 00:02:48.966\nKlopt helemaal!\n\n65\n00:02:49.032 --> 00:02:50.256\nMooi.\n\n66\n00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.633\nBedankt.\n\n67\n00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:55.544\nHoe spel je jouw achternaam ook alweer?\n\n68\n00:02:55.589 --> 00:02:58.144\nMijn achternaam is Van Dijk.\n\n69\n00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.456\nHoe spel je dat precies?\n\n70\n00:03:00.522 --> 00:03:02.411\nV - A - N.\n\n71\n00:03:02.478 --> 00:03:04.233\nV - A - N.\n\n72\n00:03:04.322 --> 00:03:05.633\nSpatie.\n\n73\n00:03:05.856 --> 00:03:06.811\nJa.\n\n74\n00:03:06.856 --> 00:03:09.812\nD - I - J - K.\n\n75\n00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:12.990\nD - I - J - K.\n\n76\n00:03:13.057 --> 00:03:15.657\nJa, zo schrijf je het.\n\n77\n00:03:15.746 --> 00:03:17.834\nHelder. Van Dijk.\n\n78\n00:03:17.879 --> 00:03:19.234\nDank je.\n\n79\n00:03:19.412 --> 00:03:21.657\nWaar gaat het over?\n\n80\n00:03:21.679 --> 00:03:24.279\nHet gaat over onze afspraak.\n\n81\n00:03:24.323 --> 00:03:27.080\nDe afspraak voor volgende week?\n\n82\n00:03:27.169 --> 00:03:28.836\nJa, precies.\n\n83\n00:03:28.858 --> 00:03:31.502\nWelke dag was dat ook alweer?\n\n84\n00:03:31.547 --> 00:03:34.947\nWe hadden een afspraak op dinsdag.\n\n85\n00:03:34.991 --> 00:03:37.102\nDinsdag om hoe laat?\n\n86\n00:03:37.191 --> 00:03:39.413\nOm tien uur 's morgens.\n\n87\n00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.547\nEn wil je die afspraak verzetten?\n\n88\n00:03:42.613 --> 00:03:46.192\nJa, ik kan op dinsdag helaas niet.\n\n89\n00:03:46.281 --> 00:03:47.903\nO, wat jammer.\n\n90\n00:03:47.926 --> 00:03:50.459\nKan het misschien op woensdag?\n\n91\n00:03:50.548 --> 00:03:53.792\nIk kijk even snel in zijn agenda.\n\n92\n00:03:53.814 --> 00:03:55.414\nFijn, dank je.\n\n93\n00:03:55.459 --> 00:03:59.526\nOp woensdag heeft hij om elf uur tijd.\n\n94\n00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:02.149\nElf uur is perfect voor mij!\n\n95\n00:04:02.216 --> 00:04:05.171\nMooi, dan schrijf ik dat erbij.\n\n96\n00:04:05.193 --> 00:04:07.860\nDat is erg vriendelijk van je.\n\n97\n00:04:07.927 --> 00:04:10.104\nGeen probleem hoor.\n\n98\n00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.527\nHeb je nog tijd voor een korte vraag?\n\n99\n00:04:13.549 --> 00:04:16.349\nNatuurlijk, stel je vraag maar.\n\n100\n00:04:16.393 --> 00:04:19.283\nZijn jullie vanmiddag lang open?\n\n101\n00:04:19.306 --> 00:04:21.750\nWe zijn open tot vijf uur.\n\n102\n00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:24.306\nTot vijf uur, oke.\n\n103\n00:04:24.372 --> 00:04:26.728\nZoals elke werkdag.\n\n104\n00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.128\nDuidelijk.\n\n105\n00:04:28.194 --> 00:04:31.017\nWil je nog een brief meenemen?\n\n106\n00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:33.506\nNee, dat hoeft niet.\n\n107\n00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.506\nIs je adres nog steeds hetzelfde?\n\n108\n00:04:36.572 --> 00:04:39.307\nMijn adres is niet veranderd.\n\n109\n00:04:39.351 --> 00:04:40.862\nMooi zo.\n\n110\n00:04:40.907 --> 00:04:43.596\nMaar jullie zijn toch verhuisd?\n\n111\n00:04:43.684 --> 00:04:45.373\nJa, dat klopt!\n\n112\n00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.996\nWat is het nieuwe adres?\n\n113\n00:04:48.018 --> 00:04:51.218\nKerkstraat nummer 45.\n\n114\n00:04:51.262 --> 00:04:53.862\nKerkstraat nummer 45.\n\n115\n00:04:53.907 --> 00:04:55.974\nJa, in het centrum.\n\n116\n00:04:56.041 --> 00:04:58.530\nIs dat dicht bij de markt?\n\n117\n00:04:58.574 --> 00:05:02.063\nJa, twee minuten lopen van de markt.\n\n118\n00:05:02.108 --> 00:05:04.463\nDat is makkelijk te vinden.\n\n119\n00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.041\nZeker, heel centraal.\n\n120\n00:05:07.063 --> 00:05:08.597\nNou, super!\n\n121\n00:05:08.663 --> 00:05:13.487\nIk geef het bericht aan Thomas zodra hij terug is.\n\n122\n00:05:13.553 --> 00:05:16.242\nHeel erg bedankt voor je hulp.\n\n123\n00:05:16.287 --> 00:05:18.731\nGraag gedaan, Sophie!\n\n124\n00:05:18.753 --> 00:05:20.776\nFijne dag nog verder!\n\n125\n00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.309\nDank je, voor jou ook een fijne dag.\n\n126\n00:05:24.331 --> 00:05:27.309\nDank je wel. Tot ziens!\n\n127\n00:05:27.353 --> 00:05:29.109\nTot ziens en dag!\n
phone_call_basic	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.644\nGood morning, Jansen Office. Daan speaking.\n\n2\n00:00:04.711 --> 00:00:08.400\nGood morning Daan, this is Sophie van Dijk.\n\n3\n00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:11.579\nHi Sophie! How are you doing?\n\n4\n00:00:11.646 --> 00:00:14.690\nI'm good, thanks. And you?\n\n5\n00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:18.246\nI'm doing well too, thank you.\n\n6\n00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.446\nGood to hear.\n\n7\n00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.401\nWhat can I do for you today?\n\n8\n00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.757\nI'd like to speak with Thomas, please.\n\n9\n00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.624\nThomas? Let me check.\n\n10\n00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:31.958\nIs he in today?\n\n11\n00:00:32.069 --> 00:00:34.269\nJust a moment.\n\n12\n00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:36.224\nYes, of course.\n\n13\n00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:39.691\nI see he's not at his desk.\n\n14\n00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:42.158\nAh, that's a shame.\n\n15\n00:00:42.202 --> 00:00:45.692\nWait, let me look in the system.\n\n16\n00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:47.003\nSure.\n\n17\n00:00:47.026 --> 00:00:49.381\nHe's in a meeting.\n\n18\n00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.714\nOh, I see.\n\n19\n00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:55.626\nThe meeting goes until two o'clock.\n\n20\n00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.959\nUntil two this afternoon?\n\n21\n00:00:58.026 --> 00:00:59.626\nYes, that's right.\n\n22\n00:00:59.714 --> 00:01:04.271\nAnd after that? Will he be available then?\n\n23\n00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:07.427\nAfter that, he has another meeting.\n\n24\n00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:09.360\nA busy day, then!\n\n25\n00:01:09.404 --> 00:01:11.782\nYes, very busy today.\n\n26\n00:01:11.827 --> 00:01:14.404\nIs Sanne around by any chance?\n\n27\n00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:18.027\nSanne? No, Sanne isn't here.\n\n28\n00:01:18.049 --> 00:01:20.360\nIs she not working today?\n\n29\n00:01:20.404 --> 00:01:23.872\nNo, Sanne always has Fridays off.\n\n30\n00:01:24.006 --> 00:01:26.606\nAh, I forgot about that.\n\n31\n00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:28.694\nShe'll be back on Monday.\n\n32\n00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:31.072\nOkay, no problem.\n\n33\n00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:34.450\nCan I take a message for you?\n\n34\n00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:36.783\nYes, please!\n\n35\n00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:38.628\nHold on a second.\n\n36\n00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.362\nTake your time.\n\n37\n00:01:40.451 --> 00:01:42.651\nLet me find a pen.\n\n38\n00:01:42.673 --> 00:01:44.184\nNo rush.\n\n39\n00:01:44.251 --> 00:01:48.140\nOkay, I've got a pen and paper.\n\n40\n00:01:48.162 --> 00:01:49.340\nGreat.\n\n41\n00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:51.251\nGo ahead.\n\n42\n00:01:51.273 --> 00:01:54.851\nCould you ask Thomas to call me back?\n\n43\n00:01:54.896 --> 00:01:56.986\nSure, I'll write that down.\n\n44\n00:01:57.008 --> 00:01:58.452\nThank you.\n\n45\n00:01:58.497 --> 00:02:00.674\nWhat's your phone number?\n\n46\n00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:08.563\nMy number is 06 12 34 56 78.\n\n47\n00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.163\nWait, a bit slower please.\n\n48\n00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.963\nSorry! I'll start over.\n\n49\n00:02:14.052 --> 00:02:16.276\nOkay, go ahead.\n\n50\n00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.764\nZero six.\n\n51\n00:02:17.809 --> 00:02:19.920\nZero six... yes.\n\n52\n00:02:19.964 --> 00:02:21.276\nTwelve.\n\n53\n00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.542\nTwelve... yes.\n\n54\n00:02:23.564 --> 00:02:25.498\nThirty-four.\n\n55\n00:02:25.542 --> 00:02:27.853\nThirty-four... yes.\n\n56\n00:02:27.942 --> 00:02:29.942\nFifty-six.\n\n57\n00:02:30.009 --> 00:02:32.610\nFifty-six... yes.\n\n58\n00:02:32.677 --> 00:02:34.921\nAnd seventy-eight.\n\n59\n00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.054\nSeventy-eight.\n\n60\n00:02:37.121 --> 00:02:39.032\nDid you get all that?\n\n61\n00:02:39.121 --> 00:02:41.321\nLet me repeat it back to you.\n\n62\n00:02:41.343 --> 00:02:42.543\nSounds good.\n\n63\n00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:47.232\n06 12 34 56 78.\n\n64\n00:02:47.277 --> 00:02:48.966\nThat's exactly right!\n\n65\n00:02:49.032 --> 00:02:50.256\nGreat.\n\n66\n00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.633\nThanks.\n\n67\n00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:55.544\nHow do you spell your last name again?\n\n68\n00:02:55.589 --> 00:02:58.144\nMy last name is Van Dijk.\n\n69\n00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.456\nHow do you spell that, exactly?\n\n70\n00:03:00.522 --> 00:03:02.411\nV - A - N.\n\n71\n00:03:02.478 --> 00:03:04.233\nV - A - N.\n\n72\n00:03:04.322 --> 00:03:05.633\nSpace.\n\n73\n00:03:05.856 --> 00:03:06.811\nYes.\n\n74\n00:03:06.856 --> 00:03:09.812\nD - I - J - K.\n\n75\n00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:12.990\nD - I - J - K.\n\n76\n00:03:13.057 --> 00:03:15.657\nYes, that's how you spell it.\n\n77\n00:03:15.746 --> 00:03:17.834\nGot it. Van Dijk.\n\n78\n00:03:17.879 --> 00:03:19.234\nThank you.\n\n79\n00:03:19.412 --> 00:03:21.657\nWhat is this regarding?\n\n80\n00:03:21.679 --> 00:03:24.279\nIt's about our appointment.\n\n81\n00:03:24.323 --> 00:03:27.080\nThe appointment for next week?\n\n82\n00:03:27.169 --> 00:03:28.836\nYes, exactly.\n\n83\n00:03:28.858 --> 00:03:31.502\nWhich day was that again?\n\n84\n00:03:31.547 --> 00:03:34.947\nWe had an appointment on Tuesday.\n\n85\n00:03:34.991 --> 00:03:37.102\nTuesday at what time?\n\n86\n00:03:37.191 --> 00:03:39.413\nAt ten o'clock in the morning.\n\n87\n00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.547\nAnd would you like to reschedule that appointment?\n\n88\n00:03:42.613 --> 00:03:46.192\nYes, unfortunately I can't make it on Tuesday.\n\n89\n00:03:46.281 --> 00:03:47.903\nOh, that's a shame.\n\n90\n00:03:47.926 --> 00:03:50.459\nWould Wednesday be possible instead?\n\n91\n00:03:50.548 --> 00:03:53.792\nLet me quickly check his calendar.\n\n92\n00:03:53.814 --> 00:03:55.414\nGreat, thanks.\n\n93\n00:03:55.459 --> 00:03:59.526\nOn Wednesday, he has time at eleven o'clock.\n\n94\n00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:02.149\nEleven o'clock is perfect for me!\n\n95\n00:04:02.216 --> 00:04:05.171\nGreat, then I'll add that to the note.\n\n96\n00:04:05.193 --> 00:04:07.860\nThat's very kind of you.\n\n97\n00:04:07.927 --> 00:04:10.104\nNo problem at all.\n\n98\n00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.527\nDo you have time for a quick question?\n\n99\n00:04:13.549 --> 00:04:16.349\nOf course, go ahead and ask.\n\n100\n00:04:16.393 --> 00:04:19.283\nAre you open late this afternoon?\n\n101\n00:04:19.306 --> 00:04:21.750\nWe're open until five o'clock.\n\n102\n00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:24.306\nUntil five, okay.\n\n103\n00:04:24.372 --> 00:04:26.728\nLike every workday.\n\n104\n00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.128\nGot it.\n\n105\n00:04:28.194 --> 00:04:31.017\nDo you still want to take a letter with you?\n\n106\n00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:33.506\nNo, that won't be necessary.\n\n107\n00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.506\nIs your address still the same?\n\n108\n00:04:36.572 --> 00:04:39.307\nMy address hasn't changed.\n\n109\n00:04:39.351 --> 00:04:40.862\nGood.\n\n110\n00:04:40.907 --> 00:04:43.596\nBut you moved, didn't you?\n\n111\n00:04:43.684 --> 00:04:45.373\nYes, that's right!\n\n112\n00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.996\nWhat's the new address?\n\n113\n00:04:48.018 --> 00:04:51.218\n45 Kerkstraat.\n\n114\n00:04:51.262 --> 00:04:53.862\n45 Kerkstraat.\n\n115\n00:04:53.907 --> 00:04:55.974\nYes, in the city center.\n\n116\n00:04:56.041 --> 00:04:58.530\nIs that near the market square?\n\n117\n00:04:58.574 --> 00:05:02.063\nYes, a two-minute walk from the market square.\n\n118\n00:05:02.108 --> 00:05:04.463\nThat's easy to find.\n\n119\n00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.041\nDefinitely, very central.\n\n120\n00:05:07.063 --> 00:05:08.597\nOh, awesome!\n\n121\n00:05:08.663 --> 00:05:13.487\nI'll pass the message to Thomas as soon as he's back.\n\n122\n00:05:13.553 --> 00:05:16.242\nThank you so much for your help.\n\n123\n00:05:16.287 --> 00:05:18.731\nYou're very welcome, Sophie!\n\n124\n00:05:18.753 --> 00:05:20.776\nHave a nice rest of your day!\n\n125\n00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.309\nThanks, have a great day too.\n\n126\n00:05:24.331 --> 00:05:27.309\nThank you. Goodbye!\n\n127\n00:05:27.353 --> 00:05:29.109\nGoodbye, bye!\n
vocab_alphabet_pronunciation	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:09.321\nWelcome! Let's go through the entire Dutch alphabet from A to Z with pronunciation examples.\n\n2\n00:00:09.381 --> 00:00:13.481\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n3\n00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:19.141\nA — sounds like 'ah' in father.\n\n4\n00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:23.782\nDe appel is rood.\n\n5\n00:00:23.842 --> 00:00:28.562\nB — pronounced like English B.\n\n6\n00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:33.022\nIk lees een boek.\n\n7\n00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:39.123\nC — usually pronounced like 'S' or 'K'.\n\n8\n00:00:39.203 --> 00:00:44.163\nIk ga naar de bioscoop.\n\n9\n00:00:44.223 --> 00:00:52.424\nD — pronounced like English D, but like 'T' at the end of words.\n\n10\n00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:56.584\nHet is een mooie dag.\n\n11\n00:00:56.684 --> 00:01:03.085\nE — sounds like 'ay' in say when long.\n\n12\n00:01:03.145 --> 00:01:06.965\nIk wil lekker eten.\n\n13\n00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:11.865\nF — pronounced like English F.\n\n14\n00:01:11.945 --> 00:01:15.086\nIk heb een nieuwe fiets.\n\n15\n00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:19.386\nG — pronounced from the back of the throat.\n\n16\n00:01:19.426 --> 00:01:23.506\nDat is heel goed.\n\n17\n00:01:23.566 --> 00:01:27.786\nH — pronounced with a soft breath.\n\n18\n00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:31.747\nHet huis is groot.\n\n19\n00:01:31.847 --> 00:01:38.047\nI — long 'IE' sounds like 'ee' in see.\n\n20\n00:01:38.127 --> 00:01:42.188\nIk zie het idee.\n\n21\n00:01:42.248 --> 00:01:47.148\nJ — always pronounced like English 'Y'.\n\n22\n00:01:47.228 --> 00:01:50.588\nJa, ik begrijp het.\n\n23\n00:01:50.608 --> 00:01:54.688\nK — pronounced like English K.\n\n24\n00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:58.469\nDe kat is erg klein.\n\n25\n00:01:58.789 --> 00:02:02.389\nL — pronounced like English L.\n\n26\n00:02:02.449 --> 00:02:06.609\nIk leer de Nederlandse taal.\n\n27\n00:02:06.809 --> 00:02:10.470\nM — pronounced like English M.\n\n28\n00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.330\nDe man drinkt melk.\n\n29\n00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:18.110\nN — pronounced like English N.\n\n30\n00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.690\nNee, dank je wel.\n\n31\n00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:26.971\nO — long O sounds like 'oh' in go.\n\n32\n00:02:27.031 --> 00:02:31.231\nHet oog is blauw.\n\n33\n00:02:31.271 --> 00:02:36.091\nP — pronounced like English P.\n\n34\n00:02:36.152 --> 00:02:40.552\nIk schrijf met een pen.\n\n35\n00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:48.272\nQ — usually appears as 'QU', pronounced 'KW'.\n\n36\n00:02:48.312 --> 00:02:52.793\nDat is van goede kwaliteit.\n\n37\n00:02:53.113 --> 00:02:58.413\nR — rolled with the tongue or back of the throat.\n\n38\n00:02:58.433 --> 00:03:02.553\nDe regen valt buiten.\n\n39\n00:03:02.793 --> 00:03:07.314\nS — pronounced like English S.\n\n40\n00:03:07.354 --> 00:03:11.094\nDe deuren sluiten.\n\n41\n00:03:11.134 --> 00:03:15.854\nT — pronounced like English T.\n\n42\n00:03:15.914 --> 00:03:19.975\nIk drink een kopje thee.\n\n43\n00:03:20.035 --> 00:03:28.095\nU — long U sounds like rounded 'ooh' with tight lips.\n\n44\n00:03:28.135 --> 00:03:31.876\nHet is één uur.\n\n45\n00:03:31.936 --> 00:03:38.256\nV — softer than English V, closer to 'F'.\n\n46\n00:03:38.316 --> 00:03:42.536\nMijn vader is thuis.\n\n47\n00:03:42.736 --> 00:03:50.037\nW — pronounced softly with upper teeth touching lower lip.\n\n48\n00:03:50.097 --> 00:03:54.457\nIk drink vers water.\n\n49\n00:03:54.717 --> 00:03:59.978\nX — pronounced like 'KS'.\n\n50\n00:04:00.058 --> 00:04:04.038\nDat is een goede taxi.\n\n51\n00:04:04.358 --> 00:04:11.299\nY — often pronounced as 'IJ' ('ey' sound).\n\n52\n00:04:11.359 --> 00:04:15.239\nIk eet graag yoghurt.\n\n53\n00:04:15.379 --> 00:04:20.959\nZ — voiced like English Z.\n\n54\n00:04:20.999 --> 00:04:24.860\nDe zon schijnt vandaag.\n\n55\n00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:30.320\nGreat job practicing the entire Dutch alphabet today!\n\n56\n00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.540\nSee you next time!\n
vocab_alphabet_pronunciation	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.460\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.180\nWelcome to today's lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.020\nToday we learn about the Dutch alphabet.\n\n4\n00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.121\nWe will practice spelling and sounds.\n\n5\n00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:17.381\nLet's begin!\n\n6\n00:00:17.441 --> 00:00:22.021\nOur first word is ALFABET.\n\n7\n00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:25.981\nAlfabet means alphabet in English.\n\n8\n00:00:26.021 --> 00:00:29.362\nLet's hear it in a sentence.\n\n9\n00:00:29.422 --> 00:00:36.402\nThe alphabet has twenty-six letters.\n\n10\n00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:42.222\nWe learn the Dutch alphabet.\n\n11\n00:00:42.262 --> 00:00:47.723\nRemember: ALFABET = alphabet.\n\n12\n00:00:47.803 --> 00:00:51.863\nOur next word is LETTER.\n\n13\n00:00:51.923 --> 00:00:56.623\nLetter means letter in English.\n\n14\n00:00:56.663 --> 00:01:02.083\nThe first letter is A.\n\n15\n00:01:02.123 --> 00:01:05.944\nWhich letter is this?\n\n16\n00:01:05.984 --> 00:01:11.284\nRemember: LETTER = letter.\n\n17\n00:01:11.364 --> 00:01:15.424\nOur next word is SPELLEN.\n\n18\n00:01:15.504 --> 00:01:20.404\nSpellen means to spell in English.\n\n19\n00:01:20.424 --> 00:01:24.985\nCan you spell your name?\n\n20\n00:01:25.065 --> 00:01:28.145\nI can spell the word.\n\n21\n00:01:28.185 --> 00:01:32.765\nRemember: SPELLEN = to spell.\n\n22\n00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:36.305\nOur next word is NAAM.\n\n23\n00:01:36.385 --> 00:01:40.405\nNaam means name in English.\n\n24\n00:01:40.445 --> 00:01:45.166\nMy name is Jan.\n\n25\n00:01:45.206 --> 00:01:48.626\nWhat is your name?\n\n26\n00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:53.206\nRemember: NAAM = name.\n\n27\n00:01:53.286 --> 00:01:56.886\nOur next word is WOORD.\n\n28\n00:01:56.926 --> 00:02:00.987\nWoord means word in English.\n\n29\n00:02:01.047 --> 00:02:04.247\nThis is a short word.\n\n30\n00:02:04.327 --> 00:02:07.807\nEvery word has letters.\n\n31\n00:02:07.847 --> 00:02:12.407\nRemember: WOORD = word.\n\n32\n00:02:12.487 --> 00:02:15.507\nOur next word is KLANK.\n\n33\n00:02:15.547 --> 00:02:19.628\nKlank means sound in English.\n\n34\n00:02:19.668 --> 00:02:23.048\nListen carefully to the sound.\n\n35\n00:02:23.088 --> 00:02:27.048\nThis sound is very beautiful.\n\n36\n00:02:27.088 --> 00:02:31.588\nRemember: KLANK = sound.\n\n37\n00:02:31.628 --> 00:02:34.148\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n38\n00:02:34.228 --> 00:02:39.029\néén. ALFABET = alphabet.\n\n39\n00:02:39.069 --> 00:02:43.709\ntwee. LETTER = letter.\n\n40\n00:02:43.769 --> 00:02:48.649\ndrie. SPELLEN = to spell.\n\n41\n00:02:48.709 --> 00:02:53.409\nvier. NAAM = name.\n\n42\n00:02:53.469 --> 00:02:58.290\nvijf. WOORD = word.\n\n43\n00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:02.710\nzes. KLANK = sound.\n\n44\n00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.030\nGreat work today!\n
vocab_at_restaurant	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.000\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.980\nWelcome to our Dutch lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:09.281\nToday we learn words at the restaurant.\n\n4\n00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:11.941\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n5\n00:00:12.001 --> 00:00:13.721\nLet's begin!\n\n6\n00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:18.002\nOur first word is MENUKAART.\n\n7\n00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:21.782\nMenukaart means menu.\n\n8\n00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:25.363\nIk bekijk de menukaart.\n\n9\n00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:28.563\nI look at the menu.\n\n10\n00:00:28.623 --> 00:00:30.783\nDe menukaart is erg lang.\n\n11\n00:00:30.803 --> 00:00:32.823\nThe menu is very long.\n\n12\n00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:37.604\nGreat! Next word is BESTELLEN.\n\n13\n00:00:37.664 --> 00:00:41.684\nBestellen means to order.\n\n14\n00:00:41.744 --> 00:00:45.344\nWij willen graag bestellen.\n\n15\n00:00:45.424 --> 00:00:48.085\nWe would like to order.\n\n16\n00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:51.045\nWat gaat u bestellen?\n\n17\n00:00:51.065 --> 00:00:53.985\nWhat are you going to order?\n\n18\n00:00:54.045 --> 00:00:57.466\nNow let's look at courses.\n\n19\n00:00:57.546 --> 00:01:01.866\nOur third word is VOORGERECHT.\n\n20\n00:01:01.926 --> 00:01:05.506\nVoorgerecht means starter.\n\n21\n00:01:05.586 --> 00:01:09.587\nHet voorgerecht is een soep.\n\n22\n00:01:09.607 --> 00:01:12.427\nThe starter is a soup.\n\n23\n00:01:12.507 --> 00:01:16.228\nIk neem een koud voorgerecht.\n\n24\n00:01:16.408 --> 00:01:19.468\nI take a cold starter.\n\n25\n00:01:19.508 --> 00:01:23.008\nNext is HOOFDGERECHT.\n\n26\n00:01:23.048 --> 00:01:27.329\nHoofdgerecht means main course.\n\n27\n00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:31.649\nDit hoofdgerecht is erg lekker.\n\n28\n00:01:31.689 --> 00:01:35.529\nThis main course is very delicious.\n\n29\n00:01:35.589 --> 00:01:38.650\nWat is het hoofdgerecht?\n\n30\n00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:41.510\nWhat is the main course?\n\n31\n00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:45.030\nFifth word is DESSERT.\n\n32\n00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:48.711\nDessert means dessert.\n\n33\n00:01:48.771 --> 00:01:51.871\nIk wil graag een dessert.\n\n34\n00:01:52.051 --> 00:01:54.611\nI would like a dessert.\n\n35\n00:01:54.671 --> 00:01:58.432\nHet dessert is heel zoet.\n\n36\n00:01:58.452 --> 00:02:01.932\nThe dessert is very sweet.\n\n37\n00:02:01.972 --> 00:02:04.252\nNow it is time to pay.\n\n38\n00:02:04.372 --> 00:02:08.913\nOur sixth word is REKENING.\n\n39\n00:02:09.093 --> 00:02:12.153\nRekening means bill.\n\n40\n00:02:12.193 --> 00:02:16.013\nMag ik de rekening, alstublieft?\n\n41\n00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:18.634\nMay I have the bill, please?\n\n42\n00:02:18.674 --> 00:02:22.714\nDe rekening is vijftig euro.\n\n43\n00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.994\nThe bill is fifty euros.\n\n44\n00:02:26.074 --> 00:02:29.835\nOur last word is FOOI.\n\n45\n00:02:29.895 --> 00:02:32.255\nFooi means tip.\n\n46\n00:02:32.335 --> 00:02:35.275\nIk geef een goede fooi.\n\n47\n00:02:35.415 --> 00:02:37.936\nI give a good tip.\n\n48\n00:02:37.976 --> 00:02:40.836\nDe fooi is voor jou.\n\n49\n00:02:40.856 --> 00:02:43.436\nThe tip is for you.\n\n50\n00:02:43.516 --> 00:02:46.236\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n51\n00:02:46.376 --> 00:02:51.117\néén. MENUKAART = menu.\n\n52\n00:02:51.177 --> 00:02:55.937\ntwee. BESTELLEN = to order.\n\n53\n00:02:55.997 --> 00:03:00.878\ndrie. VOORGERECHT = starter.\n\n54\n00:03:00.938 --> 00:03:06.078\nvier. HOOFDGERECHT = main course.\n\n55\n00:03:06.138 --> 00:03:10.659\nvijf. DESSERT = dessert.\n\n56\n00:03:10.699 --> 00:03:15.059\nzes. REKENING = bill.\n\n57\n00:03:15.099 --> 00:03:18.960\nzeven. FOOI = tip.\n\n58\n00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.820\nGreat work today!\n\n59\n00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.160\nSee you next time!\n
vocab_at_restaurant	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.280\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.700\nWelcome to our Dutch lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:11.400\nToday we learn words at the restaurant.\n\n4\n00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.561\nLet's begin!\n\n5\n00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:17.341\nLet's begin!\n\n6\n00:00:17.441 --> 00:00:22.601\nOur first word is MENUKAART.\n\n7\n00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:26.601\nMenukaart means menu.\n\n8\n00:00:26.661 --> 00:00:30.601\nI look at the menu.\n\n9\n00:00:30.741 --> 00:00:33.901\nI look at the menu.\n\n10\n00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:38.162\nThe menu is very long.\n\n11\n00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:41.942\nThe menu is very long.\n\n12\n00:00:41.962 --> 00:00:47.502\nGreat! Next word is BESTELLEN.\n\n13\n00:00:47.522 --> 00:00:51.702\nBestellen means to order.\n\n14\n00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:55.502\nWe would like to order.\n\n15\n00:00:55.542 --> 00:00:58.743\nWe would like to order.\n\n16\n00:00:58.783 --> 00:01:02.003\nWhat are you going to order?\n\n17\n00:01:02.043 --> 00:01:05.383\nWhat are you going to order?\n\n18\n00:01:05.423 --> 00:01:08.863\nNow let's look at courses.\n\n19\n00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:13.703\nOur third word is VOORGERECHT.\n\n20\n00:01:13.763 --> 00:01:18.283\nVoorgerecht means starter.\n\n21\n00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:21.964\nThe starter is a soup.\n\n22\n00:01:22.404 --> 00:01:27.984\nThe starter is a soup.\n\n23\n00:01:28.064 --> 00:01:33.284\nI take a cold starter.\n\n24\n00:01:33.524 --> 00:01:37.824\nI take a cold starter.\n\n25\n00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:41.245\nNext is HOOFDGERECHT.\n\n26\n00:01:41.305 --> 00:01:45.205\nHoofdgerecht means main course.\n\n27\n00:01:45.245 --> 00:01:49.705\nThis main course is very delicious.\n\n28\n00:01:50.165 --> 00:01:57.045\nThis main course is very delicious.\n\n29\n00:01:57.125 --> 00:02:01.885\nWhat is the main course?\n\n30\n00:02:01.965 --> 00:02:06.406\nWhat is the main course?\n\n31\n00:02:06.506 --> 00:02:09.806\nFifth word is DESSERT.\n\n32\n00:02:09.866 --> 00:02:13.446\nDessert means dessert.\n\n33\n00:02:13.506 --> 00:02:18.506\nI would like a dessert.\n\n34\n00:02:18.706 --> 00:02:22.826\nI would like a dessert.\n\n35\n00:02:22.906 --> 00:02:26.407\nThe dessert is very sweet.\n\n36\n00:02:26.847 --> 00:02:31.347\nThe dessert is very sweet.\n\n37\n00:02:31.367 --> 00:02:35.567\nNow it is time to pay.\n\n38\n00:02:35.627 --> 00:02:39.047\nOur sixth word is REKENING.\n\n39\n00:02:39.187 --> 00:02:41.847\nRekening means bill.\n\n40\n00:02:41.887 --> 00:02:44.987\nMay I have the bill, please?\n\n41\n00:02:45.007 --> 00:02:47.208\nMay I have the bill, please?\n\n42\n00:02:47.228 --> 00:02:50.828\nThe bill is fifty euros.\n\n43\n00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:53.828\nThe bill is fifty euros.\n\n44\n00:02:53.908 --> 00:02:57.248\nOur last word is FOOI.\n\n45\n00:02:57.328 --> 00:02:59.748\nFooi means tip.\n\n46\n00:02:59.808 --> 00:03:02.108\nI give a good tip.\n\n47\n00:03:02.228 --> 00:03:04.108\nI give a good tip.\n\n48\n00:03:04.148 --> 00:03:06.468\nThe tip is for you.\n\n49\n00:03:06.488 --> 00:03:08.648\nThe tip is for you.\n\n50\n00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.129\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n51\n00:03:11.189 --> 00:03:15.109\none. MENU = menu.\n\n52\n00:03:15.169 --> 00:03:19.109\ntwo. TO ORDER = to order.\n\n53\n00:03:19.229 --> 00:03:23.369\nthree. STARTER = starter.\n\n54\n00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:27.769\nfour. MAIN COURSE = main course.\n\n55\n00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:31.650\nfive. DESSERT = dessert.\n\n56\n00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:35.350\nsix. BILL = bill.\n\n57\n00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:38.890\nseven. TIP = tip.\n\n58\n00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.410\nGreat work today!\n\n59\n00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.450\nSee you next time!\n
vocab_banking_money	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.780\nWelcome to Dutch vocabulary class.\n\n2\n00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.981\nToday we learn words about money.\n\n3\n00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:11.361\nBanking and paying in Dutch.\n\n4\n00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:14.421\nLearning Dutch is fun!\n\n5\n00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:17.201\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n6\n00:00:17.281 --> 00:00:19.661\nLet's begin!\n\n7\n00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:23.242\nOur first word is EURO.\n\n8\n00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:27.022\nEuro means euro in English.\n\n9\n00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:30.642\nDit kost tien euro.\n\n10\n00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:34.262\nThis costs ten euros.\n\n11\n00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:37.603\nIk heb twintig euro.\n\n12\n00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:41.223\nI have twenty euros.\n\n13\n00:00:41.303 --> 00:00:44.663\nOur second word is GELD.\n\n14\n00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:48.444\nGeld means money in English.\n\n15\n00:00:48.584 --> 00:00:52.244\nGeld is erg belangrijk.\n\n16\n00:00:52.304 --> 00:00:55.684\nMoney is very important.\n\n17\n00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.624\nIk heb geen geld.\n\n18\n00:00:58.804 --> 00:01:01.985\nI have no money.\n\n19\n00:01:02.065 --> 00:01:05.085\nOur third word is BANK.\n\n20\n00:01:05.145 --> 00:01:08.565\nBank means bank in English.\n\n21\n00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:11.205\nIk ga naar de bank.\n\n22\n00:01:11.365 --> 00:01:13.925\nI go to the bank.\n\n23\n00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:17.746\nDe bank is nu open.\n\n24\n00:01:17.766 --> 00:01:20.826\nThe bank is open now.\n\n25\n00:01:20.866 --> 00:01:24.466\nNext, we have REKENING.\n\n26\n00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:29.267\nRekening means account or bill.\n\n27\n00:01:29.327 --> 00:01:32.707\nIk open een rekening.\n\n28\n00:01:32.847 --> 00:01:35.347\nI open an account.\n\n29\n00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:38.107\nMag ik de rekening?\n\n30\n00:01:38.127 --> 00:01:40.727\nMay I have the bill?\n\n31\n00:01:40.807 --> 00:01:44.528\nOur fifth word is PINNEN.\n\n32\n00:01:44.548 --> 00:01:48.508\nPinnen means paying by card.\n\n33\n00:01:48.548 --> 00:01:51.268\nKan ik hier pinnen?\n\n34\n00:01:51.308 --> 00:01:54.208\nCan I pay by card here?\n\n35\n00:01:54.268 --> 00:01:57.229\nIk wil graag pinnen.\n\n36\n00:01:57.369 --> 00:02:00.209\nI want to pay by card.\n\n37\n00:02:00.249 --> 00:02:04.009\nAnother word is CONTANT.\n\n38\n00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:08.629\nContant means cash in English.\n\n39\n00:02:08.689 --> 00:02:12.230\nIk betaal graag contant.\n\n40\n00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.790\nI like to pay cash.\n\n41\n00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:20.510\nBetaalt u liever contant?\n\n42\n00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.651\nDo you prefer paying cash?\n\n43\n00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:29.551\nNext we have WISSELGELD.\n\n44\n00:02:29.591 --> 00:02:34.691\nWisselgeld means change in English.\n\n45\n00:02:34.751 --> 00:02:38.872\nHier is uw wisselgeld.\n\n46\n00:02:38.912 --> 00:02:42.032\nHere is your change.\n\n47\n00:02:42.112 --> 00:02:46.932\nIk krijg vijf euro wisselgeld.\n\n48\n00:02:47.052 --> 00:02:50.773\nI get five euros change.\n\n49\n00:02:50.853 --> 00:02:55.633\nOur eighth word is SPAREN.\n\n50\n00:02:55.753 --> 00:02:59.853\nSparen means to save money.\n\n51\n00:02:59.953 --> 00:03:04.294\nIk wil veel geld sparen.\n\n52\n00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:07.814\nI want to save much money.\n\n53\n00:03:07.874 --> 00:03:12.174\nWij sparen voor een huis.\n\n54\n00:03:12.214 --> 00:03:15.374\nWe save for a house.\n\n55\n00:03:15.454 --> 00:03:20.675\nOur ninth word is OVERSCHRIJVING.\n\n56\n00:03:20.755 --> 00:03:24.015\nOverschrijving means bank transfer.\n\n57\n00:03:24.075 --> 00:03:28.635\nIk doe een overschrijving.\n\n58\n00:03:28.735 --> 00:03:31.256\nI make a bank transfer.\n\n59\n00:03:31.336 --> 00:03:36.296\nDe overschrijving is klaar.\n\n60\n00:03:36.336 --> 00:03:38.516\nThe transfer is finished.\n\n61\n00:03:38.576 --> 00:03:41.096\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n62\n00:03:41.196 --> 00:03:45.517\néén. EURO = euro.\n\n63\n00:03:45.557 --> 00:03:50.157\ntwee. GELD = money.\n\n64\n00:03:50.177 --> 00:03:54.757\ndrie. BANK = bank.\n\n65\n00:03:54.837 --> 00:04:00.178\nvier. REKENING = account or bill.\n\n66\n00:04:00.258 --> 00:04:05.198\nvijf. PINNEN = to pay by card.\n\n67\n00:04:05.318 --> 00:04:10.279\nzes. CONTANT = cash.\n\n68\n00:04:10.339 --> 00:04:15.539\nzeven. WISSELGELD = change.\n\n69\n00:04:15.639 --> 00:04:20.919\nacht. SPAREN = to save.\n\n70\n00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:26.880\nnegen. OVERSCHRIJVING = bank transfer.\n\n71\n00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.960\nGreat work today!\n\n72\n00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.100\nSee you next time!\n
