vocab_celebrations	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.980\nHello everyone!\n\n2\n00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.700\nWelcome to today's lesson.\n\n3\n00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.621\nToday we learn about celebrations.\n\n4\n00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:13.861\nCelebrations are very fun.\n\n5\n00:00:13.961 --> 00:00:16.301\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n6\n00:00:16.401 --> 00:00:18.921\nLet's start with our lesson.\n\n7\n00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:22.382\nOur first word is VERJAARDAG.\n\n8\n00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:26.282\nVerjaardag means birthday in English.\n\n9\n00:00:26.422 --> 00:00:30.522\nLet's hear it in a sentence.\n\n10\n00:00:30.582 --> 00:00:34.083\nVandaag is mijn verjaardag.\n\n11\n00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:37.823\nToday is my birthday.\n\n12\n00:00:37.923 --> 00:00:42.083\nGefeliciteerd met je verjaardag!\n\n13\n00:00:42.123 --> 00:00:43.904\nHappy birthday to you!\n\n14\n00:00:44.024 --> 00:00:48.264\nRemember: VERJAARDAG means birthday.\n\n15\n00:00:48.344 --> 00:00:51.244\nOur next word is FEEST.\n\n16\n00:00:51.324 --> 00:00:56.065\nFeest means party in English.\n\n17\n00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:59.465\nWij geven een leuk feest.\n\n18\n00:00:59.505 --> 00:01:03.005\nWe give a fun party.\n\n19\n00:01:03.065 --> 00:01:06.045\nHet feest is vanavond.\n\n20\n00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:07.986\nThe party is tonight.\n\n21\n00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:10.886\nOur next word is TAART.\n\n22\n00:01:10.926 --> 00:01:15.206\nTaart means cake in English.\n\n23\n00:01:15.286 --> 00:01:19.486\nIk eet lekkere taart.\n\n24\n00:01:19.687 --> 00:01:23.807\nI eat delicious cake.\n\n25\n00:01:23.827 --> 00:01:28.587\nDe taart is erg zoet.\n\n26\n00:01:28.607 --> 00:01:32.848\nThe cake is very sweet.\n\n27\n00:01:32.948 --> 00:01:36.928\nOur next word is CADEAU.\n\n28\n00:01:36.988 --> 00:01:41.728\nCadeau means gift in English.\n\n29\n00:01:41.808 --> 00:01:46.269\nIk krijg een mooi cadeau.\n\n30\n00:01:46.449 --> 00:01:50.389\nI get a beautiful gift.\n\n31\n00:01:50.449 --> 00:01:55.009\nDit cadeau is voor jou.\n\n32\n00:01:55.029 --> 00:01:58.910\nThis present is for you.\n\n33\n00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:03.270\nOur next word is KAART.\n\n34\n00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:08.151\nKaart means card in English.\n\n35\n00:02:08.231 --> 00:02:13.051\nIk schrijf een mooie kaart.\n\n36\n00:02:13.231 --> 00:02:17.151\nI write a nice card.\n\n37\n00:02:17.191 --> 00:02:21.672\nDe kaart ligt op tafel.\n\n38\n00:02:21.712 --> 00:02:24.352\nThe card is on the table.\n\n39\n00:02:24.432 --> 00:02:28.892\nOur next word is UITNODIGING.\n\n40\n00:02:28.972 --> 00:02:34.733\nUitnodiging means invitation in English.\n\n41\n00:02:34.813 --> 00:02:38.973\nIk stuur een uitnodiging.\n\n42\n00:02:39.113 --> 00:02:43.053\nI send an invitation.\n\n43\n00:02:43.113 --> 00:02:46.754\nBedankt voor de uitnodiging!\n\n44\n00:02:46.974 --> 00:02:51.154\nThank you for the invitation!\n\n45\n00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:55.734\nOur last word is GELUKKIG.\n\n46\n00:02:55.834 --> 00:03:00.855\nGelukkig means happy in English.\n\n47\n00:03:00.915 --> 00:03:05.575\nIk ben vandaag heel gelukkig.\n\n48\n00:03:05.775 --> 00:03:09.596\nI am very happy today.\n\n49\n00:03:09.676 --> 00:03:13.456\nIedereen is hier gelukkig.\n\n50\n00:03:13.556 --> 00:03:16.976\nEveryone is happy here.\n\n51\n00:03:17.016 --> 00:03:19.656\nGreat work today!\n\n52\n00:03:19.736 --> 00:03:22.657\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n53\n00:03:22.757 --> 00:03:27.957\néén. VERJAARDAG = birthday.\n\n54\n00:03:27.997 --> 00:03:32.717\ntwee. FEEST = party.\n\n55\n00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:37.298\ndrie. TAART = cake.\n\n56\n00:03:37.418 --> 00:03:42.138\nvier. CADEAU = gift.\n\n57\n00:03:42.218 --> 00:03:46.979\nvijf. KAART = card.\n\n58\n00:03:47.059 --> 00:03:53.479\nzes. UITNODIGING = invitation.\n\n59\n00:03:53.619 --> 00:03:59.100\nzeven. GELUKKIG = happy.\n\n60\n00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.580\nGreat job learning Dutch!\n\n61\n00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.000\nSee you next time!\n
