vocab_city_navigation	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.380\nWelcome to today's Dutch lesson!\n\n2\n00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.540\nToday we learn city navigation words.\n\n3\n00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.780\nNavigating a city is very useful.\n\n4\n00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:15.101\nLaten we beginnen!\n\n5\n00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:19.201\nOur first word is STRAAT.\n\n6\n00:00:19.281 --> 00:00:23.741\nStraat means street in English.\n\n7\n00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:27.981\nDe straat is lang.\n\n8\n00:00:28.021 --> 00:00:31.321\nThe street is long.\n\n9\n00:00:31.361 --> 00:00:35.141\nDit is onze straat.\n\n10\n00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.081\nThis is our street.\n\n11\n00:00:38.161 --> 00:00:42.902\nRemember: STRAAT = street.\n\n12\n00:00:42.982 --> 00:00:47.042\nOur next word is PLEIN.\n\n13\n00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:51.482\nPlein means square in English.\n\n14\n00:00:51.562 --> 00:00:55.642\nHet plein is groot.\n\n15\n00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:59.222\nThe square is big.\n\n16\n00:00:59.282 --> 00:01:02.942\nWij staan op het plein.\n\n17\n00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:06.342\nWe stand on the square.\n\n18\n00:01:06.403 --> 00:01:11.243\nRemember: PLEIN = square.\n\n19\n00:01:11.343 --> 00:01:15.603\nOur third word is BRUG.\n\n20\n00:01:15.663 --> 00:01:19.443\nBrug means bridge in English.\n\n21\n00:01:19.483 --> 00:01:22.683\nDe brug is oud.\n\n22\n00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:26.003\nThe bridge is old.\n\n23\n00:01:26.103 --> 00:01:29.903\nWij gaan over de brug.\n\n24\n00:01:29.943 --> 00:01:33.264\nWe go over the bridge.\n\n25\n00:01:33.324 --> 00:01:39.124\nRemember: BRUG = bridge.\n\n26\n00:01:39.184 --> 00:01:43.464\nOur fourth word is TUNNEL.\n\n27\n00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:49.204\nTunnel means tunnel in English.\n\n28\n00:01:49.244 --> 00:01:53.864\nDe tunnel is donker.\n\n29\n00:01:53.884 --> 00:01:58.144\nThe tunnel is dark.\n\n30\n00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:02.525\nRij door de tunnel.\n\n31\n00:02:02.565 --> 00:02:06.725\nDrive through the tunnel.\n\n32\n00:02:06.785 --> 00:02:12.925\nRemember: TUNNEL = tunnel.\n\n33\n00:02:13.005 --> 00:02:17.685\nOur fifth word is KRUISPUNT.\n\n34\n00:02:17.725 --> 00:02:24.005\nKruispunt means intersection in English.\n\n35\n00:02:24.065 --> 00:02:28.186\nDit is een kruispunt.\n\n36\n00:02:28.206 --> 00:02:32.286\nThis is an intersection.\n\n37\n00:02:32.406 --> 00:02:36.786\nStop bij het kruispunt.\n\n38\n00:02:36.866 --> 00:02:39.646\nStop at the intersection.\n\n39\n00:02:39.686 --> 00:02:44.766\nRemember: KRUISPUNT = intersection.\n\n40\n00:02:44.826 --> 00:02:48.806\nOur sixth word is STOPLICHT.\n\n41\n00:02:48.846 --> 00:02:53.247\nStoplicht means traffic light in English.\n\n42\n00:02:53.307 --> 00:02:57.867\nHet stoplicht is rood.\n\n43\n00:02:57.887 --> 00:03:01.247\nThe traffic light is red.\n\n44\n00:03:01.287 --> 00:03:06.267\nHet stoplicht is groen.\n\n45\n00:03:06.287 --> 00:03:09.687\nThe traffic light is green.\n\n46\n00:03:09.747 --> 00:03:15.187\nRemember: STOPLICHT = traffic light.\n\n47\n00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:19.428\nOur final word is OVERSTEKEN.\n\n48\n00:03:19.488 --> 00:03:23.988\nOversteken means to cross in English.\n\n49\n00:03:24.068 --> 00:03:27.588\nWij steken over.\n\n50\n00:03:27.628 --> 00:03:30.308\nWe cross over.\n\n51\n00:03:30.388 --> 00:03:36.148\nVeilig oversteken is belangrijk.\n\n52\n00:03:36.188 --> 00:03:39.828\nCrossing safely is important.\n\n53\n00:03:39.888 --> 00:03:42.788\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n54\n00:03:42.888 --> 00:03:48.449\néén. STRAAT = street.\n\n55\n00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:54.189\ntwee. PLEIN = square.\n\n56\n00:03:54.249 --> 00:03:59.929\ndrie. BRUG = bridge.\n\n57\n00:03:59.989 --> 00:04:05.349\nvier. TUNNEL = tunnel.\n\n58\n00:04:05.409 --> 00:04:11.549\nvijf. KRUISPUNT = intersection.\n\n59\n00:04:11.669 --> 00:04:17.870\nzes. STOPLICHT = traffic light.\n\n60\n00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:23.710\nzeven. OVERSTEKEN = to cross.\n\n61\n00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:24.990\nGreat work today!\n
