 kook lekkere soep.\n\n33\n00:02:17.286 --> 00:02:21.746\nRemember: KOKEN = cooking.\n\n34\n00:02:21.846 --> 00:02:25.686\nOur sixth word is MUZIEK.\n\n35\n00:02:25.726 --> 00:02:29.166\nMuziek means music.\n\n36\n00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:33.227\nIk luister naar muziek.\n\n37\n00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:36.707\nDe muziek is heel mooi.\n\n38\n00:02:36.787 --> 00:02:41.627\nRemember: MUZIEK = music.\n\n39\n00:02:41.727 --> 00:02:45.787\nOur seventh word is SCHILDEREN.\n\n40\n00:02:45.847 --> 00:02:49.387\nSchilderen means painting.\n\n41\n00:02:49.447 --> 00:02:52.987\nZij kan mooi schilderen.\n\n42\n00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:57.128\nIk schilder een groot huis.\n\n43\n00:02:57.188 --> 00:03:02.248\nRemember: SCHILDEREN = painting.\n\n44\n00:03:02.288 --> 00:03:05.788\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n45\n00:03:05.888 --> 00:03:10.368\néén. VOETBAL = football.\n\n46\n00:03:10.408 --> 00:03:16.228\ntwee. ZWEMMEN = swimming.\n\n47\n00:03:16.308 --> 00:03:23.249\ndrie. FIETSEN = cycling.\n\n48\n00:03:23.349 --> 00:03:30.409\nvier. LEZEN = reading.\n\n49\n00:03:30.469 --> 00:03:36.949\nvijf. KOKEN = cooking.\n\n50\n00:03:37.029 --> 00:03:43.730\nzes. MUZIEK = music.\n\n51\n00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:50.730\nzeven. SCHILDEREN = painting.\n\n52\n00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.930\nGreat work today!\n\n53\n00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:54.650\nSee you next time!\n
