:01:42.928 --> 00:01:46.529\nOur boss is speaking now.\n\n34\n00:01:46.629 --> 00:01:51.489\nOur fifth word is VERGADERING.\n\n35\n00:01:51.529 --> 00:01:55.909\nVergadering means meeting.\n\n36\n00:01:55.989 --> 00:01:59.830\nListen carefully to this sentence.\n\n37\n00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:04.530\nThe meeting starts soon.\n\n38\n00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.990\nThe meeting starts soon.\n\n39\n00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:10.871\nWe have a meeting.\n\n40\n00:02:10.931 --> 00:02:14.291\nWe have a meeting.\n\n41\n00:02:14.371 --> 00:02:19.171\nOur sixth word is SALARIS.\n\n42\n00:02:19.231 --> 00:02:23.372\nSalaris means salary.\n\n43\n00:02:23.412 --> 00:02:26.572\nHere are the examples.\n\n44\n00:02:26.632 --> 00:02:31.712\nThe salary is good.\n\n45\n00:02:31.732 --> 00:02:35.213\nThe salary is good.\n\n46\n00:02:35.293 --> 00:02:40.313\nHe gets his salary.\n\n47\n00:02:40.373 --> 00:02:44.473\nHe gets his salary.\n\n48\n00:02:44.573 --> 00:02:49.454\nOur seventh word is SOLLICITATIE.\n\n49\n00:02:49.514 --> 00:02:54.254\nSollicitatie means job application.\n\n50\n00:02:54.314 --> 00:02:58.054\nLet's hear two sentences.\n\n51\n00:02:58.114 --> 00:03:03.555\nThe job application went well.\n\n52\n00:03:03.575 --> 00:03:07.595\nThe job application went well.\n\n53\n00:03:07.675 --> 00:03:12.976\nI write a job application.\n\n54\n00:03:13.156 --> 00:03:17.056\nI write a job application.\n\n55\n00:03:17.116 --> 00:03:20.896\nLet's recap today's words.\n\n56\n00:03:21.016 --> 00:03:26.937\none. WERKEN = to work.\n\n57\n00:03:26.977 --> 00:03:33.177\ntwo. KANTOOR = office.\n\n58\n00:03:33.237 --> 00:03:39.178\nthree. COLLEGA = colleague.\n\n59\n00:03:39.258 --> 00:03:45.318\nfour. BAAS = boss.\n\n60\n00:03:45.398 --> 00:03:51.779\nfive. VERGADERING = meeting.\n\n61\n00:03:51.859 --> 00:03:57.099\nsix. SALARIS = salary.\n\n62\n00:03:57.179 --> 00:04:03.320\nseven. SOLLICITATIE = job application.\n\n63\n00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.460\nGreat work today!\n\n64\n00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.500\nSee you next time!\n
weather_chat	nl	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.040\nHallo Daan! Wat leuk om jou hier te zien.\n\n2\n00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.480\nHey Sanne! Wat een verrassing. Hoe gaat het?\n\n3\n00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.100\nGoed, dank je! En met jou?\n\n4\n00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.460\nMet mij gaat het ook heel goed.\n\n5\n00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.440\nWat heerlijk weer vandaag, vind je niet?\n\n6\n00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:20.141\nJa, fantastisch! De zon schijnt eindelijk weer.\n\n7\n00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:24.061\nHet is zo fijn na al die regen van gisteren.\n\n8\n00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:29.041\nGisteren was verschrikkelijk. Het regende de hele dag.\n\n9\n00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:34.241\nIk weet het. Ik was helemaal nat geworden op de fiets.\n\n10\n00:00:34.281 --> 00:00:39.801\nDat is niet fijn. Vandaag heb je gelukkig geen paraplu nodig.\n\n11\n00:00:39.821 --> 00:00:44.901\nNee, gelukkig niet. De lucht is prachtig blauw.\n\n12\n00:00:44.921 --> 00:00:47.281\nWeet jij hoe warm het nu is?\n\n13\n00:00:47.361 --> 00:00:52.661\nIk keek net op mijn telefoon. Het is eenentwintig graden.\n\n14\n00:00:52.681 --> 00:00:55.981\nZo warm al? Dat voelt echt als de lente.\n\n15\n00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:59.962\nJa, of zelfs het begin van de zomer!\n\n16\n00:01:00.002 --> 00:01:01.742\nWaar ga je naartoe?\n\n17\n00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:05.222\nIk wandel naar de markt om fruit te kopen.\n\n18\n00:01:05.242 --> 00:01:07.562\nMag ik een stukje meelopen?\n\n19\n00:01:07.582 --> 00:01:09.962\nJa gezellig! Kom mee.\n\n20\n00:01:10.022 --> 00:01:12.622\nLopen in de zon is altijd fijn.\n\n21\n00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:14.882\nDraag jij eigenlijk een jas?\n\n22\n00:01:14.922 --> 00:01:18.822\nJa, maar het is eigenlijk te warm voor deze jas.\n\n23\n00:01:18.882 --> 00:01:22.462\nIk heb alleen een vest aan. Dat is genoeg.\n\n24\n00:01:22.502 --> 00:01:26.082\nVerstandig. Ik ga mijn jas uittrekken.\n\n25\n00:01:26.102 --> 00:01:28.182\nDat is een goed idee.\n\n26\n00:01:28.202 --> 00:01:31.682\nHoe was het weer gisteravond bij jou?\n\n27\n00:01:31.722 --> 00:01:36.863\nToen stormde het een beetje. Zag jij die harde wind?\n\n28\n00:01:36.903 --> 00:01:41.483\nJa, de takken van de bomen waaiden erg heen en weer.\n\n29\n00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:44.683\nEn er was ook veel condens op de ramen.\n\n30\n00:01:44.723 --> 00:01:48.063\nKoud en nat. Wat een verschil met vandaag!\n\n31\n00:01:48.103 --> 00:01:51.503\nNederland heeft echt heel wisselvallig weer.\n\n32\n00:01:51.543 --> 00:01:56.563\nDat is waar. Niets is zo veranderlijk als het weer hier.\n\n33\n00:01:56.623 --> 00:01:59.223\nSoms vier seizoenen in één dag!\n\n34\n00:01:59.263 --> 00:02:03.103\nHaha, exact! Vanmorgen was het nog erg fris.\n\n35\n00:02:03.143 --> 00:02:06.803\nJa, rond acht uur was het pas negen graden.\n\n36\n00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:09.983\nEr lag zelfs nog dauw op het gras.\n\n37\n00:02:10.023 --> 00:02:13.443\nMaar nu is de temperatuur snel gestegen.\n\n38\n00:02:13.463 --> 00:02:16.604\nKijk, daar is het ijssalon op de hoek.\n\n39\n00:02:16.684 --> 00:02:18.824\nZullen we een ijsje halen?\n\n40\n00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:22.424\nLekker! Met dit weer past een ijsje perfect.\n\n41\n00:02:22.444 --> 00:02:24.504\nWelke smaak wil jij?\n\n42\n00:02:24.564 --> 00:02:28.964\nIk neem een bolletje aardbei en een bolletje citroen.\n\n43\n00:02:29.144 --> 00:02:34.144\nLekker verfrissend! Ik neem chocolade en vanille.\n\n44\n00:02:34.304 --> 00:02:37.504\nLaten we op dat bankje in de zon zitten.\n\n45\n00:02:37.544 --> 00:02:39.264\nPrima plannetje.\n\n46\n00:02:39.304 --> 00:02:41.444\nZo, dit ijsje smaakt goed.\n\n47\n00:02:41.464 --> 00:02:45.984\nMijn ijsje ook. Echt genieten zo op de bank.\n\n48\n00:02:46.044 --> 00:02:49.004\nMensen kijken op straat is ook leuk.\n\n49\n00:02:49.084 --> 00:02:52.484\nIedereen ziet er meteen veel vrolijker uit.\n\n50\n00:02:52.524 --> 00:02:55.345\nZeker, de zon maakt iedereen blij.\n\n51\n00:02:55.385 --> 00:02:59.965\nIn de winter is iedereen altijd zo gehaast en koud.\n\n52\n00:03:00.045 --> 00:03:02.025\nHoud jij van de winter?\n\n53\n00:03:02.065 --> 00:03:06.545\nNee, niet echt. Ik hou niet van donkere dagen.\n\n54\n00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:11.505\nIk ook niet. Ik heb liever lange, warme dagen.\n\n55\n00:03:11.525 --> 00:03:14.125\nWelk seizoen vind jij het leukst?\n\n56\n00:03:14.145 --> 00:03:19.345\nDe zomer! Dan kun je naar het strand en laat buiten zitten.\n\n57\n00:03:19.385 --> 00:03:23.925\nDe herfst vind ik soms ook mooi als de bladeren verkleuren.\n\n58\n00:03:24.025 --> 00:03:28.365\nJa, maar al die regen in de herfst is minder leuk.\n\n59\n00:03:28.385 --> 00:03:33.366\nDat klopt. Regen is vervelend als je moet fietsen.\n\n60\n00:03:33.406 --> 00:03:36.486\nHeb jij altijd een regenpak bij je?\n\n61\n00:03:36.566 --> 00:03:40.186\nIn mijn tas heb ik altijd een kleine paraplu.\n\n62\n00:03:40.226 --> 00:03:45.266\nDat is slim. Ik vergeet mijn paraplu bijna altijd.\n\n63\n00:03:45.346 --> 00:03:47.686\nEn dan word je drijfnat!\n\n64\n00:03:47.746 --> 00:03:50.566\nJa, helaas wel. Vorige week nog!\n\n65\n00:03:50.626 --> 00:03:53.626\nO jee, toen het zo hard hagelde?\n\n66\n00:03:53.706 --> 00:04:00.066\nJa! Grote hagelstenen. Mijn hoofd deed er bijna zeer van.\n\n67\n00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:05.066\nHagel is niet fijn. Geef mij maar deze mooie zon.\n\n68\n00:04:05.086 --> 00:04:07.726\nKijk eens naar de lucht daarginds.\n\n69\n00:04:07.766 --> 00:04:09.266\nWaar bedoel je?\n\n70\n00:04:09.326 --> 00:04:13.427\nIn het westen. Daar komen donkere wolken aan.\n\n71\n00:04:13.507 --> 00:04:17.267\nO ja! Die zien er best grijs uit.\n\n72\n00:04:17.307 --> 00:04:19.547\nDenk je dat het gaat regenen?\n\n73\n00:04:19.607 --> 00:04:22.687\nLaat me even op Buienradar kijken.\n\n74\n00:04:22.727 --> 00:04:24.447\nWat zegt de app?\n\n75\n00:04:24.487 --> 00:04:28.547\nWacht, hij laadt even... Ah, hier staat het.\n\n76\n00:04:28.627 --> 00:04:31.027\nEn? Blijft het droog?\n\n77\n00:04:31.067 --> 00:04:35.747\nNee, over een halfuur komt er een kleine regenbui.\n\n78\n00:04:35.807 --> 00:04:38.747\nJammer! Net nu het zo lekker was.\n\n79\n00:04:38.767 --> 00:04:41.227\nHet is maar een korte bui, hoor.\n\n80\n00:04:41.267 --> 00:04:43.267\nKoelt het daarna erg af?\n\n81\n00:04:43.327 --> 00:04:47.707\nEr staat dat de temperatuur zakt naar zeventien graden.\n\n82\n00:04:47.747 --> 00:04:51.308\nDat valt mee, maar het is wel minder warm.\n\n83\n00:04:51.368 --> 00:04:55.148\nZie je die windvlaag? De wind steekt op.\n\n84\n00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:58.508\nJa, de blaadjes op straat waaien weg.\n\n85\n00:04:58.548 --> 00:05:01.468\nMijn ijsje is gelukkig bijna op.\n\n86\n00:05:01.648 --> 00:05:04.828\nMijne ook. Zullen we weer gaan lopen?\n\n87\n00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:08.828\nGoed idee. Waar moet jij eigenlijk naartoe?\n\n88\n00:05:08.888 --> 00:05:12.228\nIk moet naar de apotheek en daarna naar huis.\n\n89\n00:05:12.288 --> 00:05:14.668\nIs de apotheek hier dichtbij?\n\n90\n00:05:14.808 --> 00:05:18.108\nJa, aan het einde van deze straat.\n\n91\n00:05:18.128 --> 00:05:20.968\nDan loop ik nog even met je mee.\n\n92\n00:05:21.008 --> 00:05:24.828\nGezellig! De wolk komt wel snel deze kant op.\n\n93\n00:05:24.848 --> 00:05:28.769\nDe zon is nu helemaal verdwenen achter die wolk.\n\n94\n00:05:28.789 --> 00:05:32.549\nHet wordt meteen een stuk kouder zonder zon.\n\n95\n00:05:32.589 --> 00:05:35.769\nJa, vreemd hoe snel dat kan veranderen.\n\n96\n00:05:35.829 --> 00:05:38.129\nIk doe mijn jas maar weer aan.\n\n97\n00:05:38.189 --> 00:05:41.149\nIk trek mijn vest strakker dicht.\n\n98\n00:05:41.209 --> 00:05:43.029\nVoelde jij een drup?\n\n99\n00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:47.269\nJa! Ik voelde een dikke druppel op mijn arm.\n\n100\n00:05:47.329 --> 00:05:49.489\nEn er valt er nog een!\n\n101\n00:05:49.509 --> 00:05:55.289\nDe regen begint nu al. Sneller dan Buienradar zei!\n\n102\n00:05:55.309 --> 00:05:58.969\nTypisch! De app klopt ook niet altijd.\n\n103\n00:05:59.009 --> 00:06:01.789\nDaar is de apotheek gelukkig al.\n\n104\n00:06:01.829 --> 00:06:04.689\nGa je mee naar binnen om te schuilen?\n\n105\n00:06:04.729 --> 00:06:11.250\nNee, ik moet echt snel naar de supermarkt voor de grote bui losbarst.\n\n106\n00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.590\nHeb je een paraplu bij je?\n\n107\n00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.770\nJa, gelukkig wel! Die pak ik nu uit mijn tas.\n\n108\n00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:21.230\nHeel goed. Dan blijf jij lekker droog.\n\n109\n00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.090\nPas goed op jezelf en succes bij de apotheek!\n\n110\n00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:29.430\nDank je wel, Sanne. Leuk om je gesproken te hebben!\n\n111\n00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.870\nJa, vond ik ook! Tot snel weer.\n\n112\n00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.490\nTot ziens en fijne dag nog!\n\n113\n00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:38.110\nDank je, jij ook! Doei!\n\n114\n00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.290\nDoei doei!\n
weather_chat	en	WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.222 --> 00:00:05.600\nHello Daan! How nice to see you here.\n\n2\n00:00:05.622 --> 00:00:09.422\nHey Sanne! What a surprise. How are you?\n\n3\n00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:12.333\nGood, thank you! And with you?\n\n4\n00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.956\nI am doing very well too.\n\n5\n00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:18.267\nWhat lovely weather today, don't you think?\n\n6\n00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.490\nYes, fantastic! The sun is finally shining again.\n\n7\n00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:27.846\nIt is so nice after all that rain yesterday.\n\n8\n00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:33.379\nYesterday was terrible. It rained the whole day.\n\n9\n00:00:33.468 --> 00:00:39.157\nI know. I got completely wet on my bicycle.\n\n10\n00:00:39.201 --> 00:00:45.334\nThat is not nice. Fortunately, you don't need an umbrella today.\n\n11\n00:00:45.357 --> 00:00:51.001\nNo, fortunately not. The sky is beautifully blue.\n\n12\n00:00:51.023 --> 00:00:53.646\nDo you know how warm it is now?\n\n13\n00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:59.623\nI just looked at my phone. It is twenty-one degrees.\n\n14\n00:00:59.646 --> 00:01:03.312\nThat warm already? That really feels like spring.\n\n15\n00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:07.736\nYes, or even the beginning of summer!\n\n16\n00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.713\nWhere are you heading?\n\n17\n00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:13.580\nI am walking to the market to buy fruit.\n\n18\n00:01:13.602 --> 00:01:16.180\nMay I walk with you for a bit?\n\n19\n00:01:16.202 --> 00:01:18.847\nYes, nice! Come along.\n\n20\n00:01:18.913 --> 00:01:21.802\nWalking in the sun is always nice.\n\n21\n00:01:21.869 --> 00:01:24.313\nAre you actually wearing a jacket?\n\n22\n00:01:24.358 --> 00:01:28.691\nYes, but it is actually too warm for this jacket.\n\n23\n00:01:28.758 --> 00:01:32.736\nI am only wearing a cardigan. That is enough.\n\n24\n00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.758\nSensible. I am going to take off my jacket.\n\n25\n00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.091\nThat is a good idea.\n\n26\n00:01:39.113 --> 00:01:42.980\nHow was the weather at your place last night?\n\n27\n00:01:43.024 --> 00:01:48.737\nThen it stormed a little bit. Did you see that strong wind?\n\n28\n00:01:48.781 --> 00:01:53.870\nYes, the branches of the trees were blowing back and forth a lot.\n\n29\n00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:57.426\nAnd there was also a lot of condensation on the windows.\n\n30\n00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.181\nCold and wet. What a difference compared to today!\n\n31\n00:02:01.226 --> 00:02:05.003\nThe Netherlands really has very changeable weather.\n\n32\n00:02:05.048 --> 00:02:10.626\nThat is true. Nothing is as changeable as the weather here.\n\n33\n00:02:10.692 --> 00:02:13.581\nSometimes four seasons in one day!\n\n34\n00:02:13.626 --> 00:02:17.892\nHaha, exactly! This morning it was still very chilly.\n\n35\n00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:22.003\nYes, around eight o'clock it was only nine degrees.\n\n36\n00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:25.537\nThere was even dew on the grass.\n\n37\n00:02:25.581 --> 00:02:29.381\nBut now the temperature has risen quickly.\n\n38\n00:02:29.403 --> 00:02:32.893\nLook, there is the ice cream shop on the corner.\n\n39\n00:02:32.982 --> 00:02:35.360\nShall we get an ice cream?\n\n40\n00:02:35.538 --> 00:02:39.360\nDelicious! With this weather, an ice cream fits perfectly.\n\n41\n00:02:39.382 --> 00:02:41.671\nWhich flavour do you want?\n\n42\n00:02:41.738 --> 00:02:46.627\nI will take one scoop of strawberry and one scoop of lemon.\n\n43\n00:02:46.827 --> 00:02:52.382\nVery refreshing! I will take chocolate and vanilla.\n\n44\n00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:56.116\nLet's sit on that bench in the sun.\n\n45\n00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.071\nGreat plan.\n\n46\n00:02:58.116 --> 00:03:00.493\nWell, this ice cream tastes good.\n\n47\n00:03:00.516 --> 00:03:05.538\nMy ice cream too. Really enjoying it on the bench like this.\n\n48\n00:03:05.604 --> 00:03:08.893\nPeople watching on the street is also fun.\n\n49\n00:03:08.982 --> 00:03:12.760\nEveryone immediately looks much happier.\n\n50\n00:03:12.804 --> 00:03:15.939\nCertainly, the sun makes everyone happy.\n\n51\n00:03:15.983 --> 00:03:21.072\nIn winter everyone is always so rushed and cold.\n\n52\n00:03:21.161 --> 00:03:23.361\nDo you like winter?\n\n53\n00:03:23.406 --> 00:03:28.383\nNo, not really. I don't like dark days.\n\n54\n00:03:28.472 --> 00:03:33.894\nMe neither. I prefer long, warm days.\n\n55\n00:03:33.917 --> 00:03:36.806\nWhich season do you like best?\n\n56\n00:03:36.828 --> 00:03:42.606\nSummer! Then you can go to the beach and sit outside late.\n\n57\n00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:47.694\nI sometimes think autumn is pretty too when the leaves change color.\n\n58\n00:03:47.806 --> 00:03:52.628\nYes, but all that rain in autumn is less fun.\n\n59\n00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:58.184\nThat's true. Rain is annoying when you have to cycle.\n\n60\n00:03:58.229 --> 00:04:01.651\nDo you always have rain gear with you?\n\n61\n00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:05.762\nIn my bag I always have a small umbrella.\n\n62\n00:04:05.807 --> 00:04:11.407\nThat is smart. I almost always forget my umbrella.\n\n63\n00:04:11.496 --> 00:04:14.096\nAnd then you get soaked!\n\n64\n00:04:14.162 --> 00:04:17.296\nYes, unfortunately so. Just last week!\n\n65\n00:04:17.362 --> 00:04:20.696\nOh dear, when it hailed so hard?\n\n66\n00:04:20.784 --> 00:04:27.851\nYes! Large hailstones. My head almost hurt from it.\n\n67\n00:04:27.896 --> 00:04:33.407\nHail is not nice. Just give me this beautiful sun.\n\n68\n00:04:33.429 --> 00:04:36.362\nLook at the sky over there.\n\n69\n00:04:36.407 --> 00:04:38.073\nWhere do you mean?\n\n70\n00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:42.697\nIn the west. Dark clouds are approaching there.\n\n71\n00:04:42.786 --> 00:04:46.963\nOh yes! Those look quite grey.\n\n72\n00:04:47.008 --> 00:04:49.497\nDo you think it is going to rain?\n\n73\n00:04:49.563 --> 00:04:52.986\nLet me check Buienradar for a second.\n\n74\n00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:54.941\nWhat does the app say?\n\n75\n00:04:54.986 --> 00:04:59.497\nWait, it's loading... Ah, here it says.\n\n76\n00:04:59.586 --> 00:05:02.252\nAnd? Will it stay dry?\n\n77\n00:05:02.297 --> 00:05:07.497\nNo, in half an hour a small rain shower is coming.\n\n78\n00:05:07.563 --> 00:05:10.830\nA pity! Just when it was so nice.\n\n79\n00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:13.586\nIt is only a short shower, you know.\n\n80\n00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:15.852\nWill it cool down much afterwards?\n\n81\n00:05:15.919 --> 00:05:20.786\nIt says the temperature drops to seventeen degrees.\n\n82\n00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:24.787\nThat's not too bad, but it is less warm.\n\n83\n00:05:24.853 --> 00:05:29.053\nDo you see that gust of wind? The wind is picking up.\n\n84\n00:05:29.142 --> 00:05:32.787\nYes, the leaves on the street are blowing away.\n\n85\n00:05:32.831 --> 00:05:36.076\nMy ice cream is almost finished, luckily.\n\n86\n00:05:36.276 --> 00:05:39.809\nMine too. Shall we walk again?\n\n87\n00:05:39.876 --> 00:05:44.253\nGood idea. Where do you actually have to go?\n\n88\n00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.031\nI have to go to the pharmacy and then home.\n\n89\n00:05:48.098 --> 00:05:50.742\nIs the pharmacy near here?\n\n90\n00:05:50.898 --> 00:05:54.564\nYes, at the end of this street.\n\n91\n00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:57.742\nThen I'll walk with you for a bit longer.\n\n92\n00:05:57.787 --> 00:06:02.031\nNice! The cloud is coming this way fast though.\n\n93\n00:06:02.053 --> 00:06:06.410\nThe sun has completely disappeared behind that cloud now.\n\n94\n00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:10.610\nIt immediately becomes a bit colder without the sun.\n\n95\n00:06:10.654 --> 00:06:14.188\nYes, strange how fast that can change.\n\n96\n00:06:14.254 --> 00:06:16.810\nI'm putting my jacket back on.\n\n97\n00:06:16.877 --> 00:06:20.166\nI am pulling my cardigan tighter shut.\n\n98\n00:06:20.232 --> 00:06:22.254\nDid you feel a drop?\n\n99\n00:06:22.321 --> 00:06:26.966\nYes! I felt a big drop on my arm.\n\n100\n00:06:27.032 --> 00:06:29.432\nAnd there falls another one!\n\n101\n00:06:29.454 --> 00:06:35.877\nThe rain is starting already. Faster than Buienradar said!\n\n102\n00:06:35.899 --> 00:06:39.966\nTypical! The app isn't always right either.\n\n103\n00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:43.099\nLuckily there is the pharmacy already.\n\n104\n00:06:43.143 --> 00:06:46.321\nAre you coming inside with me to shelter?\n\n105\n00:06:46.366 --> 00:06:53.611\nNo, I really must hurry to the supermarket before the big shower breaks loose.\n\n106\n00:06:53.656 --> 00:06:56.211\nDo you have an umbrella with you?\n\n107\n00:06:56.278 --> 00:07:00.856\nYes, luckily I do! I'm taking it out of my bag now.\n\n108\n00:07:00.878 --> 00:07:04.700\nVery good. Then you will stay nice and dry.\n\n109\n00:07:04.744 --> 00:07:08.989\nTake care of yourself and good luck at the pharmacy!\n\n110\n00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:13.811\nThank you, Sanne. Nice talking to you!\n\n111\n00:07:13.878 --> 00:07:17.633\nYes, I thought so too! See you again soon.\n\n112\n00:07:17.656 --> 00:07:20.544\nGoodbye and have a nice day!\n\n113\n00:07:20.589 --> 00:07:23.456\nThank you, you too! Bye!\n\n114\n00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.767\nBye bye!\n
\.
COPY public.lesson_transcript (id, lesson_id, speaker, line_nl, line_en, order_index) FROM stdin;
41571	asking_directions	Speaker1	Pardon, mag ik u iets vragen?	Excuse me, may I ask you something?	0
41572	asking_directions	Speaker2	Ja hoor, natuurlijk. Wat kan ik voor u doen?	Yes of course, what can I do for you?	1
41573	asking_directions	Speaker1	Ik zoek het station. Weet u waar dat is?	I am looking for the station. Do you know where that is?	2
41574	asking_directions	Speaker2	Ja, dat is niet zo ver hier vandaan.	Yes, that is not very far from here.	3
41575	asking_directions	Speaker1	Fijn om te horen. Hoe kom ik daar?	Glad to hear. How do I get there?	4
41576	asking_directions	Speaker2	U loopt eerst deze straat helemaal uit.	You walk straight down this street first.	5
41577	asking_directions	Speaker1	Tot aan het grote kruispunt?	Up to the big intersection?	6
41578	asking_directions	Speaker2	Nee, al eerder, bij de rode brievenbus.	No, earlier than that, by the red mailbox.	7
41579	asking_directions	Speaker1	Ah, bij de brievenbus. En dan?	Ah, by the mailbox. And then?	8
41580	asking_directions	Speaker2	Dan gaat u naar links.	Then you go left.	9
41581	asking_directions	Speaker1	Naar links bij de brievenbus. Begrepen.	To the left at the mailbox. Understood.	10
41582	asking_directions	Speaker2	Daarna loopt u over de brug.	After that you walk across the bridge.	11
41583	asking_directions	Speaker1	Is er een rivier hier dichtbij?	Is there a river nearby here?	12
41584	asking_directions	Speaker2	Ja, een kleine gracht met bootjes.	Yes, a small canal with boats.	13
41585	asking_directions	Speaker1	Leuk! En na de brug?	Nice! And after the bridge?	14
41586	asking_directions	Speaker2	Dan ziet u meteen het grote plein.	Then you immediately see the big square.	15
41587	asking_directions	Speaker1	Het plein met de grote fontein?	The square with the large fountain?	16
41588	asking_directions	Speaker2	Nee, het plein met de hoge toren.	No, the square with the high tower.	17
41589	asking_directions	Speaker1	Ah, de marktplaats met de oude kerk.	Ah, the market square with the old church.	18
41590	asking_directions	Speaker2	Precies! Dat is hem.	Exactly! That's the one.	19
41591	asking_directions	Speaker1	En het station is daar vlakbij?	And the station is close by there?	20
41592	asking_directions	Speaker2	Ja, achter de kerk is de ingang.	Yes, behind the church is the entrance.	21
