42376	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Hello everyone! Welcome to today's Dutch lesson.		0
42377	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Today, we are learning five essential Dutch conjunctions.		1
42378	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Conjunctions are small words that connect ideas, sentences, or items.		2
42379	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	They make your speech flow smoothly and naturally.		3
42380	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	We will learn five very common words today.		4
42381	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	These words are EN, MAAR, OF, WANT, and DUS.		5
42382	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	You will hear each word used in clear, simple sentences.		6
42383	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Listen carefully to how they connect words together.		7
42384	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Are you ready to begin?		8
