42386	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Let's begin!		10
42387	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Our first word is EN, which means AND in English.		11
42388	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	EN is used to join two things, people, or actions.		12
42389	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Let's listen to three simple sentences with EN.		13
42390	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Ik drink koffie en thee.		14
