42396	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Great job! Remember: EN means AND.		20
42397	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Our second word is MAAR, which means BUT.		21
42398	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	MAAR shows a contrast or a difference between two ideas.		22
