42416	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Very good! Remember: OF means OR.		40
42417	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	Our fourth word is WANT, which means BECAUSE.		41
42418	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	WANT gives a reason for something.		42
42419	cw_conjunctions_basic	Speaker1	In Dutch, the word order stays normal after WANT.		43
