ker1: Ik vier feest in december. Speaker1: "I celebrate in December." Speaker1: Let's review all the months. Speaker1: [giggles] Vandaag leerden we: januari, februari, Speaker1: maart, april, mei, juni, Speaker1: juli, augustus, september, oktober, Speaker1: november en december. Speaker1: Excellent work today! Speaker1: You did a great job! Speaker1: Practice these words every day. Speaker1: [whispers] Tot de volgende keer! Speaker1: "Until next time!"	5	f	\N	2026-08-18 18:51:29.654518+00
