e learned: Speaker1: Vandaag leerden we want en omdat. Speaker1: Today we learned want and omdat. Speaker1: Use want for normal order. Speaker1: Use omdat for verb at the end. Speaker1: Tot de volgende keer! Speaker1: Until next time!	18	f	\N	2026-08-18 18:51:29.654518+00
